  ('zcrm_1579374000025308023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362116', 'Natasha Thompson', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation request submitted to ASi &amp; Sedera.  Billing cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-17 11:56:19', '2018-10-17 11:56:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025294055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351173', 'Marsha Huber', NULL, 'she called in(1:18) for all of the same reasons and answers that Wendy just listed here below.  Patti sent receipts as requested. and I called her back to let her know the $1,000 IUA .- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-17 11:54:21', '2018-10-17 11:54:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025294050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809288', 'Therese McCarthy', NULL, 'Therese called in for help with preventative care questions, how to find a doctor.  I sent the multi plan link to her, as well as the how to present your mec e-mail. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-17 11:47:13', '2018-10-17 11:47:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025294045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351173', 'Marsha Huber', NULL, '10-17-18 Wanted her hand held for doing her annual wellness visit and blood work today and tomorrow with Dr. Dughi in Boulder. Explained Dr. has to code all aspects as wellness for there to be no cost to her and to show her ASi card at the visit. She also needs her receipts resent since Aug bc not receiving them anymore. Was considering the $500 IUA but likely will stick with $1000/$249 that she''s currently paying.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-17 11:43:59', '2018-10-17 11:43:59'),
