  ('zcrm_1579374000025294029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023740081', 'James Newpower', NULL, 'James called to ask questions about his plan, I answered them all as well as sent a preventative care e-mail as well as a welcome call scheduler. He also wants 2 more MEC cards for his college aged kids.  Address the same as his. PLEASE READ AND TAKE NOTE THAT HE MENTIONED THAT HIS SON HURT HIS SHOULDER AND THAT AFTER HIS DOCTOR - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-17 10:59:07', '2018-10-17 11:18:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025290068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023785008', 'Robbin Rybitski', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-17 10:54:22', '2018-10-17 10:54:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025294024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023785008', 'Robbin Rybitski', NULL, 'Robbin called in wanting to know when she was going to receive her MEC cards.  I told her that we would send her a PDF version of them and told her that she should be getting the hard copies any day now. I also told her that her welcome call would give her better understanding about her program. I asked if she had the time to do it and had Vanessa call her back right away. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-17 10:42:38', '2018-10-17 10:42:38'),
