  ('zcrm_1579374000025294016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283259', 'Julie Oldham', NULL, '10-17-18 Choosing the PSDHC with the Assoc so she doesn''t have to refer new members. Not comfortable with that part even though she''s referring her x-husband and biz manager. Enrolling right now for her and 2 kids. Choosing the $1000 IUA / $590 mo. Wants me to call the others to let them discuss as well. They are very interested.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-17 10:22:50', '2018-10-17 10:28:06'),
