  ('zcrm_1579374000025294003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330090', 'Michelle Preuss', NULL, 'called in to speak with Ron so that she can enroll online.  I told her that he was in a meeting and that he would get back to her later on in the day.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-17 08:39:40', '2018-10-17 08:40:13'),
