  ('zcrm_1579374000025264003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330254', 'Debra Rice', NULL, '10-16-18 Deb is paying $408 to Freedom Life now but only catastrophic. She''s 60 and only gets a skin check and annual physicals. She will wait the requested 3 months to do so. She does all of her health stuff alternatively if she ever has an issue. No meds, super healthy, self-employed. Will look over and we revisit on Thursday for enrollment if she''s ready.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-16 17:39:13', '2018-10-16 17:39:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025229013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006025057', 'Carolyn (Livingston) Ufford', NULL, 'called in to cancel, I guided her to the cancellation form as well as told her to fill it out by the end of the week. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-16 14:20:44', '2018-10-16 14:20:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025221023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474163', 'Roy Cranman', NULL, 'John K gave me a lead he received from Roy.  Roy was calling on behalf of his son.  His son has 2 employees that we wants to sign up on the Partially Self Directed plan.  I gave him the pricing for that.  He is enrolling using our Association platform.  He know his stuff about MCS and our Association platform.  He wants to do a list bill I instructed him to send Jennie an email with the members name to bill as a group.  His son plans to deduct the MEC pre-tax and open a company HSA plan for the 2 new members.  His son and wife are covered now I believe.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-10-16 13:52:23', '2018-10-16 13:52:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025242013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025217126', 'Joseph Taylor', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 18-29 Self Directed', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-16 13:52:10', '2018-10-16 13:52:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025229008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011307064', 'Thomas White-O''Connor', NULL, 'Tom called in to ask if the flu and shingles vaccines were covered by his MEC, I told him that yes they were, as long as they are coded as preventive.  I also told him to find a pharmacy or GP in network to have them done so that he wouldn''t have any out of pocket expense.   He thanked me for all of the help.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-16 13:52:01', '2018-10-16 13:52:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025256003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023592136', 'Raymond Ellason', NULL, 'There was a discrepancy in the information the member received with his RCI card. RCI is aware and member was informed we are working on resolving the issue.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-10-16 13:38:26', '2018-10-16 13:38:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025242008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025217067', 'Skylir Bryant', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 18-29 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-16 13:21:24', '2018-10-16 13:21:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025221013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023837032', 'Walker Logan', NULL, 'Jennie informed me today that Brett''s payment was declined again.  I called and got VM to call me.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-10-16 13:20:55', '2018-10-16 13:20:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025242003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025217005', 'Kimberly Carpenter', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-16 12:18:03', '2018-10-16 12:18:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025221008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740202', 'Joshua Wilson', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-16 11:23:33', '2018-10-16 11:23:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025229003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819541', 'Jorge Usabiaga', NULL, 'Zosza called in because new employment was offering them health insurance.   I sent a cancellation form.  She wanted to know how things would play out if they wanted to come back to us because, she didn''t know how long this job would last for.  She asked about if any of their pre existing conditions would have to start back at 0 if they wanted to re-enroll and I told her that yes, they would. - you could really tell that she liked our plan quite a bit. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-16 11:16:41', '2018-10-16 11:16:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025221003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809171', 'Joseph Ayers', NULL, 'Spoke to member he said he read over his plan that he said he really does not need a welcome call. I again explain the importance of the call. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call.
Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-16 10:31:57', '2018-10-16 10:31:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025186048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017330183', 'Gregory Brooks', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-16 10:17:33', '2018-10-16 10:17:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025186043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018505034', 'Mary Sundblom', NULL, 'Member''s mailbox is full. Not able to leave a message. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-16 10:12:11', '2018-10-16 10:12:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025180018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014539007', 'Kris Srnka', NULL, 'Kris called because her doctor, at the time of her usual annual visit, noticed that she had an irregular heart beat.   Her Dr. is recommending an echo- the facility said that they would give her a cash discounted price of $313, I told her that I would do some research on this end to try to find a better price.  She has no history of heart issues or any symptoms, I told her that she would simply present herself as a self pay patient and to make sure that she asked for a detailed bill in the event that this turns into a shareable need with Sedera.  After my search or echo''s in her area, I found out that her clinic gave her a very fair price.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-16 10:04:20', '2018-10-16 10:04:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025180013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881658', 'James Lynch', NULL, 'James called in for advice in getting preventative care blood work done.  I explained it all as well as found labcorp''s in his area that are in the PHCS network. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-16 09:46:42', '2018-10-16 09:46:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025180008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679079', 'Bonnie Kern', NULL, 'Bonnie called in for help finding a gastro facility and doctors.  I helped her find both doctors that she was interested in, and confirmed that they were at the facility she wanted to use.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-16 09:44:10', '2018-10-16 09:44:10'),
