  ('zcrm_1579374000025087020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447059', 'Florie Glusman', NULL, 'I spoke with Dania about this- she says that it will be a shareable need based of of 8.B. 20 in the Sedera guidelines.  I spoke with Florie with instructions on how to proceed.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-15 13:29:34', '2018-10-15 13:29:34'),
