  ('zcrm_1579374000025087015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819039', 'Matthew VerMilyea', NULL, 'Lucy said that she sees a charge of $65 on her patient portal concerning her kids and their flu shots. I told her to ask the office if they even have submitted it to Apex, and if not, if they could make sure everything is coded as preventative and resubmit.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-15 11:11:02', '2018-10-15 11:11:02'),
