  ('zcrm_1579374000025107008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008640101', 'Carl Brown', 'ZOHO SalesIQ chat with MPB Concierge', 'Visit ID : 384 
Question : Can you tell me when I signed up with you?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2018-10-15 08:41:29', '2018-10-15 08:41:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025087005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447059', 'Florie Glusman', NULL, '-from ticket created today- Florie called in this morning asking if a bilateral mri would be covered by Sedera- because it really wasn''t preventative but it wasn''t really due to an injury/illness either.  She said that she needs to be super careful because her mother had breast cancer and she herself has had two papyloma''s removed from R breast.  I told her that what I COULD do to help her is to find the best cost for it in her area- she declined stating that she wouldn''t feel safe going anywhere else, that she had been going there for 20 years.  I told her that this most likely will not be covered, she said that she can only have the test done at around the cost of her $500 IUA.  I told her that I would ask John, but that the answer would most likely be no. I went over what Sedera sees as pre-existing, I am only opening this ticket in light of Lori Altman''s case, and the fact that there is some push back with the client. This client wants to get an answer quickly because she has the test scheduled for Thursday - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-15 08:11:41', '2018-10-15 08:11:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025114008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086178', 'Kristine Smith', NULL, 'Member called and made payment.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-10-15 07:18:36', '2018-10-15 07:27:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025114003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086178', 'Kristine Smith', NULL, 'Emailed final payment request.  This member is pending cancellation due to non-payment.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-10-15 07:00:08', '2018-10-15 07:00:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025053051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017307054', 'Michael Brooks', NULL, 'Michael called for prescription assistance for his son-  the line dropped,  I sent him an e-mail containing a goodrx link, and asked that he give us his wife''s number so we could reach her in times like these- where he yelled and said "my clients are here, I gotta go, take care of my wife Kelly"- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-12 15:10:37', '2018-10-12 15:10:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025053046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610002', 'Deborah Vaughan', NULL, 'a facility called us to get proof of insurance for the mammogram that Deborah had scheduled. I explained that she should be calling APEX- not realizing that she was someone that was in the process of switching to RCI- so a lot of confusion of course, Patti and I got to the root of the problem, Deborah ended up cancelling her appointment until things settle. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-12 14:54:34', '2018-10-12 14:54:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025056013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025055122', 'Mark Wallman', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1500 IUA 50-59 Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-12 12:41:56', '2018-10-12 12:41:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025095003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025055122', 'Mark Wallman', NULL, '10-12-18 He and wife lost coverage with UHC bc their payment didn''t go through and UHC wouldn''t do anything about it. So, they''ve been doing STM for last bunch of months. They are both healthy, no meds, no tobacco, no drugs. Mark goes to PCP every 4 months just for a check up to find anything before it''s a bigger problem but not looking for anything in particular, just getting older and wants to be careful. Wife goes about 2x per year to wellness dr. They like the ReDirect option with the $0 co-pay for PCP and cost was not much higher at $625 instead of $574 with the $1500 IUA.  Enrolling right now. Jackie 51 and mark 57.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-12 11:41:51', '2018-10-12 11:42:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025053041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862262', 'Pete Scifo', NULL, 'Pete''s wife called in to switch payment info for Pete. I showed her where to find the form.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-12 11:33:23', '2018-10-12 11:33:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025053036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521138', 'Jamie Solow', NULL, 'Spent  20 min trying to help him figure out and use the  multiplan site. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-12 11:26:29', '2018-10-12 11:26:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025053031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521138', 'Jamie Solow', NULL, 'Jamie called in to let us know that he finally got his ASI card, I went over a ton of preventative care info, as well as sent him many e-mails to help him along.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-12 11:07:57', '2018-10-12 11:07:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025053026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695112', 'Donovan Kahler', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-12 10:58:54', '2018-10-12 10:58:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000025053021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659573', 'Robin Bernhard', NULL, 'Robin called because she wanted to know how to submit her emergency room bills.  I gave her all the contact info, plus e-mailed how to submit a need letter out. She said she had an "accident"  and hurt her back.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-12 10:55:15', '2018-10-12 10:55:15'),
