  ('zcrm_1579374000024954003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023592190', 'Irene Evans', NULL, 'ok, Irene called again about prescription medications- completely confused about everything 2 min after she finished her welcome call. she said that she thought she needed to call us to see a doctor so that she can get a prescription renewed.  I believe she went over this three times and I answered 3 times the same. I told her to call redirect for a doctor appointment and that we would be happy to help price out her medications as soon as she has the new script. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-11 09:59:33', '2018-10-11 09:59:33'),
