  ('zcrm_1579374000024845068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474018', 'Marcia Maunder', NULL, 'Received correspondence from ASi that they received MEC cards back for bad address.  I left VM for Marcia asking if she had an address change and to respond via email it she did.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-10 14:08:25', '2018-10-10 14:08:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024845063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024892055', 'Elizabeth Neumann', NULL, '10-10-18 Libby came via Sally and Pete Hammond but they aren''t members yet. They told her to put April Porterfield down. She doesn''t really know them but I told her to go ahead and put her name on the application. Libby is 59, no tobacco. She has bi-polar and recognizes that is pre-x and she is responsible for all costs including meds. She also had melanoma 14 years ago. Typically after 10 years they say it shouldn''t come back. She knows that if it''s part of old diagnosis then it is pre-x. She''s ok with that bc not likely. She takes adderall and can get it cheaper from Canada if need be. She is choosing the co-pay network plan bc sees doctors about 3x per year, 1x dermatologist Dr. Kallgren, 1x PCP, 1x ophthalmologist. Enrolling right now for the $1500 IUA / $368. Dr. Hillary Browne and Dr. Kallgren are both in-network.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-10 13:50:50', '2018-10-10 13:50:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024865064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830450', 'Debbie Eubanks', NULL, 'Felicia called in with Debbie Eubanks to get some assistance with setting up a HSA bank account as well as getting Teladoc situated.   - I sent them both e-mails for both. Praise Report- Debbie voiced how incredibly grateful she was that she ran into Wendy and then got to know us here at the office- she said that we helped her save at least $2500 for the chronic medications she is on. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-10 13:46:07', '2018-10-10 13:46:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024865059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243070', 'Felicia Balderston', NULL, 'Felicia called in with Debbie Eubanks to get some assistance with setting up a HSA bank account as well as getting Teladoc situated.   - I sent them both e-mails for both. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-10 13:43:46', '2018-10-10 13:43:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024845058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165296', 'Lara Vazquez', NULL, '10-10-18 Sounds like Lara and Gil divorced bc Lara is asking if she can add her fiance to membership. Called her back and told her he will have to have his own membership until married. Told her to connect us and I will help him and possibly share our new option with him since she''s on LHS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-10 12:29:30', '2018-10-10 12:29:30'),
