  ('zcrm_1579374000024845043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023008066', 'Nathan Wilson', NULL, 'Member emailed me as she had not received any email asked me to check in this again, I advised her that email had just gone out and that mailer went out 10/9.  Advised him of the MEC card timeline.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-10 09:07:48', '2018-10-10 09:07:48'),
