  ('zcrm_1579374000024887008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004940015', 'Jay Wetzler', NULL, 'Member called because he cancelled LHS sometime in the beginning of 2017.  We have been charging him.  I cancelled him and am going to refund him for 4 months.  Will notify Analisa and Wendy of the chargeback.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-10-10 08:53:05', '2018-10-10 08:53:05'),
