  ('zcrm_1579374000024865049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086236', 'Reginald Garrett', NULL, 'Reginald came in today to just check in and make sure that his address was up to date, ask how to find a primary care doctor in the area, as well as to ask if his daughter''s mother can call if ever she has a question about her daughter''s plan.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-10 08:42:59', '2018-10-10 08:42:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024865044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521683', 'Scott Hershman', NULL, '10/04/18  I have no clue how a note from the 4th is missing- but it is,  I  want to follow up with Scott today about his neck/x-rays and migraines that he spoke to me about last week.  He sounded like he really needed some assistance, and sounded like he was in a lot of pain.  What he had told me was that at his yearly physical the doctor ended up taking xrays of his neck and upper back and diagnosed him with osteo- arthritis , he told him that it was the reason for the migraines he has been having- I went over all injury and illness protocol- I gave him 2nd MD''s info and e-mail, and I gave him Sedera''s contact info with instructions to let them know everything that he had told me and to ask if this would be a sharable need.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-10 08:29:43', '2018-10-10 08:29:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024865039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033175', 'Jean Aull', NULL, 'Jean called from her primary physicians office and she wanted to know everything that is included, or covered, by her ASI card.  I verified that her Dr was in network,  I sent out and explained the preventative provider e-mail ans well as went over the attachment.  I also sent her my new "How do I present my MEC" template. I searched for a long time looking for the local breast center in her area that she wants to have her mamogram done at.  I could not find it, but told her to give me a call as soon as she is sure of the exact name.  Bethesda Hospital IS in network- I just did not see the name of the breast center listed.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-10 08:19:06', '2018-10-10 08:19:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024887003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005914493', 'Gary Viano', NULL, 'Member disputed the 7/5/18 charge to his CC with qualpay.  Will email Liz to let know that commission associated with the chargeback.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-10-10 07:28:38', '2018-10-10 07:28:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024865029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330019', 'Carly Hayes', NULL, '10-9-18 She''s 26 and turning into 27. Works for a salon who pays for a DPC Olive Health. She''s in grad school for next year or 2. She has Hashimotos and PCOS/thyroid issue. She goes to holistic dr. for Hoshimotos and pay out of pocket for it already. She doesn''t want to be pumped with prescriptions and it''s working reasonably well. She knows this is all Pre-X and she''s responsible for any cost associated with these. She also visits specialist 2x year and cost is around $175 per visit. She will have to pay for those. She''s deciding if this makes sense. She also wants to know price without MEC for DPC to plan. She needs MEC+ for min. of one more month to remain compliant for 2018.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-09 16:57:00', '2018-10-09 16:57:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024873013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447476', 'Mia Fanali-Skowronski', NULL, 'I am getting a complaint from Mia... "I''m also looking at other plans. My thermography was not covered and I was told it would be. I''ve gotten no help from Sedera or MPowering."', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-10-09 16:35:47', '2018-10-09 16:35:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024868023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740251', 'Evan Altman', NULL, 'Lori called, upset about the way the sedera app worked, that she hadn''t heard from John for 3 weeks ( I assured her that he was working very hard for her behind the scenes), upset that she got another doctor bill $532 (for reading images) and supplements she wants to know if she can get them covered.- I spoke with John, and have left a message with Dania so that I can go over what John wants me too so we can wrap all of this up.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-09 14:38:03', '2018-10-09 14:38:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024845033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656110', 'Marjorie Hansen', NULL, 'Per John &amp; Kelly this member''s DOB was incorrect with ASi.  I submitted to ASi eligibility and received return mail that it was updated in their system.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-09 14:27:07', '2018-10-09 14:27:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024868018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656110', 'Marjorie Hansen', NULL, 'Patti contacted ASI and fixed the birth date in their system.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-09 14:26:28', '2018-10-09 14:26:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024831041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509010', 'Mary Kenyon', NULL, 'Member called regarding how to file a need with Sedera. Gave her the link and emailed her the instructional video', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-10-09 14:15:48', '2018-10-09 14:15:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024831036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015979001', 'Janice Wilson', NULL, 'Spoke with member regarding how the plan works and how to proceed with preventative care versus injury/illness. Sent a provider list per her request and encouraged her to book another Welcome call. Member declined to do that.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-10-09 13:48:56', '2018-10-09 13:48:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024868013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243389', 'Edward Seymour', NULL, 'Edward was in the hospital all weekend due to shortness of breath- the symptoms were such that they put her through rigorous testing to make sure that her heart was ok.  She was confused about how to handle being in an er so she gave them her ASI card.   I explained to her that she needed to speak with Sedera as well as upload detailed/coded medical bills to app.sedera.com -  she had a problem getting a hold of Sedera so I transferred her call to LaShanda. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-09 13:48:23', '2018-10-09 13:48:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024831031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016570002', 'Michael Wisner', NULL, 'Sent member the provider list per his request.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-10-09 13:44:52', '2018-10-09 13:44:52'),
