  ('zcrm_1579374000024868008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656110', 'Marjorie Hansen', NULL, 'I called ASi and spoke to Karine on Marjorie''s behalf,   I also spoke with Marjorie, who sent me the correct detailed bill that I forwarded and to Karine.  They had the wrong birth date,  I brought that to Patti''s attention.-  KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-09 12:40:58', '2018-10-09 12:40:58'),
