  ('zcrm_1579374000024865024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844131', 'Adam Nolan', NULL, '10-9-18 Enrolled in MPB Group $1000 IUA. Didn''t like answering the Lifestyle Profile questions but he is psyched to get paid to complete health assessment... Application complete.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-09 12:39:42', '2018-10-09 12:39:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024873008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610440', 'Kreston Rohrig', NULL, 'Spoke Kreston... he is a very nice gentleman that spoke highly of us. I asked him to leave a review and he said that he would. His wife is the primary on the account so he does not need to complete the HRA but Sent him HRA just case.', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-10-09 12:26:23', '2018-10-09 12:26:23'),
