  ('zcrm_1579374000024868003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033386', 'Ruth Charles', NULL, 'The doctor that I had helped to nominate to the PHSC network last month is still not on the list.  Ruth got upset but then calmed down, it especially made her happy that I found the Park Nicollet Women''s Service in the PHCS plan. She is going to call her Doctors office on her own. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-09 11:26:10', '2018-10-09 11:26:10'),
