  ('zcrm_1579374000024806036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844131', 'Adam Nolan', NULL, '10-5-18 Lives in Englewood and resigned after 4 1/2 yrs. two weeks ago. He''s healthy, no meds, no drugs and possibly going to remain working independently. Came via Kristopher and Sarah Hall and can join MPB Group. Wants to enroll in $1000 IUA/ $249. Appt tomorrow to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-08 17:53:55', '2018-10-08 17:53:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024806031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165304', 'Michael Garino', NULL, '10-8-18 He''s curious to know if he should stay with LHS or switch. His membership renewal is Dec. 1st and he got some notice that he''s up for renewal soon. He had some blood work done and is waiting for the results to come back in the next few days. We will revisit the conversation then. If all clear, I''ll explain HEP/Assoc option. He''s 49 this year so price should still be close to LHS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-08 17:02:29', '2018-10-08 17:02:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024806026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283259', 'Julie Oldham', NULL, '10-8-18 Looking at this instead of their small group of 3 trad insurance with her x-husband and biz manager. Julie will include her 2 kids, one is 16 and one is 13 and Julie is 50. Julie''s ex is 51 and biz manager 30 ish. They are all healthy, no pre-x. Live in Carbondale and happy to use HSA. Also wants to understand tax implications and will ask accountant. She will discuss this with her x and biz partner. She was referred in so can join MPB Group. But, she''s also curious about the Assoc membership in case someone isn''t comfortable with the referral aspect or needs an upgraded plan for any reason. Sent her both MPB group and PSDHC. She will let me know after they''ve reviewed it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-08 16:47:15', '2018-10-08 16:47:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024795023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012416075', 'Katherine Richardson', NULL, 'Katherine called in stating that the back of the APEX card was not sent to her through the PDF file, only the front and she needed to know where her Dr could submit lab work- to.  I called APEX myself and got the address.  I spoke with Hannah, very nice.  I put the address in the CRM for future use.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-08 14:59:29', '2018-10-08 14:59:29'),
