  ('zcrm_1579374000024806018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012416075', 'Katherine Richardson', NULL, '10-8-18 We are waiting for temp card from APEX for Kate''s outstanding wellness visits. She''s part of APEX bc she''s a DPC member and all MPB DPC Group members will be with Apex who is now using RCI as TPA. John submitted request for Apex card. Kelly asked ASi for temp card but they are no longer part of her membership as of March 2018, so ASi keeps telling us she''s been cancelled, which is accurate. Awaiting temp card for Apex for her to proceed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-08 13:05:55', '2018-10-08 13:07:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024815016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784709', 'Paul Knaysi', NULL, 'Requested Proof of DPC frm Wendy for this member Sedera will need.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-08 13:05:07', '2018-10-08 13:05:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024815008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784641', 'Amy Loseke', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 IUA 40-49 Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-08 12:40:44', '2018-10-08 12:45:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024795018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881409', 'Kimberly Johnson', NULL, 'Kim called in to ask if flu vax were covered or not- i told her that as long as the vax were coded as preventative that she would be fine.  I suggested that they go back to her primary dr rather than drugstore pharmacy because then she would know for sure that they administered in network. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-08 12:30:03', '2018-10-08 12:30:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024815003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784600', 'Jenifer Meller', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 30-39 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-08 12:26:01', '2018-10-08 12:26:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024806013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784709', 'Paul Knaysi', NULL, '10-8-18 Enrolling now for $1000/$638. Told him he can eliminate the MEC+ for Nov and Dec bc he''s had compliant solution for 10 months of the year already. He''s excited to save even more $! Applying now and will put note in notes section to eliminate MEC+.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-08 12:14:15', '2018-10-08 12:14:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024806008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844090', 'Valerie Yaw', NULL, '10-8-18 Val is Lindsay''s sister, she has family of 4, healthy, no pre-x, paying $1800 for great plan with low ded, but exploring this. After conversation she wishes they called me a long time ago. She''s going to enroll right now. We just ran out of time. They each have season allergies and take OTC Zyrtec. Other visits is usually for strep or sinus infections. Now super excited to call Teledoc to avoid going to dr. Enrolling on her own right now. Go SS and checking account and health info from her husband. Likely to choose the $1000/$638.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-08 12:02:03', '2018-10-08 12:02:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024795013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013095005', 'Janina Janes', NULL, 'Janina called to have an understanding on how to present herself as well as how to present her card.  She said that she had 3 different appointments made with 3 different doctors scheduled for the end of the month.  I asked her what each doctor appointment was for.  she mentioned a PCP, womens doctor, and "my breast surgeon"  I told her that I wanted to get me information from her so that I could help her the most with the question.  I asked her when the last time was that she was exhibitting any signs or symptoms that let her to see her doctor the first time and she said a year ago.  I asked her if she had ever read the pre-existing  conditions that she has through Sedera- she that the only reason she signed up with Sedera was "because I thought they didn''t have those"  I went over the pre-ex guidelines with her.  Afterwards she thanked me for all of my help. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-08 11:47:18', '2018-10-08 11:47:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024795008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015902152', 'Douglas Pardieck', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-08 11:14:13', '2018-10-08 11:14:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024806003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784600', 'Jenifer Meller', NULL, '10-8-18 I just completed call and she enrolled in $1500/ $269 a month. She listened to my audio. I didn''t need to repeat it but I did by accident. She had done a lot of research beforehand and likes our the best because she can talk with humans on the other end. She felt much better about that than compared to the others where she got automated systems and sites.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-08 10:41:18', '2018-10-08 10:41:18'),
