  ('zcrm_1579374000024727003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364292', 'Michael Harris', NULL, 'Had a follow-up conversation with Dr. Harris today.  He is considering his family this week into Partially Self Directed w/$5 IUA.  Clean medical history past 3 years, no meds.  He also is considering offer to his stall office staff and has other people he like to share our program with.  Told him about $100 referral fee.  Children ages 12,10,8,7,.   Wife 43 yrs old, he is 43.  Sending him the Sedera Membership book today', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-10-06 09:55:26', '2018-10-06 09:55:26'),
