  ('zcrm_1579374000024674013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610361', 'Jarod Carter', NULL, 'Spoke with Jarod. Dealing with family member illness. Requested to follow up in a month to remind him to complete his HRA.', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-10-05 09:46:12', '2018-10-05 09:46:12'),
