  ('zcrm_1579374000024672008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015937096', 'Ramon Pinela', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-05 09:07:21', '2018-10-05 09:07:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024672003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647211', 'Jacqueline Woodward', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-05 09:03:51', '2018-10-05 09:03:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024668008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024662082', 'Samantha Tucker', NULL, 'Member only $500 IUA PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-05 08:55:55', '2018-10-05 08:55:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024668003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024662041', 'Henry Zuniga', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1500 IUA 30-39 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-05 08:42:17', '2018-10-05 08:42:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024666003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656126', 'Kevin Lever', NULL, 'yesterday Oct 4th Kevin called in to speak with John, I told him that he was still very busy, but asked if I could help- so the question was "because my wife were not able to find anyone to refer to the plan, can''t I just refer my wife?"  I said that I was not 100% certain BUT- no because that would mean that we would have to put her on a separate plan and Patti who heads up enrollments does not like doing this.- Kevin grumbled about how not being about to speaking with John was a catastrophe,  I appologized that he felt this way and asked him if he wanted  to speak with ANYONE in the office, he declined and said that he would wait to speak with John.  I wrote to Paul, asking him that he contact this member to answer his question.  Paul called a few hours later to say that he did- BUT this client would not talk to him either and that he would wait for John. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-05 08:33:11', '2018-10-05 08:33:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024626024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024662001', 'Suzanne Delaney', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA 60-64 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-05 08:06:16', '2018-10-05 08:06:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024626008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028448001', 'Chris Whaling', NULL, '10-4-18 Found Sedera via Google search. Has Anthem now for ridiculous cost. Expecting $800 for 2019. Only medical issue was injured shoulder and surgery about 2 years ago. Understands it''s in pre-x clause. Otherwise good health. Looked in Altrua but way too many exemptions to move forward. Looking for earliest Dec. 1st start date. We looked up Telluride Medical Facility and it''s in network as well as NP Eric Johnson.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-04 15:31:39', '2018-10-04 15:31:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024578018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899022', 'Lisa Nicholls', NULL, 'Payton tore her ACL, they went to an orthopedist and she had an MRI done, Payton''s father called to ask about where they needed to go from there.  I asked about when she actually got hurt (I am sorry I did not write down the exact time) , to rule out pre-ex - and in my mind it did because of their start date in Jan 1.  I gave him Sedera''s phone number, I went over 2nd MD and sent him an e-mai as well.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-04 14:39:03', '2018-10-05 12:56:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024589021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024662082', 'Samantha Tucker', NULL, '10-4-18 She just completed the enrollment and chose the $500 IUA after I chatted with her dad Dr. Tucker. She''s all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-04 14:36:05', '2018-10-04 14:36:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024614003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005573305', 'Cheryl Love', NULL, 'Sent email yesterday, 10/3/18, that membership is pending cancellation. Received a payment update today, 10/4/18, and processed September payment. Sent her an email that October payment is due tomorrow, 10/5/18.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-10-04 14:17:41', '2018-10-04 14:17:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024609008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009579103', 'Steven Meusel', NULL, 'Kelly let me know that the member called in and told her that she had seen a DPC doctor today and asked how that would affect her account if she changed.  I left a VM w/Jan to contact me so I can let her know what is involved:
1. Member would have to cancel their Select membership then re-enroll in the Access DPC Plan.
2. Produce proof of DPC Coverage
3. Price difference Select -$485 Access DPC $815 + DPC monthly fees
I will advise Jan that member looking to save money so this will not achieve that goal.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-04 13:48:50', '2018-10-04 13:48:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024609003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009579103', 'Steven Meusel', NULL, 'Employee &amp; Spouse $1000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-04 13:33:07', '2018-10-04 13:33:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024589016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005173170', 'Melissa Smith', NULL, '10-4-18 Updated address to NM - Santa Fe.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-04 13:14:54', '2018-10-04 13:14:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024578013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990381', 'Elena Garet', NULL, 'Elena called for some assistance with getting a coupon for some meds.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-04 12:50:59', '2018-10-04 12:50:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024578008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023740081', 'James Newpower', NULL, 'James called to say that his son hurt his leg and now needs physical therapy.  He wanted to know what he should do next.   I asked him when his son hurt himself and he laughed and said yesterday.  I went through the entire process with him and told him that he needed to call Sedera and let them know what was going on. He said that he would, as well as thanked me for the help. asked about pre-x he said NO, I told him to start a conversation with Sedera.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-04 12:34:05', '2018-10-04 12:34:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024589011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024662082', 'Samantha Tucker', NULL, '10-4-18 She''s working PT but leaving that job this week. She''s working for new company soon and they Might have benefits Jan. 1st or later. She has no pre-x, no tobacco, no drugs, healthy, no issues. She''s 26 and ready to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-04 12:19:23', '2018-10-04 12:19:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024589003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025001057', 'Dawn Champion', NULL, '10-4-18 Dawn is 53 and husband Chris gets coverage through work and is only paying $100 but to add her it''s $600 and Cobra is expiring Oct. 31st and she''s not working now. Was diagnosed with Hashimotos in 2014 and takes Armour Thyroid. Also uses bio identical hormones for menopause. Visits Dr. 2x per year, 1 for annual and other for labs for thyroid. Has an HSA already and already had her colonoscopy so doesn''t need one for 5 more years. No tobacco, eats well, exercises 4x per week. Only other thing is occasional bladder infection. Son is Bret who''s on his University plan already and will have a 2 week gap between graduation and new job with benefits. She may need a STM for him and will get it through local agent.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-04 11:55:56', '2018-10-04 11:58:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024582018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610265', 'Julie A. Bekker', NULL, 'Sent email and left message regarding HRA', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-10-04 11:33:55', '2018-10-04 11:33:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024582013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017815039', 'Katrinia Garcia', NULL, 'Not able to leave message. Mailbox is not set up yet. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-04 11:30:33', '2018-10-04 11:30:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024582008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610246', 'Edward Smaha III', NULL, 'Sent email yesterday and Spoke with Cindy, his assistant, today regarding Edward''s HRA. Also forwarded HRA email.', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-10-04 11:24:12', '2018-10-04 11:24:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024582003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925108', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-04 11:23:46', '2018-10-04 11:23:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024559008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925189', 'Rebecca Nelson', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-04 11:17:15', '2018-10-04 11:17:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024578003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024446006', 'Shannon Frankel', NULL, 'Shannon called and said that she KNOWS that she has a pre-existing condition, and she knows that her start date isn''t until 11/01 but she wanted to see what primary doctors were in network so that she could go to them for both her chronic condition as well as regular things.- I told her that she was VERY early into any of this. I sent her the link and she was thankful. I asked her why she needed to see the doctor today and she said refill on medications, I asked what meds and she said pain meds. RED FLAGS.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-04 11:16:23', '2018-10-04 11:16:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024567019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023837032', 'Walker Logan', NULL, 'Cancelled due to non-payment. This client must re-enroll if he wants benefits.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-10-04 11:07:00', '2018-10-04 11:07:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024564003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784600', 'Jenifer Meller', NULL, '10-4-18 "I''m being let go from my current employer. My severance package includes 18 months of Cobra, which I''ve never used before and am trying to figure out. 
It looks as though my monthly premium, should I opt into that option, is almost $500 per month. 
That seems so high for me.
I''m 39 years old, single, excellent health, weight, fitness lever...never smoke, rarely go to dr, etc."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-04 09:57:35', '2018-10-04 09:57:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024561003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716985', 'Jill Keim', NULL, 'I helped Jill find a gyno in her area,  showed her how to use the multi-plan site. I gave her many suggestions about how to present to card and how she needed to make sure and clear that her visit and pap smear are coded as preventative - and if contrary to let her know first. I sent her a list of Dr''s that are on her plan in her area as well as the "what to say" template.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-04 09:24:58', '2018-10-04 09:24:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024559003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819616', 'David Assell', NULL, 'Spoke to David wanted me to send email for the 15 minute welcome call to his wife Carrie so she can set it up. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-04 09:24:20', '2018-10-04 09:24:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024503018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005654049', 'Kathy Price', NULL, 'Kathy called in to get some pricing on methocarbamol and percocept in preparation for her husbands surgery at the end of the week. I sent her some coupons and an e-mail asking how her husband is doing.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-03 14:39:04', '2018-10-03 15:03:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024509028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991007', 'Stephen Gonzales', NULL, '10-3-18 Totally healthy, self-employed, no HSA, no pre-x. Paying $250 or more a month for crappy Freedom Life plan. He''s totally on board with this and they want to enroll for a Nov. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-03 13:14:13', '2018-10-03 13:14:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024509018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899604', 'Arnold Rasker', NULL, '10-3-18 Arn had a biking accident and broke his back 10 days ago! He still biked out with his friend. Didn''t really have a choice. Compressed a disc or vertebrae down to 20%. He called Sedera and they told him he didn''t need to go through 2nd MD process and just get the surgery right away. He''s spoken to the provider and they are giving him a 60% discount as self pay. He''s already paid $32K up front which was down from $80K retail cost. Sedera said just to submit the bill ASAP for reimbursement. He will once he has the detailed bill. If there are further costs after surgery provider will bill him and he can submit to Sedera again. He''s comfortable with the process and happy to hear that my clients have had great success in getting bills paid. Surgery is scheduled and he''s set to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-03 12:33:57', '2018-10-03 12:33:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024509013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165304', 'Michael Garino', NULL, '10-3-18 Left a vm with Michael. He''s at a cross roads in his life and wants to understand his benefits and such.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-10-03 12:15:25', '2018-10-03 12:15:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024503013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659241', 'Michele Kean', NULL, 'Michele called because she has chronic muscle pain, and she was looking for her card so that she could call the number and get pre-approval for chiropractic care to help this condition that NOW is not only in her neck and lower back- but now spreading to her side and hips.  I asked questions that pertained to any sort of pre-existing conditions.   When asked she paused and said that yes, "it came back this summer because I wasn''t doing yoga." I told her that Sedera would not share if it is pre-existing,   but that she should call them to confirm.....because she was asking about if there was any twist or turn in getting it covered. -EVEN using her ASI card to pay for this because it would prevent her from getting sicker.  (I did clarify that this was NOT even an option.)   I gave her Sedera''s number and told her to give them a call.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-03 11:01:26', '2018-10-03 11:01:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024503008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003413005', 'Jennah Synnestvedt', NULL, 'Jennah called in because her doctor was asking for an EOB from ASI, I sent her the attachment that we send people with their preventative care letter.  I scanned it over with her and think it will work.  I told her that she can feel free to call ASI at any time, that they are very kind people to deal with. I told her that she was doing a great job and to shoot me an e-mail with any updates.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-03 10:23:41', '2018-10-03 10:23:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024504021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165343', 'Renee Athay', NULL, 'Email for declined payment sent on 9/14/18. Zoho portal enabled.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-10-03 10:12:37', '2018-10-03 10:12:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024504016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005591009', 'Diane Roth', NULL, 'Sent email for declined payment on 9/18/18.  Zoho portal enabled.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-10-03 10:10:29', '2018-10-03 10:10:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024504008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005573305', 'Cheryl Love', NULL, 'Sent email on 9/14. Zoho portal enabled.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-10-03 10:05:12', '2018-10-03 10:05:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024504003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005573043', 'Charles Stephens', NULL, 'Email sent for declined payment.  Portal in Zoho enabled.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-10-03 10:04:07', '2018-10-03 10:04:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024503003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006102023', 'Sandra Parrish', NULL, 'Sandra called because she said she had a blocked artery in her calf, and that she needed to know the best places in her area cost wise to have a calf ultrasound done.  I thought I gave her the best advice after consulting with Patti and John both.  I sent a massive e-mail to her per request. See e-mail for more info.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-03 09:58:20', '2018-10-03 09:58:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024489008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695318', 'Regina Mailloux Jensen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member requested a 2nd QR Life Code for her husband Frederick. I sent out one today. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-03 09:32:50', '2018-10-03 10:36:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024489003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299275', 'Shing Kwo Cheung', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-10-03 08:53:01', '2018-10-03 08:53:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024458061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659542', 'Terry Fisher', NULL, 'I spoke with Terry, he is doing great creating a need with Sedera.  He knows to call them if he has any help.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-02 14:47:36', '2018-10-02 14:47:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024458056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005653027', 'Trude Moyer', NULL, 'Trude is confused.  Patti and I told her that she needed to call Liberty, that we don''t call laboratories or doctor offices, that is what Liberty does. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-02 14:20:19', '2018-10-02 14:20:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024416026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299051', 'Clare Vazin', NULL, 'Replacement Mpowering Benefits card sent per member''s request', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-10-02 14:13:15', '2018-10-02 14:13:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024458051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023592190', 'Irene Evans', NULL, 'Irene is VERY happy about the medication coupons that I found for her, she was willing to switch pharmacies and I went over how to get the scripts transferred.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-02 13:48:38', '2018-10-02 13:48:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024458046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023837032', 'Walker Logan', NULL, 'Per D. Shull cancellation request sent to apex@regionalcare.com', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-02 13:46:17', '2018-10-02 13:46:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024458041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007096243', 'Karen Sebbens', NULL, 'Karen thought that she could call us to get pre-approval for a colonoscopy at Mayo clinic.  She kept giving me Liberty account numbers.  I pointed her in the right direction.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-02 13:39:14', '2018-10-02 13:39:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024458036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695264', 'Lorie Moreno-Roch', NULL, 'Member was not being charged for Lib Rx by us as she was activated by Sedera when they were having issues with getting me notifications.  I notified Sedera that member wants to cancel so we will not be charged.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-02 13:12:42', '2018-10-02 13:12:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024458031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695264', 'Lorie Moreno-Roch', NULL, 'Will notify Sedera to cancel Lib Rx also adjust in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-02 13:02:46', '2018-10-02 13:02:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024458026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023837032', 'Walker Logan', NULL, 'Ron unable to connect with Father  (payor) of this member so we are cancelling.  I will notify Sedera.  Will notify RCI when I receive procedure frm D. Shull.  Will also cancel in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-10-02 12:53:38', '2018-10-02 12:53:38');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000024458021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023740001', 'Margaret Johnson', NULL, 'I called to check in to check on Margaret today after the call I had with her yesterday.  I called to check in, yes she did contact Sedera and they asked her for the itemized bills.   I told her that I sent all of the counseling services that Sedera offers out via e-mail.  She said that she wasn''t worries about the counseling part she needed help with her bills.  I told her to reach out to us if she needed anything.  She sounds overwhelmed and down.  - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-02 12:52:12', '2018-10-02 12:52:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024458016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830450', 'Debbie Eubanks', NULL, 'Debbie called in for coupons for her prescriptions- I sent them via text as well as reached out to Reid- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-02 12:39:36', '2018-10-02 12:39:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024416021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695264', 'Lorie Moreno-Roch', NULL, 'Member stated she wanted to be removed from Liberty Rx. Patti notified.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-10-02 12:19:43', '2018-10-02 12:19:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000024458008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023592190', 'Irene Evans', NULL, 'Irene called in because she said that she hadn''t gotten her welcome pack in her e-mail.  I told her to check in her spam and she told me that her husband deleted everything.  I spoke with LaShanda over at Sedera and she said that she would send their welcome pack over to Irene.  She had so many questions as to why she needed to ever call Redirect because she was told to always call here. I tried to  reach out and answer questions. I made sure that she had and Redirect''s number and told her that if she had any medical issues that were non-emergency to give them a call. I spoke with Jane about Irene being confused- we agreed that if she calls the office again before her welcome call to reffer her back to Jane.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-10-02 11:07:56', '2018-10-02 11:33:42'),
