  ('zcrm_1579374000023992018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002638010', 'Elyse Larkin', NULL, 'Elyse wanted to know the exact process she should take for her hammer toes and Bunions, she says that she is in a lot of discomfort. I told her that she needed to get per-approval,  it took awhile but she finally realized that, she needed to call Liberty because they handled pre-approval and ultimately payment. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-25 14:53:25', '2018-09-25 14:53:25'),
