  ('zcrm_1579374000023899043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779377', 'Jack Bowlin', NULL, '"Kelly" Bowlin called in because he had a pretty bad bike fall just over a month ago.- he gave the hospital his ASI card, and just heard from ASI that it was not covered through them.  He was a little confused.  So I let him know what happened and gave him Sedera''s phone number. I told him to tell them everything that he told me- making sure to mention to them that his index finger and thumb were still pretty swollen afterward so that it all would be included in that need.  He was very thankful for the help and will be giving Sedera a call.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-25 07:24:47', '2018-09-25 07:24:47'),
