  ('zcrm_1579374000023822013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474088', 'Terry Lopez', NULL, 'Terry got a bill from her doctor''s office, she had an annual at Swedish Family Practice on 6/14 - after a few questions I told her to call her doctors office and ask if they even had sent it to ASI,- if not, to ask them to do it. I told her to call me back to let me know how it went.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-21 12:13:26', '2018-09-21 12:13:26'),
