  ('zcrm_1579374000023805003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023837032', 'Walker Logan', NULL, 'Walker Login enrolled directly into the platform.  His father (Brett) was helping him.  Patti alert me that he didn''t enroll properly and at first we didn''t know where he originated from.  After researching his father works for the The Hills Church (check in CRM).  I contacted the church and got the entire story.  I called Brett back and explained what we had to do since he enrolled into the old Sedera Select program (not sure how he located the link?).  I callled  the church back and explained what happen and updated them with our new plan information and pricing.  I also discovered he was referred by a church member Griffin Gradke.  I was the producer who enrolled Griffin.   I took Britt to our current enrollment  platform and had him enroll only on the MPB side and stop per Patti.  Brett didn''t have his bank accounts information so he saved the enrollment and said he would finish it later today.  I impressed on him HE MUST FINISH THE ENROLLMENT BY MIDNIGHT OR THE ENROLLMENT WILL NOT BE HONORED FOR A 10-1 EFFECTIVE DATE.
Also since I never spoke with Walker I ask his father about his health and if he had any pre-x.  His father said he was diagnosed with ADHD 6 months ago and on a Class 4 narcotic.  I TOLD HIM THAT SEDERA WOULD NOT SHARE ANYTHING RELATED TO HIS CONDITION, NOW OR IN THE FUTURE, NOR ANY CONDITIONS OR TREATMENT REQUIRED ARISING FROM THE ADHD.  He agree that would be ok and still wanted to enroll.  I alerted Patti to speak with Sedera tomorrow to see if Walker indicated his condition on the Sedera health questions.  I will check tomorrow AM to see the disposition of the enrollment tomorrow.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-09-20 15:04:30', '2018-09-20 15:04:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023787028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023796049', 'Andrew Sutton', NULL, 'Member did not enter Child 2 SS#.  I left a VM to get gave him until; 9/21 to supply otherwise I will pend.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-09-20 14:30:47', '2018-09-20 14:30:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023761031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695393', 'Patrick Boyum', NULL, 'Patrick called to ask about logging in to the US Coorporate site, I told him to check late on Friday and he should be able to get right in.   He also could not find any e-mail from them (even after checking spam) that contained thier welcome pack. So I sent them the proper link off of their site.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-20 14:28:00', '2018-09-20 14:28:00'),
