  ('zcrm_1579374000023761026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021782202', 'Michael Deifik', NULL, 'Michael called in because he couldn''t access the US Coorporate Website, I tried getting him in but nothing worked.  He had other questions as well about how he could begin to set up an HSA.  I sent a HSA e-mail as well as a welcome call scheduler. I told him that I would get back to him about his loggin to UScoorporate.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-20 10:44:13', '2018-09-20 10:44:13'),
