  ('zcrm_1579374000023761021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, 'Joy called in multiple times this morning.   With the first call, I reminded her where to go to connect with Teledoc due to pink eye.   Now I am waiting to get the name of her prescription so I can text her a coupon.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-20 09:09:14', '2018-09-20 09:09:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023739063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163052', 'Rita Boccuzzi', NULL, '9-19-18 Co-Pay Network plan looks best. They each go to Dr. 3-5x per year for check up with ENT, audiologist, PCP, oncologist for Rita and Angelo has allergies, nasal issues and hemorrhoids.  She will encourage husband to quit smoking. He''s 58 I think. He''s looking for new job. She''s trying to take burden off him to leave job by getting their healthcare taken care of. Cost for her and son at $1500 IUA is $617. Send her Dental and Vision Discount plan plus STM for husband , 10/03/1960 and 91504', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-09-19 14:19:15', '2018-09-19 14:19:15'),
