  ('zcrm_1579374000023761013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919047', 'Tatiana Moroz', NULL, 'Johana called back and asked me AGAIN if the doctors I sent her after my search were all OUR doctors.  I explained everything AGAIN... I answered again, and she told me that was all that she wanted to hear....thanked me....and said goodbye.  I have a very strange feeling about this but I could be wrong.  I am going to get with Liz in ensuring that Tatiana is reached and gets a welcome call. - Johana''s cell is 347-447-2707', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-19 14:11:56', '2018-09-19 14:20:43'),
