  ('zcrm_1579374000023739008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784550', 'Thomas Bukacek', NULL, '9-19-18 He''s going to have to be put onto Access. Gave him new price for $1500 IUA which is similar and between old $500/$1000 IUA options for 45 yr old. He never sees a doctor so PSDHCP is best. He will enroll tonight and let me know if he has any problems.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-09-19 11:50:28', '2018-09-19 11:50:28'),
