  ('zcrm_1579374000023694013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919047', 'Tatiana Moroz', NULL, 'Tatian''s assistant called in to get insurance info so she can see a GI doctor out of town.  I explained to Joanna that she could go to any Dr that she liked, and present herself as a cash paying patient.  I gave her assistant a very brief rundown of what Tatiana''s plan entailed, and asked her to have Tatiana to participate in the welcome call as soon as possible by using the scheduler.- KC I DID go over pre-existing!!!!- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-19 11:37:13', '2018-09-19 11:37:13'),
