  ('zcrm_1579374000023650003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819148', 'Justin St Germain', NULL, 'Called member for Welcome call but member was very anxious as he &amp; his wife just found out they were pregnant and was concerned that Sedera would assist them in sharing with the birth. Member was highly concerned about this and did not want to complete the welcome call. Anticipating feedback from Sedera.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-09-18 14:32:23', '2018-09-18 14:32:23'),
