  ('zcrm_1579374000023599038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023785099', 'Dina Rabo', NULL, 'Dina called today to say was enrolling and ask some questions about the co-pay plan vs partially self directed.  She was enrolling on-line', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-09-18 13:14:07', '2018-09-18 13:14:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023615023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870078', 'Suzanne Donner', NULL, 'she called in because she had to go to the ER yesterday, she says that it wasn''t a huge deal and she is fine but she wanted to know if she needed to find an in network follow up, I told her that she didn''t.   She said that she had cellulitis and was prescribed anti biotics and prednisone. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-18 13:13:31', '2018-09-18 13:13:31'),
