  ('zcrm_1579374000023492008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004511029', 'Deborah Patrick', NULL, 'From: Deb <sagebelly@yahoo.com> 
Sent: Saturday, September 15, 2018 7:50 PM
To: admin@myahe.org
Subject: Cancel

Hello, Stop charging my CC account $50 for  Health Excellence Select-Health Excellence Select Member subscription.


I did not provide you with updated CC info for a reason, and yet the charge came through. My next communication will be with my CC company.


I have no account # associated with this, just this email and my Name


my email  sagebelly@yahoo.com     Deborah Patrick


No further charges will be approved and I will be reversing recent charge.

Customer was upset about the charge but no cancellation request was received. Sent her an email with cancellation form - cancellation pending.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2018-09-17 07:14:34', '2018-09-17 07:14:34'),
