  ('zcrm_1579374000023373018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006420193', 'Jennifer Palmer', NULL, 'Member called in and requested that her account be cancelled.  Was informed by LHS that she didn''t need us.  So cancelled her account.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-09-14 14:35:13', '2018-09-14 14:35:13'),
