  ('zcrm_1579374000023373013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521138', 'Jamie Solow', NULL, 'I received a copy of PDF ID Card that was sent to member.  In attachments', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-09-14 13:02:49', '2018-09-14 13:02:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023375029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005553165', 'Gary McBride', NULL, 'Cancelled 10/1/2018', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-09-14 12:12:45', '2018-09-14 12:12:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023418003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752138', 'Michelle Nault', NULL, 'Michelle called in to get direction as to what steps she needed to take because she is going to have carpal tunnel release surgery.  She said that she has tried everything, acupuncture, injections, chiro and nothing has worked.  I told her that she needed to call 2nd MD and Sedera and let them know everything that is going on, I also gave her Sedera''s phone number and told her how to upload her bills.  She said that she already had downloaded the 2nd MD app to her phone, thanked me and said that she was going to start making all the calls she needed. I did tell her that she needed to contact 2nd MD,  and needed to call Sedera.   She mentioned that she was thinking of not telling them because the hospital gave her a cash price that was lower than the insurance route, and submit the bills after the fact.  I told her that they would not share in it as much if she did that, and that Sedera would help her much more than whatever that price was.  She would not tell me the price, but seemed compliant to how she would be taking her next steps. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-14 12:10:19', '2018-09-14 12:10:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023417003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004801387', 'Colette Rice', NULL, 'member called in, Liberty cancelled her 4 months ago.  She changed email addresses and bank accounts after a divorce and didn''t inform Liberty.  Sent her the cancellation link and link to click funnel.....', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-09-14 11:59:28', '2018-09-14 11:59:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023373008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521138', 'Jamie Solow', NULL, 'Member called in and told me taht he has never received his ASi Cards..I contacted ASi and requested new cards and verified address with them.  I also requested a pdf copy sent to both member &amp; myself.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-09-14 11:20:25', '2018-09-14 11:20:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023406008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019411051', 'James Sullivan', NULL, '9-14-18 Moving from True Group to MPB Group for Oct. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-09-14 11:07:30', '2018-09-14 11:07:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023406003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019411061', 'Donn Kellogg', NULL, '9-14-18 Owner of Donnelly Sports and wants to switch to MPB Group for one easy billing every month. Fine with small additional monthly fee and set up fee for Donn and James Sullivan. Brandon is all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-09-14 10:57:42', '2018-09-14 10:57:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023398008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299094', 'Donald Thessen', NULL, 'Member called in that he accidentally deleted my email so I resent another to him as requested. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-14 09:58:03', '2018-09-14 09:58:03'),
