  ('zcrm_1579374000023375006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624144', 'Kim Merryweather', NULL, 'Member has to reschedule her 15 minute welcome call that was scheduled Friday, Sept. 14, 2018 at 10:00 a.m. eastern time. Sent email to do so. Overwhelmed member spoke to John for further peace of mind with plan. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-14 08:22:48', '2018-09-14 08:29:26'),
