  ('zcrm_1579374000023365003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784550', 'Thomas Bukacek', NULL, '9-13-18 He''s 45 and will need to enroll in Assoc plan since not referred by current member. Price is similar enough. I''ll tell him the changes on Tues when we go through enrollment process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-09-13 15:37:55', '2018-09-13 15:37:55'),
