  ('zcrm_1579374000023326018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351098', 'Teresa Brachle', NULL, 'She called in to ask if eye exams were covered or not,  I told her that they were not.  Then she wanted to know where she could take her son for a pediatrician visit that would be covered. I did a search and and sent her all of the results.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-13 12:01:57', '2018-09-13 12:01:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023305018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014855062', 'Sedat Eren', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Request information on dental and vision plans. Requested a 2nd MPower life code for wife. This was the 2nd welcome call for this member. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-13 11:41:10', '2018-09-14 07:41:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023326013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068195', 'Yen-Yen Yuan', NULL, 'Yen-Yen and I were on the phone quiet a bit because her annual routine bloodwork was sent to an out of network lab, there was connfusion over a $1600 amount and $36 dollars, after speaking with one of the phlebotomists , Yen-Yen will be calling the lab and telling them to give her the $36 price, and ask for a line-itemed receipt that she can then send to APEX for reimbursement.  Also I double checked to make sure that her gastro doctor Kenneth Blake was in network for her colonoscopy. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-13 11:22:29', '2018-09-13 11:22:29'),
