  ('zcrm_1579374000023152128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014855001', 'Tim Whitney', NULL, 'she had a Barrage of questions, she said I did great with the answers.  I sent out a provider network e-mail, and the HSA one.  - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-12 10:49:20', '2018-09-12 10:51:57'),
