  ('zcrm_1579374000023152123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012223122', 'Elizabeth Daly', NULL, 'Elizabeth called in because her daughter just had a catscan and saw a neurologist in New York and wanted to know if she needed to do anything else, she told me that she had submitted a few bills, but hadn''t yet spoken with them.  I told her that she needed to speak with them about her daughters condition now and going forward and that she needed to speak with someone about going through the second md process.  She said that Wendy thought that it would be a good idea.  I told her Wendy was right.   John sent her a video that goes over using the app.  - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-12 10:36:46', '2018-09-12 10:36:46'),
