  ('zcrm_1579374000023152084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919419', 'Leo Goodman', NULL, 'Leo called in because he could not make an appointment because he wasn''t presenting the card correctly I told him what to say, as well as sent him the script.  I found his doctor in network.  He was just frustrated because this was something new, that he had never tried  before and admitted it was kinda scary.   So I went through all of the what if''s with him, and that he wasn''t alone, it did seem that he felt better, didn''t have anymore questions, and was looking forward to go through the e-mails I promised to send him.  I sent the preventative care e-mail,  a prescription drug form, as well as the script.   I also got back to him with the correct pre-ex claus that he originally signed up with 0, 24, 50 then unlimited.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-12 08:33:13', '2018-09-12 08:33:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023198018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020482017', 'Steven Thomas', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-12 08:24:24', '2018-09-12 08:24:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023179016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004249190', 'Frank Jonathan Simcic', NULL, 'member called in with questions about his membership benefits...... 2 years in and he just noticed the $50 charge.  Sent email explaining benefits.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-09-12 08:19:57', '2018-09-12 08:19:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023198013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695463', 'Steven Pope', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-12 08:00:12', '2018-09-12 08:00:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023201003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005030048', 'John Chamberlin', NULL, '9-11-18 Called to find out how to handle a recommended Dr. visit to cardiologist for recent chest pains. Her PCP dr. recommends she see a cardiologist. learned the price will be $300 as self pay. Told her to pay cash price and call Concierge for assistance in uploading bill and to gain access to cheapest meds. She and John have divorced but they are still on a family plan. I told her it goes by how they file their taxes and she needs to separate their membership. She understands but I didn''t get the impression she will change it immediately. New AUA for family with LHS is $2250.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-09-11 16:01:44', '2018-09-11 16:01:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023188008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033386', 'Ruth Charles', NULL, 'I spent a good bit of time with Ruth this afternoon, she wanted the Sedera guidelines because a health insurance friend wanted her to check and see if what she had with us, included any speculation of pre existing conditions, and if so, she should be careful.  So.  I went over Sedera''s view and standing on pre-existing conditions. That there is a 3 year lookback of symptoms and diagnosis- and what the first, second, and third year mean as far as sharing in a pre-existing need with a member.  She was completely fine with it. I then helped her try to find her obgyn in network, was unsuccessful.  I took the time to nominate the Dr on Multiplan.  Ruth needs extra tlc when speaking with her, but she is grateful for it.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-11 14:26:03', '2018-09-11 14:26:03'),
