  ('zcrm_1579374000023177013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798036', 'Russell Jewell', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-11 10:25:03', '2018-09-11 10:25:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023177008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590042', 'Donald J. Hinz Jr.', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-11 10:20:28', '2018-09-11 10:20:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023188003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752041', 'Gail Militello', NULL, 'Gail has been having elbow pain off and on for 3 months she has tried icing it, she tried even seeing a chiropractor, and none of those treatments worked, she has an appointment today with a sports medicine doctor. She just wanted to make sure that she was doing everything correctly, presenting herself as a cash pay patient, collecting detailed medical bills, and then getting Sedera involved after she reaches her IUA of $500. I told her that she was doing everything correctly, I made sure that this was not pre-existing condition, and added that if this escalated into a situation where she would need surgery, she would have to get 2nd MD involved for a second opinion. closed.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-11 09:51:32', '2018-09-11 09:51:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023177003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024108', 'Kathy Fuerst', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-11 09:31:36', '2018-09-11 09:31:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023157008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023155021', 'Jill Enriquez', NULL, 'Employee &amp; Ch $500 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-09-11 09:15:10', '2018-09-11 09:15:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023157003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023275014', 'Wesley Dibble', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $5000 IUA PSD 60-64', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-09-11 08:00:19', '2018-09-11 08:00:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023107028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695225', 'Kevin Thiemann', NULL, 'Kevin called in because he wanted to start using his insurance by setting up annual visits for himself and his children.  I told him that we ask our members to wait the full 3 months to use their preventative services, but that if his children needed vaccines or he has he could do so.  I went over preventative care and how it works.   I sent a preventative care e-mail as well as a welcome call scheduler. I told him that he really needed to do the welcome call. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-10 14:03:14', '2018-09-10 14:03:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023126016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020350047', 'John Knowlton', NULL, '9-10-18 John Knowlton called to ask if he could get upgraded to a higher Apex plan. He called Apex and they told him they do have an increased plan. The increased plan is ONLY a hospital benefit plan where they split the hospital cost 50/50. It''s not necessary of worthy since he already has Sedera to cover him for those instances. He was trying to strip the membership down to just Apex which I told him will Not protect him in case of a major incident.  I''ve confirmed his Liberty RX has been cancelled. David Shull will look into why John''s dermatologist''s visit was a $0 co-pay. They don''t have any $0 co-pays. Sounds like doctor''s office made a mistake. David will let me know what he learns.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-09-10 12:40:18', '2018-09-10 12:40:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023126011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012223122', 'Elizabeth Daly', NULL, '9-10-18 Elizabeth called about daughter''s migraines they are seeing doctors for. She''s trying to find out if daughter will be forced to use a bunch of meds before any further treatment is allowed. I told her she needs to go through Concierge to connect to 2nd MD first. They want to get to the root of the problem and not cover it with meds. She''ll call Concierge.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-09-10 12:31:57', '2018-09-10 12:31:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023078021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005041341', 'Emily Rea', NULL, 'After no response from member we requested cancellation form Sedera &amp; Apex.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-09-10 12:23:29', '2018-09-10 12:23:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023109033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659160', 'Alicia Venegas', NULL, 'Spoke to member she declined to have a  15 minute welcome call. She said she pretty much got explained by her husband and understands the plan. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-10 11:12:32', '2018-09-10 11:12:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023126003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023155021', 'Jill Enriquez', NULL, '9-10-18 Enrolling now for Oct. 1st start date. Nervous about the referral requirement but keep telling her the health assessment will suffice as a backup plan. She''s fine with that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-09-10 11:07:25', '2018-09-10 11:36:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023109028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716785', 'Megan Friday', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-10 10:54:23', '2018-09-10 10:54:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023109023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752018', 'Kim Rust', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-10 10:48:37', '2018-09-10 10:48:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023078016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000518260', 'Alize Campbell', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that she had cancelled LHS last month and that she was unaware that we ere separate.  I refunded this month and cancelled her going forward.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-09-10 10:44:06', '2018-09-10 10:44:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023109018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899003', 'Antonio Blanco', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-10 10:26:24', '2018-09-10 10:26:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023107023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002965029', 'Trevor Patching', NULL, 'I helped Karen find a dermatologist in her area on health grades to remove a cancerous mole on her face.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-10 10:18:32', '2018-09-10 10:18:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023109013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012429037', 'Thomas Barnes', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-10 10:11:18', '2018-09-10 10:11:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023107018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819039', 'Matthew VerMilyea', NULL, 'I called to check in with Matthew, he said that things are coming along, he almost has his 2nd MD paperwork filled out all the way, he has been in touch with Sedera, and so far he will be able to keep his surgery.  Client very grateful for the call,   I told him that he couldn''t have given me any better news!.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-10 09:33:53', '2018-09-10 09:33:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023112003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990282', 'Maryann Mcleod', NULL, 'MaryAnn called.  Has knee pain.  Wanted to know how to access service.  calling Teladoc 1st then following their recommendation.  If she needs to go to a doc, I gave instructions on how to handle billing. (cash patient, ask for discount, ask for itemized bill, save on desktop, get Sedera involved when she approaches her IUA of $500.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-09-10 09:26:03', '2018-09-10 09:26:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023107013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925142', 'Kelly Schest', NULL, 'called and left message letting Kelly know that ASI let us know that the extra ASI cards are on their way in the mail.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-10 09:24:13', '2018-09-10 09:24:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023109008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919471', 'Tad Jakes', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-10 09:17:13', '2018-09-10 09:17:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023109003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899604', 'Arnold Rasker', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-10 09:09:07', '2018-09-10 09:09:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023107008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990282', 'Maryann Mcleod', NULL, 'helped her register for Teladoc, she wants to speak with a doctor about joint pain., She takes a lot of time, but sweet.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-10 09:02:21', '2018-09-10 09:02:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023107003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647085', 'Christopher Lopez', NULL, 'Amber''s doctor could not find her IUD during her well visit, she is being asked to go back today to have an ultrasound and have it hopefully removed, she asked what it would be considered. I told her it fell under injury or illness.   I told her to present herself as self-pay, get the detailed CPT coded bills, and to let sedera know if they were going to go over or near their IUA, I told them about the app,  I told them to consult with 2nd MD if there is to be any surgery.. I wished her a smooth scan today. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-10 08:58:10', '2018-09-10 08:58:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023078008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679231', 'Laura O''Donnell', NULL, 'Member called in and advised me that she was pregnant.  I told her that there would be an initial IUA of her $1000 and that she should reach out to Sedera and let them know that she was pregnant and that they would be sharing after the $1000.  Also advised that there was no "list of providers" and this was not insurance.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-09-10 08:42:04', '2018-09-10 08:42:36'),
