  ('zcrm_1579374000023066003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819039', 'Matthew VerMilyea', NULL, 'Matthew called in because last month his back "flared up",   this past month he has has seen many doctors and tests- paying them all cash or HSA- as of today a specialist is saying that he needs surgery and he wanted to know the process. I asked if having back issues was pre-existing- he said that he already had the sciatica but that the 2 ruptured discs were new.  I told him to give Sedera a call and to just tell them everything that he had told me. I told him that he would need to go through the 2nd MD consultation.  - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-07 12:26:22', '2018-09-07 14:47:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023065003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000255524', 'Ana Leighton', NULL, 'Spoke to Elizabeth at Dr.''s office.  They are in network, will resubmit to ASI and probably reimburse Ana when they get paid by ASI.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-09-07 11:52:40', '2018-09-07 11:52:40'),
