  ('zcrm_1579374000023054008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630057', 'Kathleen Campbell', NULL, '9-7-18 Wanted answer from Kelly about getting a dexascan for her wellness visit. I told her that her Dr. MUST code it as wellness for it to be at no cost to her. If her dr. does that than she''s all set, if not she has to pay for it. She also wanted to know if the Frederickson Center was in-network. I told her to call and ask them directly if they are in the PHCS network.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-09-07 10:13:36', '2018-09-07 10:13:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000023054003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243389', 'Edward Seymour', NULL, '9-7-18 Wanted advice to find a PCP doctor. Didn''t like that he could choose anyone! Wanted more guidance beyond asking friends and family. So, I sent him PHCS network finder instructions even though this is NOT for a wellness visit. He wanted the limitations and will need to find a PCP for wellness in the future anyhow. So, he might as well get established with a dr. in the PHCS network.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-09-07 10:12:06', '2018-09-07 10:12:06'),
