  ('zcrm_1579374000022804029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740251', 'Evan Altman', NULL, 'Lori called in asking for a coupon to be sent to her because she was picking up her fluconozole.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-04 12:49:34', '2018-09-04 12:49:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022804021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695463', 'Steven Pope', NULL, 'Elizabeth from Sedera called to make sure that this client was given the updated guidelines on maternity before they enrolled.  I told her that I would do a bit of digging to find out what happened.  I spoke with Roy and was told that he was told 2-3 weeks ago that they were expecting again, Roy consulted with Jeff about the situation, and all parties agreed that Steven''s family should continue with the enrollment knowing that the pregnancy wouldn''t be covered.  Going in the family knew that this need would not be shareable.  John is trying to contact Elizabeth to let them know what went on before enrollment.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-04 12:15:10', '2018-09-04 12:15:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022804013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839004', 'Joel Hocknell', NULL, '9-4-18 Ready to enroll. I re-explained it briefly covering all the key points. He''s choosing the $1000 / $249 MPB Group option. Wants to possibly add his 16 year old daughter around 1st of year. Enrollment complete.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-09-04 12:08:28', '2018-09-04 12:37:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022816003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014855062', 'Sedat Eren', NULL, 'Received email from member regarding use of plan. Sent email so he may schedule another welcome call.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-09-04 12:02:48', '2018-09-04 12:02:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022803043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830286', 'Maureen Gannon (Hanson)', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-04 11:10:06', '2018-09-04 11:10:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022803038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017815039', 'Katrinia Garcia', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-04 11:04:29', '2018-09-04 11:04:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022804008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659288', 'John Kovach', NULL, 'John called in to ask multiple questions, I handled preventative care and Patti handled HSA questions.  He was very thankful for all of the help, and says we are always there to speak with him when he needs us. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-04 10:46:57', '2018-09-04 10:46:57'),
