  ('zcrm_1579374000022803008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830414', 'Ann Wilkinson', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-04 09:20:57', '2018-09-04 09:20:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022804003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447191', 'Johnnie Hharriman', NULL, 'Jacquie is in North Carolina at area code 29615, she called in because a week and a half ago she hurt her shoulder and it only has gotten worse.  She wanted me to find the best MRI facility cost wise, in the area. I recommended that she she  an orthopedist first, but she said that she rather just do the MRI and if she needed to after that she would see a doctor.  She says that she has been doing warm and cold compresses.  I told her that I would send a list of doctors as well as facilities.  I also mentioned in my e-mail that she could try teladoc, or maybe an urgent care.  We''ll see how this goes, I told her a few times that seeing the doctor would be less expensive than an MRI.  I did tell her that this would be out of pocket up until the $1,000- when she called in she said she wanted to make sure that it is covered.  She did understand that it was not covered. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-09-04 09:18:25', '2018-09-04 09:18:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022803003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830450', 'Debbie Eubanks', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Also updated her email address as requested by member. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-09-04 09:15:38', '2018-09-04 09:15:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022776003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667237', 'Robin Rorapaugh', NULL, 'Member left VM saying she had employer coverage since 11/17 we were still charging her $50.  Said to cancelled membership.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-09-04 06:58:07', '2018-09-04 06:58:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022704031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022809001', 'Nancy Compton', NULL, '8-31-18 Choosing $500 IUA and Co-Pay Network and applying now for Oct. 1st start date and National General for Sept.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-31 15:28:38', '2018-08-31 15:28:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022704026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610418', 'Patricia Haines', NULL, '8-31-18 Needs to cancel her membership bc aging into Medicare. Sent her link to do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-31 15:11:16', '2018-08-31 15:11:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022704018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870023', 'Zulma Fuller', NULL, '8-31-18 Zulma will need to remove her husband from membership sometime in next few months bc he''s offered coverage through new job. But, keeping rest of family on membership. She''ll call or email when she needs the link to remove him. Will cost $427/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-31 14:18:21', '2018-08-31 14:18:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022704013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870023', 'Zulma Fuller', NULL, '8-31-18 Called to see if she needs help with her plan. Told by back office she called with questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-31 14:06:59', '2018-08-31 14:06:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022664115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022809040', 'Pamela Finch', NULL, 'Emp Only $1000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-08-31 14:03:53', '2018-08-31 14:03:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022693031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881678', 'Marcus Christianson', NULL, 'Paige called to ask about where to send Vail''s hospital bills that were incurred at the end of June, as well as where to send the bill from her annual pediatrician visit.  we talked in length, I answered all questions- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-31 13:23:01', '2018-08-31 13:23:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022704008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022809001', 'Nancy Compton', NULL, '8-31-18 Nancy is 51 and paying $630 with Cobra for great plan. Has hypothyroid and takes meds and possible adrenal problems in past. Newly entering menopausal stuff now but not doing anything for it. All meds are super cheap. Did 1 annual visit last year but more previous year. Like idea of co-pays for dr. visits. But, her Dr. does not accept insurance at all. So, tough for co-pay network portion. She was recommended to LHS but told her pros and cons. Goes to acupuncture, massage, etc. May travel to Mexico, France and Peru this year. Likes not needing travel insurance. Oct. 1st start and STM with Nat General for Sept. for $315 month.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-31 13:00:03', '2018-08-31 13:00:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022704003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899119', 'Kathy Spanski', NULL, '10-24-17 Kathy 47, came via Jessica Foster, was w/ corp plan for years but husband left company this year to start own biz. Kathy has pre-x, no coverage, glaucoma not typical small optic nerve that has not changed in 20 years. Takes meds for anxiety/depression, has HSA. Uses Dr. Amber Wobbekind DPC but didn''t want discount to keep HSA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-31 12:00:17', '2018-08-31 12:00:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022693026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990244', 'Joseph Langenbrunner', NULL, 'He called to ask about how to see a GP,  I found his doctor in network.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-31 11:59:20', '2018-08-31 11:59:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022693018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899119', 'Kathy Spanski', NULL, 'Kathy contacted me through sales iq, and then gave me a call. - she has a lot of health issues and wanted to know if rheumotologist would be covered by the plan, and wanted to know about our prescription med plan.  She told me that she has had rheomotoid arthritis in her hands for a while,  and then in January was diagnosed with hypothyroid, now the arthritis is in her jaw.   She told me that she met with a surgeon yesterday that believes she has an auto immune issue and that all of it is connected.  I spoke to her about about the process of a need,  and what is considered pre-existing.   I told her that it would be best to call Sedera and speak to them to get a clearer understanding of what they will help with. I did give Wendy a call after to let her know what was going on with this client. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-31 11:31:03', '2018-08-31 11:53:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022679026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018505034', 'Mary Sundblom', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-08-31 11:27:56', '2018-08-31 11:27:56'),
