  ('zcrm_1579374000022693008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017815039', 'Katrinia Garcia', NULL, 'Did not have info for Alicia Perez.  Referral paid to Robin Kemp.', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-08-31 10:16:21', '2018-08-31 10:16:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022664018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881678', 'Marcus Christianson', NULL, 'I spoke to ASi and they will make an exception for a newborn.  However will need me to get that to them upon issue.  I will advise member about this and submit to ASi &amp; Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-08-31 10:11:31', '2018-08-31 10:11:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022688011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023785099', 'Dina Rabo', NULL, 'Called Dina she needs to look over the Sedera Guidelines and will call me back today.  She will most likely enroll.  She didn''t my previous email.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-08-31 10:07:23', '2018-08-31 10:07:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022693003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020482108', 'Gina Schwichtenberg', NULL, 'Gina called me back after a week''s worth of trying to get a hold of her.   She asked for help finding a general doctor so that she can have an annual exam and a obgyn for a mammogram, I told her that I would be happy to find a doctor for her but that her plan did not have a MEC and those visits she would have to pay for out of pocket.   I also explained to her the illness/injury IUA that she had. She said that she didn''t understand any of it, and that it was chosen for her and that she just went along with it.  I told her that I would call Robin as well as speak to John about making sure that she gets on a plan that she wants. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-31 09:49:27', '2018-08-31 09:49:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022679016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018699825', 'Erick Sanchez Barrita', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-08-31 09:28:20', '2018-08-31 09:28:20'),
