  ('zcrm_1579374000022641003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019594001', 'Rose Shattell', NULL, 'Member sent in a email on August 28, 2018 stating her husband landed a new job with full benefits that she will need to cancel her plan as of October 1, 2018. Sent email back that she has to fill out member cancellation survey then we will process her request. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-08-31 07:52:53', '2018-08-31 07:52:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022616005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819686', 'Christine Pembleton', NULL, '08.23.18:  Emailed Christine Spirit Dental Plan brochure and asked her to call me when she reviews it so we can discuss options.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-08-31 06:45:59', '2018-08-31 06:45:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022611003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925142', 'Kelly Schest', NULL, 'Sent request for additional MEC cards to ASI', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-08-30 14:53:13', '2018-08-30 14:53:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022608018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012064120', 'Robert Land', NULL, 'Discussed with Bob about him becoming a Healthcare Advisor.  He is hiring a new woman to sell our plans.  I explained he must get licensed as well as one else whom will be marketing our plans.  Plus both will need E&amp;O coverage and must complete our documents.  I emailed him the docs link.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-08-30 13:18:21', '2018-08-30 13:18:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022608013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012064120', 'Robert Land', NULL, 'Bob called about if our plan is consider Credible Coverage?  His daughter''s University (North Carolina) is asking to comply.  Spoke with John and he provided me the letter from Sedera to send him.  I told him it''s up the University to accept or not.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-08-30 13:15:26', '2018-08-30 13:15:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022608008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012064120', 'Robert Land', NULL, 'Returned call to Bob Land today.  He wanted to know his options to reduce his program cost with us.  He is on the Sedera Select plan.  I discussed the Acceess  5000 iua but it was higher than his current plan.   He wanted to stay where he is presently.  I then discussed a long time open subject about getting him set-up as an Healthcare Advisor.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-08-30 12:43:16', '2018-08-30 12:43:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022608003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779401', 'Kathleen Wilger', NULL, 'Called Kathleen and she was very happy to hear from me.  She wants to start referring member to us. She provided me the names: Beth Smith &amp; Jennifer Jordon.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-08-30 12:16:58', '2018-08-30 12:16:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022583008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819541', 'Jorge Usabiaga', NULL, 'sent out 4 additional QR life codes per request.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-30 11:40:10', '2018-08-30 11:40:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022583003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740226', 'David McMahon', NULL, 'I spoke to David and let him know that I had just e-mailed a letter from Sedera that he could use for his son''s school.  client seemed grateful, and in a meeting.   client presents himself as DAVID - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-30 09:58:31', '2018-08-30 09:58:31'),
