  ('zcrm_1579374000022555008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005207025', 'Tara Hedayat-Zadeh', NULL, 'Member called to cancel membership.  She wanted me to refund for several months.  I refunded for Aug.  Will deduct from next HES drop.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-08-30 08:10:59', '2018-08-30 08:10:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022555003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005041341', 'Emily Rea', NULL, 'The monthly amount returned by the bank also.  I have reached out to the member by email several times and called - left message. 
She responded that the account details she put on her application are correct.  I double checked what is in the system and it matched.  There are a couple of reasons for this... the bank changed the ABA number or zeros in front of the acct number.  She has been unresponsive since she said the numbers are correct.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-08-30 07:57:16', '2018-08-30 07:57:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022547008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009604129', 'Lori Frisbie', NULL, 'Call from Lori, She is up for renewal and is concerned she has not met her referral requirement. I gave her some tips and sent her an intro email that she can share. I also let her know that technically her obligation for the past year was met with the health risk assesment, but that she would have to refer at least 1 person/year going forward.', 'Jane Kassel', 'Jane Kassel', '2018-08-29 17:29:25', '2018-08-29 17:29:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022529041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630005', 'Michelle Badger', NULL, 'Michelle called because she was trying to upload some bills via the sedera app and a yellow bar on the top of the screen popped up saying that she needed to renew her membership.  I informed her that her account was active and that she needed to call sedera to let them know and have them trouble shoot it.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-29 14:47:34', '2018-08-29 14:47:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022508118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007925147', 'Linda Johnston', NULL, 'Sedera sent another check for 797.  discrepency down to $56.  Kelley calling to check her math.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-08-29 13:02:43', '2018-08-29 13:02:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022529033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022038370', 'Christine Allen', NULL, 'I spoke with Christy about how our prescription medication program worked and gave her some pricing.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-29 12:58:46', '2018-08-29 12:58:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022529023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022060028', 'Brianna Steed', NULL, 'Brianna''s mother called in to ask for assistance for her daughter getting brand name birth control pills.  I told her that I would do a price search for Brianna which I happily did, I texted the cheapest amount coupon as well as e-mailed her the price Reid could get her (which was far less) with contact info.- Brianna responded saying that she will contact Reid.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-29 12:44:07', '2018-08-29 13:04:26'),
