  ('zcrm_1579374000022174011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017078004', 'Jason Scheier', NULL, 'Jason called in to ask many many questions regarding preventative care and HSA account set up, I sent him a preventative care e-mail as well as an HSA one he was grateful for all of the time and help.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-23 11:40:12', '2018-08-23 11:40:12'),
