  ('zcrm_1579374000022108011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009836045', 'Henry Young', NULL, '8-21-18 Still in tenuous financial situation with unemployment and contract work. Making $573 weekly on unemployment now which is about $30K and C4 is still not great option for the price with plans starting at $418 mo with APTC of $335 or so. I suggested possibility of Self-Directed with knowing he''ll have to pay penalty in 2018 but brings cost down to $376 / $1500 member child.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-21 15:47:07', '2018-08-21 15:47:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022108003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839097', 'Karla Pastore', NULL, 'Looking to become AR with us. Doing health ins class Aug. 30-31. Can''t swing FL now bc too late. Needs her own coverage. Oct. 1st is earliest. Wants the cheapest option. Healthy, no smoking, etc. Currently no ins at all.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-21 14:49:50', '2018-08-21 14:49:58'),
