  ('zcrm_1579374000022089013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819686', 'Christine Pembleton', NULL, 'A pediatrician''s office called to get verification of benefits.  I told them that Christine does not have a traditional insurance plan and that she needed to call redirect.  John called Joan to let her know what was going on as well as called an left a voicemail with Christine.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-21 13:43:13', '2018-08-21 13:43:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022089008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111521', 'Douglas Powell', NULL, 'Doug wanted to make sure that he was cancelled and not charged again on the 24th.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-21 12:08:03', '2018-08-21 12:08:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022097003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939079', 'Patricia Mitchell', NULL, 'Panicked because she was told her colonoscopy is not preventative because of family history.  All set, peeled her off the ceiling and assured her it is covered.  One caveat, if polyps are discovered and removed and sent to pathology, that portion of the procedure is diagnostic.  Sedera will step in subject to IUA.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-08-21 10:26:26', '2018-08-21 10:26:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000022089003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830047', 'Robert Chavez', NULL, 'Paula (wife) called in to first talk with Jennie about some charges on their account and then wanted to get clear direction on what to do because a door just slammed on Roberts hands, he at least thought that it needed to be xrayed- I went over injury protocol.  Paula is very sharp and knows this product really well.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-21 09:41:10', '2018-08-21 09:41:10'),
