  ('zcrm_1579374000021810028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899026', 'Spencer Jacobson', NULL, 'Spencer called in wanting to know what to do about the bills that he incurred leading up now to $1000, for warts on his feet, he first was going to a dermatologist and then now acupuncture.   I told him that he needed to upload the bills to the Sedera app as well as to give them a call to work out how to share in this need because he is still needing treatments.  His warts appeared this past spring- so not pre-x. I told him to let me know how his phone call goes. I told him that acupuncture needs pre-approval.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-15 14:47:01', '2018-08-15 14:47:41'),
