  ('zcrm_1579374000021810013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299236', 'Sara Berry', NULL, 'Sara called in because she cannot log in to the US corporate site, I had already sent her an e-mail 2 days ago explaining that her information is not yet in the database and to wait until later on in the week.  Now we are playing phone tag while I am trying to explain that it will be more like the beginning of next week. That there isn''t an immediacy with it, but that we are behind in getting all of the new members out.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-15 09:30:09', '2018-08-15 09:30:09'),
