  ('zcrm_1579374000021810008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, 'Suzanne wanted to know how to go about getting a mammogram- I sent her a preventative care e-mail and helped her find the facility that she was considering. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-15 09:15:26', '2018-08-15 09:15:26'),
