  ('zcrm_1579374000021750067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022038086', 'Mary Ellen Richardson', NULL, '8-14-18 Mary Ellen had breast cancer in 2010 and had lumpectomy. They will call Dr. to make sure she can''t have a recurrence. She also has a thyroid issue for 42 years and takes synthroid and 1 dr. visit per year, down from 2 in past. They feel more comfortable with the Co-Pay network plan since they are used to that model. Difference in cost is only $15 a month so worthwhile. Synthroid is super cheap.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-14 13:52:37', '2018-08-14 13:52:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021750062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919232', 'gary kintz', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-08-14 13:31:05', '2018-08-14 13:31:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021756023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954027', 'Lynn Ryan', NULL, 'Lynn called in to ask about the proof of insurance that is asked by the schools for her children.  I told her that she could use her ASI card, and if pressed just try to explain what health care sharing option that she has for her family. I went over preventative care protocol as well, she said that I was super helpful.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-14 13:21:19', '2018-08-14 13:21:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021750057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023370023', 'Heather Seasonwein', NULL, 'Member just requested that we postpone her start date until 10/1', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-08-14 12:54:51', '2018-08-14 12:54:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021756018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822359', 'Heather Rose', NULL, 'Heather wanted to know how to handle a back issue with Chiropractic care, if it was covered at all.  I read her the Chiropractic membership guidelines, but told her to call Sedera and make sure that it would be something that they share in.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-14 12:43:42', '2018-08-14 12:43:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021750052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624144', 'Kim Merryweather', NULL, '8-14-18 Wanted to know what to do for her annual wellness visit today but membership begins Sept. 1st. So, told her to use her current coverage which she said is Scott and White. She will do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-14 11:59:10', '2018-08-14 11:59:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021766013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013046038', 'Bruce Oman', NULL, 'Spoke to Dania and Bruce.  Apparent miscommunication regarding the nature of his concern.  Pre-ex ..... Sedera thought the request for sharing was with the reconstructive surgery not just Prolia.  In speaking with Bruce, the medication is the primary issue.  This clarified things for Dania.  She will research resources available to Sedera for the medication.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-08-14 11:45:47', '2018-08-14 11:45:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021766008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740251', 'Evan Altman', NULL, 'Spoke at length with Lexi.  She spoke with Lori, the issue is the bill for the MRI indicates abnormalities which caused them to code as diagnostic (MRI''s are not typically used for preventative care) Lori is contacting the Doc to see if she can reach out to the hospital to have them re-code the bill.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-08-14 11:04:13', '2018-08-14 11:04:13'),
