  ('zcrm_1579374000021756008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012416075', 'Katherine Richardson', NULL, 'Katherine called to ask about switching doctors to have a physical done and ekg, after asking she was not told that she needed an ekg and there has been no symtomology leading to that decision, she just thought it was something that everybody got during their annual.  I helped her with the multiplan search engine to find a gastro doctor in her area, I told her that the attachment on that mailing had a list of all preventative care covered by her APEX plan.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-14 09:08:12', '2018-08-14 09:08:12'),
