  ('zcrm_1579374000021733021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919346', 'Troy Wells', NULL, '8-13-18 Very interested in Sedera bc of HSA compliance. No health issues. No health ins. Has looked previously and then just didn''t do it.  He''s going to share with his girlfriend who wants this also. Her name is Christy Lewis. Both have seasonal allergies and use Singulair, no tobacco, drugs or smoking, Christy bc.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-13 17:58:47', '2018-08-13 17:58:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021735018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014189260', 'Quentin Green III', NULL, 'Quentin''s dad called in because Quentin may have broken his ankle.  He wanted to know the process in a worst case scenario situation. I told him that we could find the best rate for an MRI if needed, as well as to call Sedera right before or just after they  know when the bills will go over their IUA. I gave him Sedera''s number. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-13 14:47:44', '2018-08-13 14:47:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021735013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, 'I spoke with Joanna about Ernesto''s experience at the Mayo clinic.  She told me that they had no out of pocket expenses, she said that was due to the fact that they never went to the registration desk because Ernesto planned ahead and filled it out online. The Dr just wants him to have a colonoscopy, a blood pressure check and a sleep apnea test when he gets back from his golf tournament. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-13 14:27:10', '2018-08-13 14:27:10'),
