  ('zcrm_1579374000021735008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679198', 'Kari Rosckowff', NULL, 'Kari called in very confused and frustrated,  she was looking on the Sedera site for the health assessment and to find a doctor.  I took her through the steps to log into the us corporate site,    explained how her ASI card works, sent her the preventative care e-mail, I let her know that she could download and print out the attachment so that she could see everything that is covered by her MEC card.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-13 13:04:08', '2018-08-13 13:04:08'),
