  ('zcrm_1579374000021735003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038018', 'Alisha Kreeger', NULL, 'Alisha called me from a waiting room asking me for her insurance information because she didn''t have it with her. I told her that she would be presenting herself as a self-paying patient, and that this need wouldn''t be covered until after her IUA was met. I told her to make sure she keeps detailed medical receipt  so that she can submit them to Sedera if she goes over.  I quickly went over preventive vs. injury/illness visits.  She also asked about the process behind her daughter getting her tonsils taken out.   I gave her a brief explanation, and told her that it is very important that she goes through a welcome call after she feels a bit better, she things that she tore something in her leg.  We also went over the e-mails that have been sent and not opened and how it is important that these messages get through to her.   She said that she is going to check to see what is going on with her e-mails, and get back to me about scheduling the welcome call.  She said she never received her APEX card.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-13 10:17:11', '2018-08-13 10:17:11'),
