  ('zcrm_1579374000021661013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474018', 'Marcia Maunder', NULL, 'Marcia called to ask about how to use the ASI card to use for her children''s school, I told her that her account showed that she was cancelled, she swore that she got a second chance from Julie and had already paid for this month. I got Patti involved, Patti told her that it didn''t look like she was "re-instated" at all and that we would get back to her after speaking with Jennie at the first of the week. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-10 14:36:06', '2018-08-10 14:36:06'),
