  ('zcrm_1579374000021661003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018402095', 'Chris Kuknyo', NULL, 'Chris called because Apex spelled his wifes name wrong, instead of May, they put Mary on the card. I told Chris that we would have to contact them, and have them send an updated card back out to them. No other questions- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-10 09:28:09', '2018-08-10 09:28:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021629016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809121', 'Annette Wolf', NULL, 'Member disputed the Aug charge with her cc.  She was refunded for the family amount and recharged for the member spouse.
