I will send a rebuttal to CC company.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-08-10 09:26:06', '2018-08-10 09:26:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021656008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819686', 'Christine Pembleton', NULL, '08.10.18:  Called Christine - left message that we do, in fact have a dental/vision insurance plan to offer.  Will get back to her with pricing when it is available.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-08-10 09:17:10', '2018-08-10 09:17:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021656003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819686', 'Christine Pembleton', NULL, '08.03.18:  Christine called. Needs dental & visiion for her children. Can get better pricing for medical, dental & vision for her kids through the FL state children''s program.  Wants to cancel her children from this program and just keep herself on it. Tried to change her I.U.A. to afford both health care programs but was told she couldn''t change until the assoc. anniversary date of 6.1.19.  I told her we will be offering a dental/vision program shortly and will present it to her as soon as it''s available.  We can then see what will fit her needs.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-08-10 09:15:52', '2018-08-10 09:15:52'),
