  ('zcrm_1579374000021572008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017307054', 'Michael Brooks', NULL, 'Member was borderline hostile from the onset of the welcome call. He seemed to be upset that mole checks were not covered by the preventative portion of the plan. He talked over me as well. The call was completed and he demonstrated verbal understanding of the plan.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-08-09 15:33:05', '2018-08-09 15:33:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021563018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819541', 'Jorge Usabiaga', NULL, '8-9-18 Talked with Zosza and recommended Jorge gets a 2nd opinion since told he has periodontal disease all of the sudden. They are going to a friend who can help. If he needs treatment they will call me and we can determine which Spirit plan will be best in this case.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-09 15:21:41', '2018-08-09 15:21:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021563013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083032', 'Sorel Haruf', NULL, '8-9-18 She called to ask about dental plans but I looked at discount and Spirit and Dentist Bryan Rieker is not in network from discount plan but is for Spirit. Cost of Spirit isn''t worth it since she has good teeth and no major needs.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-09 15:14:38', '2018-08-09 15:14:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021563008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026122744', 'Kimberly Payes', NULL, '8-9-18 Looked up Dentists DDP Israelson and Leypoldt at Louisville Family Dentist and neither are in the network for dental discount plans or Spirit.  Told her to ask office who they accept, if any.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-09 14:54:27', '2018-08-09 14:54:27'),
