  ('zcrm_1579374000021563003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919520', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, '8-9-18 Called to get a few questions answered. He''ll do a 2nd follow up call with Concierge for Welcome call. He needed more time to get all questions answered. 2nd call should be sufficient now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-09 14:43:28', '2018-08-09 14:43:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021542003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919520', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, 'Dechen called to ask how he would go about having the smoking charge off of his monthly share amount with Sedera. I spoke with Patti, and called Dechen but got his voicemail. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-09 13:16:55', '2018-08-09 13:16:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021529008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026122744', 'Kimberly Payes', NULL, '8-9-18 Lives in Boulder. Loves the concept. Admittedly resistant to change but tired of paying so much to Kaiser even though loves her doctor and will be more time consuming to file paperwork which isn''t her forte. But, truly loves this concept.  Wants to change for Sept. 1st start date. Already fully funds her HSA with HSA Bank (I think) every year. Thinking of choosing $1000/$249 since super healthy but may want $500 in case lands in ER for any weird reason.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-09 12:58:02', '2018-08-09 12:58:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021529003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020350047', 'John Knowlton', NULL, '8-9-18 John called to better understand prescriptions. He has the LibertyRX card and Welldyne RX plus Concierge. He''s going to talk with John tomorrow to see if he needs LibertyRX or not and what prices are through our program. John''s going to call Apex to find out how to learn of pricing for meds for members once they are current members.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-09 10:56:41', '2018-08-09 10:56:41'),
