  ('zcrm_1579374000021416056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862244', 'Andrew Racuch', NULL, 'I spoke with Regina for awhile today, I sent her husband a prescription medication quote form to fill out, she said went over tests that Andrew needed to have so I told her that she should call Sedera because it sounded like it was going to go over their IUA. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-08 12:47:30', '2018-08-08 12:47:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021395013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919192', 'Tanya Bell', NULL, '8-8-18 Came to me via Elmer Jackson and Lucious (biz partners) who Tanya works for. They discovered she hasn''t had health ins in years since about 2010. They want to help pay for it. It will cost about $278 / $1500 IUA. Better than C4 options bc so high with ded. APTC would be about $239 a month. She talked with me months ago about MPB group plan. This will be easier since she won''t have to refer anyone and cost is similar for 1st year. Told her current cost when turns 50. She will discuss with Elmer Jackson and Lucius Ashby and we''re talking again next Tuesday.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-08 12:45:43', '2020-04-28 12:21:43'),
