  ('zcrm_1579374000021388059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624180', 'Samantha Pasley', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail as a reminder to book 15 minute welcome call online. Left a detailed  message on voicemail for Gary Lowe as well if he can remind her as also. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-08-08 10:23:34', '2018-08-08 10:25:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021388054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862358', 'Edward Judd', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Ed and his wife. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-08-08 10:21:41', '2018-08-08 10:21:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021416046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899526', 'Andrew Dougherty', NULL, 'Andrew called and wanted me to send him a coupon for tamsulosin 0.4 mg x 180 to his phone. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-08 10:14:39', '2018-08-08 10:14:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021432026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026202179', 'Erin Graham', NULL, 'After speaking to Erin she sent me a statement from her provider.  She told me that her doctor charges $1000 per year and gives her unlimited access.  However when asked doc said they were not a DPC.  All she was able to provide was a itemized statement of medical services.  I advised that I would need an invoice for the $1000 and what services that would cover.  I sent her back to Jane to talk about alternatives.  She ended up on the PSD this way she could pay for her doc out of an HSA.  She will re-enroll on our side and I will inform Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-08-08 10:13:50', '2018-08-08 10:13:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021416041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020482017', 'Steven Thomas', NULL, 'Steve called in with a very bad sinus infection, I hung on the line with him while he registered for Teladoc to make sure everything went smoothly .- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-08 10:01:20', '2018-08-08 10:01:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021416036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656193', 'Char Moe', NULL, 'a doctors office called us to see if Char Moe was eligible for benefits,  they were given our phone number. I explained the benefits that Char Moe does have through her ASI card as preventative care only -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-08 09:52:25', '2018-08-08 09:52:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021388043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299236', 'Sara Berry', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Went over the process several times. Told her if she has any questions or concerns give us a call were here to help. Member was very nice. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-08-08 09:23:27', '2018-08-08 09:28:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021416031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033102', 'Scott Byrne', NULL, 'Scott called in this morning and said that he needed to use our counseling service, I gave him the number to Sedera''s counseling service. He sounded really, really low.  I am going to reach out to him later. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-08 08:42:45', '2018-08-08 08:42:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021388038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033271', 'Shannon Drake', NULL, 'On member''s voicemail states she doesn''t respond to voicemail to not leave a message just leave send email. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-08-08 08:41:19', '2018-08-08 08:41:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021435003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006585073', 'Kelly Hastedt', NULL, 'From: Kelly Hastedt
Sent: Wednesday, August 8, 2018 7:50 AM
To: admin@myahe.org
Subject: Card being declined

Good morning, 

