  ('zcrm_1579374000021370053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939155', 'Shawn Bisaillon', NULL, 'Anna called in because she has a really bad bug bite, Teladoc couldn''t help her because they had her sex as Male. From the start I told her to go to urgent care if needed. She was upset about Teladoc not working for her and the gender that was in the system.  I called Dania, who was very kind and helpful, she said that she could either use Teledoc, or go to urgent care and Sedera would pay for it.   Anna was very grateful for all of the help and is going to urgent care, she said that it looks like something bad bit her. I told her to keep us in the loop.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-07 15:14:53', '2018-08-07 15:14:53'),
