  ('zcrm_1579374000021305018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291523', 'Norma Huibregtse', NULL, 'Member owes 4 months very soon to be 5.  I left a VM letting her know that if we do not hear from her or we do not receive any pmt her account will cancel on 8/15.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-08-03 12:53:35', '2018-08-03 12:53:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021288023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871160', 'Katie Roth', NULL, 'Katie called in because she has a condition that she says is genetic- and she ages she gets excess skin over her eyelids, it is getting worse and she would like it removed.  I told her that as long as it is medically necessary and not something that is "pre-existing" it will be covered. She said that her mother has also needed to get the surgery.   I told her that she would have to speak with Sedera on the matter.', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-03 12:49:17', '2018-12-05 12:16:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021288018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451062', 'Patricia Bedell', NULL, 'Patricia called in very nervous about how to use this plan, she was told that that all of the clinics and Dr offices that her family uses are on "the plan". I told her that I would be more than happy as to find them on the multiplan site. She declined. I told her that she would need to call ASI about the vaccines that her kids needed as well as check on the Dr offices that someone told her were in network. I also sent out a scheduler for a welcome call so she could learn how all of the different components work together.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-03 11:38:19', '2018-08-03 11:38:19'),
