  ('zcrm_1579374000021322008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881658', 'James Lynch', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-08-03 09:37:32', '2018-08-03 09:37:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021322003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881678', 'Marcus Christianson', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-08-03 09:33:10', '2018-08-03 09:33:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021288008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716907', 'Joleen Gerber', NULL, 'Originally her question was to get a well womens'' visit,  and then it turned into wanting to address possible hormone issues, lethargy, AND she thinks that it MAY have to do with getting an IUD this past year.   She also had questions concerning the Multiplan search. She admittedly was frustrated and lost in the process.   She wrote down many notes, and many questions.  I asked if she wanted help with the MultiPlan search twice, she declined.  I also let her know the difference between a preventative visit and a unwell visit, that the preventative is covered with no out of pocket, whereas illness/unwellness visits are cash paid. She said that she is going to schedule a preventative visit, I said that was fine as long as she knew that there may be some out of pocket expense. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-03 09:17:46', '2018-08-03 09:17:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021287043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004755088', 'Mary Federico', NULL, 'Member disputed the July 2018 charge with her CC.  She has been cancelled.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-08-03 09:01:39', '2018-08-03 09:01:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021305003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695463', 'Steven Pope', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 30-39 IUA PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-08-03 08:57:29', '2018-08-13 13:11:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021299003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578137', 'Rachel Fisher Ingraham', NULL, 'Rachel called because she tried telling her son''s camp about the ASI card, and what John had gone over with her on July 30, but she said that the camps'' response was "what happens to him in an emergency?" I told her since the camp didn''t like the ASI card idea, that she should try explaining to the camp about Sedera,  that she should be contacted at that time, and idealy she should be the one calling Sedera. Rachel then pushed back and asked "well what if they can''t get ahold of me, then what do they do?" So I said she could explain cost sharing to them and see if they are comfortable enough with that.  That usually the ASI route works.  She is concerned that she may have to pay for supplemental insurance.- KC', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-08-03 08:31:57', '2018-08-03 08:31:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021288003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447212', 'Charlene Bocek', NULL, 'Charlene wanted to know the process of going to get a "spot on my lip" checked out.  I told her that she would present herself as a cash paying patient, that she should ask for a cash discount, and to ask for a detailed medical bill that included codes at the end- if the incident began to snowball into a need greater than her IUA, then she would submit all of the bills to Sedera at that time. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-03 07:29:21', '2018-08-03 07:29:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021232023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624144', 'Kim Merryweather', NULL, '8-2-18 55, very healthy, no meds, no smoking but broke wrist 2 weeks ago bc of her cat tripped her. Insurance is covering nothing! She''s paying $900 a month and $7300 mop. Super upset at how horrible regular ins. is.  Already has mammogram and colonoscopy scheduled for early Sept. Thought she''d have to pay for it with her traditional plan too but can''t get it scheduled earlier. Wants me to send her vision and dental discount plan. I should help her enroll in these when she enrolls in HEP.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-02 22:14:56', '2018-08-02 22:14:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021271045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005995075', 'Daniel Yechout', NULL, 'Called and sent an email regarding HRA.', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-08-02 17:09:53', '2018-08-02 17:09:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021271034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568091', 'Caterina Savino', NULL, 'Request to updated email to caterina.savino@gmail.com. Recovered password and completed HRA. Spoke for an hour. Awesome lady!', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-08-02 15:03:40', '2018-08-02 15:47:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021271029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005273011', 'Tina Le', NULL, 'Called and sent message regarding HRA', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-08-02 14:52:41', '2018-08-02 14:52:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021271024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165427', 'Melissa Mitchell', NULL, 'Sent email and called regarding HRA', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-08-02 14:39:09', '2018-08-02 14:39:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021239011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362044', 'Therese Antonino', NULL, 'Therese called in to ask a few questions, one about HSA bank and signing up, the "secret code" on the mpowring.com site,  and how can she get her thyroid blood work without her ASI card. I told her that the card would not apply in this case because her blood work did not fall under wellness or preventative. She was ok with that. Thankful for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-02 14:14:32', '2018-08-02 14:14:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021274003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001637159', 'Gretchen Wegner', NULL, 'Sent member a coupon for her prescription per request via text and email', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-08-02 13:28:43', '2018-08-02 13:28:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021232018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021903046', 'Paul Pepin', NULL, '8-2-18 Pastor for 30 years. With BC/BS for that long and great plan but leaving soon to be missionary now. Healthy, just skin cancer spot removed. He and wife run a few half marathons every year, in good health. Planning to move from Columbia, SC to FL in next few months.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-08-02 12:18:37', '2018-08-02 12:18:37'),
