  ('zcrm_1579374000021078003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006723029', 'Leah Sparks', NULL, 'called to cancel because she is turning 65 on the 12 of August. She said she really enjoyed our help and services and she is sorry that she is leaving. I guided her to the MPowering Site to show her where the cancellation form was, and I told her that I would let Patti know, and wished her a happy birthday.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-08-01 07:43:47', '2018-08-01 07:43:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021077003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243146', 'Patricia Lekawa', NULL, 'Per Rod member should be refunded for 2 months + Set up fee.  We will send out check.  I will notify ASi &amp; Sedera', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-08-01 07:38:32', '2018-08-01 07:38:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021038018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, 'Joanna called to ask questions about her temp ASI card, I went over that with her. She booked an appointment with Dr Chlopek for Aug 8, and is so excited to be able to tell him this!  She thanked John and I for all of the help. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-31 14:09:32', '2018-07-31 14:09:32'),
