  ('zcrm_1579374000021019035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798119', 'Rashke Catlin', NULL, 'Rashke (first name) called in.  Dr. recommended bone density test as well as mammogram.  I instructed her to be sure the prescription be coded as preventative.  She will let me know if there is any pushback or balance billing from the provider. Sally Jobe Imaging is in network.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-07-31 13:42:21', '2018-07-31 13:42:21'),
