  ('zcrm_1579374000021038008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798119', 'Rashke Catlin', NULL, 'Rashke called in due to her bone density and mammogram being cancelled because they didn''t recognize the MEC card.   I looked at her account as well as tried to do a search for the doctor/facilities that she was at because she had never looked on Multiplan. - John handled the rest of the call and found that the facility was in network, warned her that the bone density may not be covered and told her to go ahead with the mamogram.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-31 13:28:21', '2018-07-31 13:28:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021038003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009604129', 'Lori Frisbie', NULL, 'Lori called in to ask again about seeing a preventative care Dr, she seemed a bit nervous and unsure of herself so I stayed on the phone and helped her learn how to use the Multiplan site. I helped her find the doctor her mother has!  -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-31 12:58:45', '2018-07-31 12:58:45'),
