  ('zcrm_1579374000021003028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939004', 'Mary J Lineback', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-31 11:17:59', '2018-07-31 11:17:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021034003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005310033', 'Patricia Schwartz', NULL, 'Updated member CC, email, and cell phone.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-07-31 11:08:40', '2018-07-31 11:08:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021032003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351133', 'Brian DeCamp', NULL, '7-31-18 Calling Cloud to see if he can add his spouse. Cost with DPC for $1000 IUA and spouse is $469 according to Patti. Price is different than sheet I put together. So, go with her price.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-31 10:56:25', '2018-07-31 10:56:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021003023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005203', 'Mark DellaPosta', NULL, '7/30-I emailed member advising him that if we do not receive alternate method of payment by tomorrow 7/31 he will be cancelled.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-31 10:26:46', '2018-07-31 10:26:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021003018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830168', 'Laura Zaunbrecher', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member asked if planned parenthood is a  provider in PHCS Network. Told her to call and if not you can try to nominate them in. If out of network doctor there can be out of pocket expenses. might not be 100% covered. Only 130% medicare allowable. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-31 10:14:48', '2018-07-31 10:14:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021003013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695112', 'Donovan Kahler', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $500 IUA 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-31 09:56:30', '2018-08-13 08:46:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021003008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014189198', 'Janet Ruggiano', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Reminded her of overdue health risk assessment. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-31 09:19:43', '2018-07-31 09:19:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021019003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, 'Spoke to Joanna, cards requested 7/26.  will follow up with Lexi....', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-07-31 08:57:58', '2018-07-31 08:57:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000021003003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351133', 'Brian DeCamp', NULL, 'Member called in after hours requesting to add new spouse to plan.  I asked weather spouse will have a DPC doc as he does and he advised me that  his Doc is not accepting patients.  I advised that this was a problem as both member must have DPC if getting discount.  I told him that I would send out Member change form.  I will contact Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-31 07:16:34', '2018-07-31 07:16:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020981018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841172', 'Shoshana Kressler', NULL, '7-30-18 They are interested in LHS but asked about Boulder Medical Center and Billing. They are Not easy to work with. Also interested in Cloud. I suggested only part of family enroll but realize that will not fly with keeping family together for membership!  Sam was laid off and Shoshana wants to get pregnant soon, in the next few months. 2 yr old goes to Dr. about 2-3x per yr beyond the annual wellness. I should let them know Cloud is FULL at the moment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-30 15:14:11', '2018-07-30 15:14:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020981013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471144', 'Scott Kendrick', NULL, '7-30-18 Member 673604719 For National General STM Aug. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-30 15:02:58', '2018-07-30 15:02:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020965018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578137', 'Rachel Fisher Ingraham', NULL, 'Spoke to Rachel.  Told her to use the infomation on her ASI card to serve as proof of insurance for her kids..... explanation of medical cost sharing might result in more questions than answers.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-07-30 14:38:14', '2018-07-30 14:38:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020976023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012064146', 'Nghi Finley', NULL, 'Sent email to Wendy Scipione to reach out to this member with information on dental plans. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-30 11:13:29', '2018-07-30 11:13:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020974008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647085', 'Christopher Lopez', NULL, 'Chris called in to ask questions surrounding the Sedera letter that went out,   and said that he and his wife were going to compare this plan with the one that is available at her job now. I went over questions and he said that he was still confused about how to use this plan in real life. I told him that it would help if he did another welcome call with Liz and asked some questions. Client was happy for the suggestion. He said he will make a list of questions.   I sent a scheduler and will speak with Liz.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-30 11:03:08', '2018-07-30 11:03:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020976018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005318258', 'Gina Yaeger', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member was driving during the call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-30 10:26:06', '2018-07-30 10:26:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020977013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003167005', 'Jackaline Brown', NULL, '07.30.18:  Tried to email Jackie but email was returned.  Called her to wish her a happy birthday. Also let her know that Gina Yaeger enrolled, so Jackie will receive  her $100 referral fee.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-07-30 10:13:47', '2018-07-30 10:13:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020977008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005318258', 'Gina Yaeger', NULL, '07.30.18:  Called Gina. Reviewed w/her the process of emails coming from MPB and Sedera. Told her to call 800-519-2969 to ask the status of when she would receive her membership materials from Sedera and MPB.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-07-30 10:07:31', '2018-07-30 10:07:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020976013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779317', 'Amber Strickler', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-30 10:03:36', '2018-07-30 10:03:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020976008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809245', 'Eliza Katzin', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-30 09:58:22', '2018-07-30 09:58:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020977003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005318258', 'Gina Yaeger', NULL, '07.29.18:  Recvd. email from Gina. Has not yet received any materials, calls, emails with instructions or welcome package, etc. Asked me to call her.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-07-30 09:51:24', '2018-07-30 09:51:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020941018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431043', 'David Edmonson', NULL, 'Received notification that this member put a stop payment on the bank draft.  I sent out email with Payment update form.  Gave him deadline of tomorrow 7/31.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-30 09:26:34', '2018-07-30 09:26:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020976003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919740', 'Maria Hennessey', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail to have her call us back to confirm correct address for her check for completion of health risk assessment was returned back to us. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-30 09:16:14', '2018-07-30 09:16:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020941013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017815039', 'Katrinia Garcia', NULL, '7/26 Left VM for this member re: NSF I will email her and advise her that if we do not hear anything from her by tomorrow 7/31 she will be cancelled for non Payment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-30 07:50:15', '2018-07-30 07:50:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020974003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003236005', 'Peter Dubitsky (Brown)', NULL, 'Peter called in because this past Wednesday he may have injured his knee while working out- at first he thought it may be a bad cramp, but now his knee is making a loud "pop", I told him where to find the provider list on the LIberty site, and that if he doen''t find one in his area, that he should call Liberty and ask for assistance, I also told him that he should contact the pre-approval number as well, so they can go over what to expect and that if he ever has issue with billing to give John a call. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-30 07:30:14', '2018-07-30 07:30:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020941008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111152', 'Tara Frix', NULL, 'Spoke to JC.  He didn''t have time but will reach out to me at the beginning of the week.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-07-27 15:02:35', '2019-12-23 08:42:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020939023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'I spoke to Sondra for a bit, she was wondering about letters that she received from ASI about contacting Sedera, she was in the car and didn''t have them on her, so I told her to e-mail them to me.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-27 14:07:04', '2018-07-27 14:07:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020965008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026202179', 'Erin Graham', NULL, 'I texted Jane to provide proof of DPC coverage', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-27 13:38:39', '2018-07-27 13:38:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020965003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026202179', 'Erin Graham', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA DPC', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-27 13:37:47', '2018-07-27 13:37:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020939018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881409', 'Kimberly Johnson', NULL, 'Kim said that her 1 year old son has a granuloma on his belly button, when asked if this was pre existing, she said that he had always had an issue with a "herniated belly button" at one point they thought that it was healing but now the granuloma,  she was given 2-3 different phone numbers for surgeons.  She has not seen anyone yet, but wanted to know the process, I said that first- everything is to be cash paid, second- she should see one or a few of those surgeons so that she can get their opinion/s,  utilize 2nd MD if she is sure that she wants the surgery done,  give Sedera a call so they can be aware that all of this is happening. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-27 13:17:14', '2018-07-27 13:17:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020930013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012064146', 'Nghi Finley', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Inquired about the email she received about dental plans. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-27 11:42:37', '2018-07-27 11:42:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020939013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819433', 'Kaimey Ela', NULL, 'Kaimey called in about needing to have blood work done and is so new to the program she was nervous and wanted help knowing what to say and what to expect.  I asked what the blood work was for and she said that "just blood work that my doctor draws to check my hormone levels" I told her that she would have to pay out of pocket but gave her tips as to what to say as well as went over the directlabs.com site with her and how it works.  She then asked if her best bet would be to submit all of these bills after she reaches over her $1000 IUA, and I asked her how long ago she began to get regular blood draws to check her hormones.  She started back pedaling and I asked was it at least a month ago, she said that about a month ago she saw a Dr and then lost her health insurance and just signed up with us. She sounded really overwhelmed,  I told her that it would come down to the initial visit she had with her Dr, what was said, symptoms and or diagnosis.  She was really nice, just overwhelmed, so I had John speak with her.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-27 11:22:01', '2018-07-27 11:22:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020939008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, 'Joanna called and we went over the e-mail that I sent her going over the doctors I found for them. She is so grateful for all of the help and will reach out to me again if needed.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-27 10:55:24', '2018-07-27 10:55:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020930008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862462', 'Randy James', NULL, 'Spoke to Richawna, the wife of Randy. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-27 10:45:14', '2018-07-27 10:45:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020941003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006737059', 'Julie Bannerton', NULL, 'Left message for Daniel.....', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-07-27 10:28:33', '2018-07-27 10:28:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020939003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005553143', 'Craig Celentano', NULL, 'Mary Lee called in and spoke with John about what is going on with the MRI billing,  when John receives the billing via e-mail he is going to upload it in the Liberty sharebox, as well as get in touch with someone over at Liberty about getting this finally paid. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-27 10:24:35', '2018-07-27 10:24:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020930003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919154', 'Bryan Jinks', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-27 09:54:32', '2018-07-27 09:54:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020897008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017126041', 'Steven Strehlow', NULL, 'Julie called in here as well as Sedera to ask questions about her either joining Steven''s plan or having her own membership with us. She spoke with Patti about a few things but is now going to give Jane a call.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-27 09:03:15', '2018-07-27 09:03:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020916003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610361', 'Jarod Carter', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Reminded him of overdue health risk assessment. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-27 08:44:46', '2018-07-27 08:45:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020911003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779530', 'Jaelynne Lay', NULL, 'Spoke to Jaelynne, she had a number of questions.  Answered her questions and resent welcome packet as well as link to schedule welcome call.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-07-27 08:23:05', '2018-07-27 08:23:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020891008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005203', 'Mark DellaPosta', NULL, 'Left VM to check on status of new CC for Aug Pmt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-27 07:37:05', '2018-07-27 07:37:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020897003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010460007', 'Madonna Kilcollum', NULL, 'Madonna has reached our with exact blood work codes to see if they will be covered by ASI- I sent them to Lexi to ask.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-27 07:35:47', '2018-07-27 07:35:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020891003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752418', 'Stacia Baker', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation Survey effective 8/1.  I notified ASi &amp; Sedera.  Also refunded August Share amount.  Will cancel month &amp; yearly drafts from bank', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-27 07:15:04', '2018-07-27 07:15:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020860024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005553143', 'Craig Celentano', NULL, 'Mary Lee, Craig''s wife called in to get help with a large bill, $1357.30 from an MRI that Craig had, she says that she called in and spoke to John at length. That John said not to worry, that he would work out a deal with Liberty to pay for all of it besides an agreed upon price of $195 - she also thinks that John passed off this deal to me (Kelly) to make it happen.  I asked if she had seen her sharebox, and she said yes, that there was nothing in it. I suggested to her that it may not have ever been submitted, but she has alot of faith in the MRI place that it was submitted.  I told her that I would let John know about it and either get back to her tonight. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-26 15:05:46', '2018-07-26 15:05:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020873003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819039', 'Matthew VerMilyea', NULL, 'Called Lucy and left a VM stating the HRA invitation has not yet gone out for July and that they will be receiving the invitation via email.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-07-26 14:00:08', '2018-07-26 14:00:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020845017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, 'MEC cards and temp ordered.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-07-26 13:33:54', '2018-07-26 13:33:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020860019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000243019', 'Rachel Streater', NULL, 'what an awesome day getting Rachel "way better" prices on her 15 different medications. Reid helped greatly in this! KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-26 12:43:00', '2018-07-26 12:43:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020860011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, 'I did a Dr search for Alema to get Jose into an annual physical exam to get checked out as well as routine bloodwork. She goes to see Dr Kirk Anderson herself, and asked if I could find him on the plan. I did, she is thrilled!  Also John sent out a request for temp ASI card to be e-mailed over as well as a hard copy send- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-26 12:33:50', '2018-07-26 12:34:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020860003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, 'wife''s name- ALEMA RODRIGUES - 480-276-2668 -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-26 11:49:26', '2018-07-26 11:50:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020858003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243146', 'Patricia Lekawa', NULL, '7-26-28  Pat (husband) called wanting to speak to me regarding a prior conversation he had requesting to cancel.  He claimed he was very disturbed about the way he and his wife were handled on inbound call conversations.  He wanted me to have the CEO call him.  I got the call from him today and Rod called him and discussed the situation and authorized a full refund including the set-up charge.  I emailed him the termination form today.  bcc a copy to Patty.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-07-26 11:43:59', '2018-07-26 12:00:25'),
