  ('zcrm_1579374000020762008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695264', 'Lorie Moreno-Roch', NULL, '7-25-18 Completed IHC STM for Lorie and kids for Aug. About $548 or so for 4 of them. Completing HEP Assoc app right now for $500 IUA/$657 mo. Husband had aortic dissection on heart 10/30/14. He''s on blood pressure and cholesterol meds. She''s putting him on traditional ins. Not worth the risk with his heart issues. Rest of family on HEP Assoc. Choosing Bright Health for husband at $748.88 Silver plan. Rest of family is health and no meds. Stephen (kid) 21 lives in DC and Christian (F) may travel to many countries during gap year this year. She''s only 18 now and will go back to school in Sept. of 2019. Son will be 16 very soon and healthy. They also want dental and vision basic plans. I sent them the dental and vision discount plans.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-25 17:49:36', '2018-07-25 17:49:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020717008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083052', 'Machelle Evans', NULL, 'Machelle called with many questions regarding many questions firstly, she called in thinking that we were Sedera - I gave her the number but she wanted to speak to someone about a letter that was sent from ASI, being threatening in tone about enrolling someone or else she would be booted out of her membership with us. John found out that Machelle is going through a lot, she is facing hysterectomy surgery very soon,  and needs some understanding and hand holding to get there.  John has contacted Sedera to ask that they make sure to do this. He made the client feel more at ease. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-25 14:34:00', '2018-07-25 14:34:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020735003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012379061', 'Lindsay Patterson', NULL, 'Left message', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-07-25 13:15:37', '2018-07-25 13:15:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020727003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017815039', 'Katrinia Garcia', NULL, 'Tried to call customer, but the service picked up and doesn''t know who she is. She answered email by saying she wants to know if she is deactivated? Will email again.', 'Julie Bloomdahl', 'Julie Bloomdahl', '2018-07-25 12:38:30', '2018-07-25 12:53:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020725003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624180', 'Samantha Pasley', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA 30-39 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-25 12:13:57', '2018-08-10 13:49:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020717003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819248', 'Linda Pan', NULL, 'Linda called in to go over the exact steps of how to get birth control. I spent a lot of time explaining every detail,  she seemed a bit overwhelmed about going to see a Dr, so I told her about Nurx app, she was really excited about that idea, and thanked me for all of the help.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-25 12:04:04', '2018-07-25 12:04:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020667021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862244', 'Andrew Racuch', NULL, 'I spent about 40 min on the phone with Regina, she said she had the welcome call but still didn''t really understand. She could not find the e-mails that were sent, I resent them and she never got them. We agreed that she would ask Andrew to help her when he got home to find the spam folder. I went over the Multi Plan site, we searched for doctors and facilities,  what is covered and what is not- she wanted me to find a facility that does 3D mammograms and I told her that it wouldn''t be covered. She was a bit taken back but wasn''t too upset she wanted to know if she could pay the difference with ASI, I said that she could speak to them about it but that they will probably say the same thing.  Updated e-mail address.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-25 11:06:48', '2018-07-25 11:12:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020675056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010340009', 'James Marciano', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Sent email in regards to HSA. James wanted me to check if his referral Chris Martine enrolled. Chris Martine enrolled as of June 1, 2018  Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-25 10:56:07', '2018-07-25 11:18:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020703003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725092', 'Mark Garcia', NULL, '7-25-18 Rarely use ins. But broke wrist in Nov. 2017 and ded. reset again in Jan. So, basically not getting any coverage for wrist bc of high ded. Only paying $300+ a month bc of income and APTC. Income at $73K in 2016 and about the same est for 2018. She prefers a per incident option. Husband is self-employed. One kid out of state college Univ. of UT and pays separately through school. Another kid 19 in school FT and then planning to go straight to grad school. Trying to decide when to no longer account 19 yr old as dependent. Told her to talk to accountant. Also 12 yr old on CHP+. Had an HSA a while back but no longer funding it bc costs are so high for ins. She was one more 3 month check up for her wrist which she knows she''ll have to pay for as self-pay but paying anyhow bc didn''t reach ded. Will likely opt for $1000 IUA 485 since accustomed to only paying $300+ right now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-25 10:39:38', '2018-07-25 10:39:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020675048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014765004', 'Samuel Berryman', NULL, 'Spoke to Misty booked her 15 minute welcome call for Thursday, July 26,2018 at 10:00 a.m. central time/11:00 a.m. eastern time', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-25 10:13:05', '2018-07-25 10:13:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020699003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299236', 'Sara Berry', NULL, 'Update:  Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-25 10:09:43', '2018-07-25 10:09:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020667013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740251', 'Evan Altman', NULL, 'Lori called to speak to John about where the best place would be to get an EKG and Stress Test.  I did some research and sent it over to Lori while she waits for a call back if needed. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-25 10:08:42', '2018-07-25 10:33:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020675043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647211', 'Jacqueline Woodward', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-25 09:49:54', '2018-07-25 09:49:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020692008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330090', 'Michelle Preuss', NULL, '7-25-18  Lead given to me from Patti B.  Called and left vm for Michelle to return my call.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-07-25 09:30:37', '2018-07-25 09:30:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020675038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086068', 'Janet Nichols', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-25 09:30:08', '2018-07-25 09:30:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020675033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016626048', 'John Cutshall', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-25 09:15:30', '2018-07-25 09:15:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020667008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819248', 'Linda Pan', NULL, 'I sent Linda two e-mails this morning with all of the guidelines surrounding her 2nd MD question as well as the questions surrounding generic birth control. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-25 09:08:32', '2018-07-25 09:08:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020692003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299236', 'Sara Berry', NULL, '7-25-18  Sara called me to confirm her requested changes were completed. I checked with Patti today and she confirmed it was all done.  I called Sara and left a detailed message that her requests were completed.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-07-25 09:01:10', '2018-07-25 09:01:10'),
