  ('zcrm_1579374000020606008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299236', 'Sara Berry', NULL, 'Member added Husband &amp; other son.  I will notify Sedera and bill an additional $183 for family coverage and adjust monthly billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-24 08:09:15', '2018-07-24 08:09:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020606003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081107338', 'David Sepac', NULL, 'Member opted to change from Association to MPB Group.  I will notify Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-24 07:29:48', '2018-07-24 07:29:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020600003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497204', 'Charles Strother', NULL, 'Member called to change his IUA.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-07-24 07:00:59', '2018-07-24 07:00:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020595008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299236', 'Sara Berry', NULL, 'updated family info at customers request.', 'Julie Bloomdahl', 'Julie Bloomdahl', '2018-07-24 06:26:35', '2018-07-24 06:26:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020595003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086178', 'Kristine Smith', NULL, 'Changed address at customer request.', 'Julie Bloomdahl', 'Julie Bloomdahl', '2018-07-24 06:21:40', '2018-07-24 06:21:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020590003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299236', 'Sara Berry', NULL, '7-23-18  Sara called and inquired about needed changes to her coverage.  Her husband is with Anthem and was going to stay on his plan but found out removing Sara and children would increase his month premium to over $1000/month.  She want to add Eric onto the plan.  She also reconsidered and now wants change the IUA on the plan.  Looking at her file discovered that her son Lucus was not shown and somehow did not get put on the plan.   I spoke with Patti as how we should handle this and she said she would send Sara a change form for her to complete ASAP.    I called Sara back and told her Patti was sending the form and to complete it today and return immediately.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-07-23 18:55:58', '2018-07-23 18:56:18'),
