  ('zcrm_1579374000020541003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081107338', 'David Sepac', NULL, '7-23-18 David is his official name but he goes by Andy. He''s 49 and hasn''t had ins. in a few years. Healthy, works out every day, eats healthy, no tobacco. $278/$1500 I quoted him. I forgot he should be offered MPB Group plan bc referred in by current member. Need to let him know we can change his plan if he''s willing to do health assessment and 1 referral per year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-23 10:53:56', '2018-07-23 10:53:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020531013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086178', 'Kristine Smith', NULL, 'August 2018 payment declined.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-07-23 10:38:29', '2018-07-23 10:38:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020535003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001060051', 'Matthew Ross', NULL, 'I called Matt.  Explained that when, in the course of a preventative care screening (colonoscopy), abnormal findings are discovered that require pathology, it is by definition diagnostic in nature and therefore falls out of the realm of preventative services.  He understands, still not totally happy but ok.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-07-23 10:35:06', '2018-07-23 10:35:06'),
