  ('zcrm_1579374000020512013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044781088', 'Ramandeep Singh', NULL, '7-20-18 Raman is choosing the $500 IUA $657 Member/Child for Aug. 1st start date. Enrolling now. UPDATE he got nervous from some of the language in the application. He''s going to talk with Andre further about Medical Cost Sharing and it''s solvency first. He''ll opt for Cobra or for this but for a Sept 1st start and go with Cobra for June-Aug or beyond. Going to the UK tomorrow and back Aug. 5th and will deal with it then.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-20 16:11:59', '2018-07-20 17:04:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020515023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497052', 'Kelli Sandberg', NULL, 'Ryan called in, cancellation link has been sent to Kelli by Patti, they were told that they would receive a refund if funds are pulled out monday. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-20 14:57:25', '2018-07-20 14:57:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020515018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740251', 'Evan Altman', NULL, 'Lori called today, unsure as to why her ASI card wasn''t accepted at publix pharmacy for a new need, new condition of mold that she has and needs all of these meds to fight off.  I went through all of the meds and sent her a coupon. She said I was a god-send. I sent her Reids info so she can call and ask for the epi pen price, as well as the prescription medication form so I can continue to help her out. --Nystatin 5000000 u oral tab x120 - Vacyclavir 1 grm x30 - epipen - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-20 14:33:25', '2018-07-20 14:33:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020521008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003496005', 'Matthew Stull', NULL, 'Spoke to Matthew.  Printing out bills to sort them out.  Told him I would be in touch early next week.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-07-20 13:41:05', '2018-07-20 13:41:05'),
