  ('zcrm_1579374000020483038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020603129', 'Amber Kingsley', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $5000 IUA PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-20 13:24:36', '2018-07-20 13:24:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020473030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020603082', 'Sean Lionello', NULL, '7-24-18  Shawn called to enroll today.  I took him to the enrollment platform and during the enrollment he ask - who''s name should I enter as to who referred me.  I said my name.  Then he said  - or should it be my friend?
I ask what friend?  He reply - John Keith.  I looked up that name in the CRM and nothing appeared.  I ask him to spell the name - reply Jonathan Keith.
That''s when the name appeared and Wendy was the affiliate of record.  I instructed him to remove my name and select Wendy from the pull down list and continue on with the enrollment.

I spoke to Patti and ask if I should stop the enrollment and refer him to Wendy.  She said no let him enroll and she would talk to Wendy.  I also sent Wendy an email explaining this to her.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-07-20 13:15:04', '2018-07-20 13:30:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020473025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020603082', 'Sean Lionello', NULL, '6-19-18  Received inbound call from Shawn.  He explained he was currently on a group plan direct with Sedera but was leaving the company.  He called Sedera which they told him to contact our office about enrolling as a single member.  I ask Shawn how did he hear about us - reply I called Sedera.
I ask are you working with an affiliate - reply No.  I ask did a friend refer you to call us - reply Sedera.  At this point we discussed the difference between the Premier product and the Association Access plan.  He wanted to discuss with his wife and said he would call me back.  I explained he needed to call in by the end of day (20th) tomorrow if he wanted to enroll for an 8-1 start date.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-07-20 13:04:15', '2018-07-20 13:04:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020473020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020603129', 'Amber Kingsley', NULL, '7-20-18  Called today to enroll into the program.  Took him to the enrollment platform and stayed with him to complete is enrollment.  His wife is primary due to she is the oldest.  Effective Aug. 1sth.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-07-20 12:56:05', '2018-07-20 12:56:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020483033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020603082', 'Sean Lionello', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $5000 IUA PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-20 12:12:50', '2018-07-20 12:12:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020483028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020482208', 'Arman Sharafshahi', NULL, 'Emp Only $1000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-20 11:50:16', '2018-07-20 11:50:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020515013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819039', 'Matthew VerMilyea', NULL, 'Lucy called in with many questions that I answered, she is new to the plan. She would like the welcome package from Sedera re- sent to her because she can''t find it.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-20 11:45:22', '2018-07-20 11:45:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020515008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451009', 'Kay Sasser', NULL, 'David called in with many questions,  John answered all of them as well as told him that it would be the best idea for Kay and himself to schedule a welcome call that they could be on together.  The scheduler has been sent out. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-20 11:27:43', '2018-07-20 11:27:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020483023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020307029', 'Vicki Kahler', NULL, 'This member wants to pend her application until 9/1 she is having problem with the Sedera application and waiting for some help from Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-20 11:08:55', '2018-07-20 11:08:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020515003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017078069', 'Lauren Ankenman', NULL, 'She called in, wanting to know about finding a doctor, I pointed out that she hadn''t had her welcome call and went over how important it is. She said she would do it. I told her that I would send her the provider e-mail with search as long as she understood that we ask our members to use these benefits for 3 months because it is a self funded group. She asked if she could still go to a well women''s visit, I said that yes, that would be fine, but to hold off on doing the bigger items like mammogram, or colonoscopy. She said that would be fine, but seemed slightly annoyed with it.  -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-20 10:54:00', '2018-07-20 10:54:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020483018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020482142', 'Tabitha Raikes', NULL, 'This member is a part of Wink Fastners', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-20 10:52:54', '2018-07-20 10:52:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020483013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716955', 'Wes Richardson', NULL, 'Payment changed in FTNI to reflect Member &amp; children coverage.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-20 10:28:35', '2018-07-20 10:28:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020512003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695318', 'Regina Mailloux Jensen', NULL, '7-20-18 Regina is 56. She and Fred (56) both have high blood pressure and she uses hormones. They both see eye doctor and have glasses and see dermatologist once a year. They have a bunch of appts coming up with gastro and cardio to make sure they are healthy first. Looking at Sept or Oct 1st start date. Already has an HSA. No tobacco or smoking.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-20 10:25:01', '2018-08-01 13:50:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020483008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716955', 'Wes Richardson', NULL, 'Member called into Concierge asking about removing his wife from plan.  I emailed him a Member change form which hes submitted.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-20 10:13:46', '2018-07-20 10:13:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020505003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005318258', 'Gina Yaeger', NULL, '07.19.18:  Gina forwarded MPB email confirming her enrollment. Set-up fee stated as $150. Emailed Patti to correct for MPB Assoc. fee of $125. Patti acknowledged and will change. Notified Gina.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-07-20 09:01:34', '2018-07-20 09:01:34'),
