  ('zcrm_1579374000020452003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716955', 'Wes Richardson', NULL, 'Wes called in because ASI sent him a letter stating that the codes on his wifes bloodwork did not fall into a preventative catagory.  He did say that it very well may be that there were some diagnostic codes added "I don''t want to skirt around it"  I told e-mail me the bill to take a look at it.  Also he said that his wife just got a job and he may want to take her off of this plan. I told him that I would speak to Patti in the morning about it. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-19 15:15:18', '2018-07-19 15:15:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020413008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008640011', 'Rich Piotrowski', NULL, 'John spoke with her in depth about ASI protocol, she is going to be sending a picture of her bill, and know that if it is not a detailed CPT coded bill then it will not be something that ASI will reimburse.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-19 14:29:56', '2018-07-19 14:29:56'),
