  ('zcrm_1579374000020413003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862168', 'Amrik Singh', NULL, 'I got a phone call from his daughter wondering who called from this phone number, she said as soon as I found out I could call the same line back.  I called back to speak with his daughter again and she updated the e-mail address that we had. I told her that we would let ASI know so that she could receive temp cards.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-19 12:36:05', '2018-07-19 12:36:05'),
