  ('zcrm_1579374000020341014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819248', 'Linda Pan', NULL, 'Yesterday Linda contacted me with questions about the 2nd MD protocol, I read her the process straight from the welcome call form, she said that was still confusing, so I brought her to the mpoweringbenefits.com site and guided her to the page where even more of the Teladoc information was, both explanations were not enough- in fact she stated that she didn''t have any of that in writing. So we ended that conversation with the understanding that I would try my best to find more detailed information in writing. During this time she sent me information on birth control and MEC plans but was confused that it did not mention brands not being covered.  I had told her that yes, generic birth control was covered by her Apex card, she asked me about how to get a generic version of her pills, I gave her instructions. A few hours later she e-mailed me with a link to MEC plans and birth control and a question about if brand names were actually excluded.  I told her that I would have to do some digging on the 2nd MD and getting something in writing that is more technical in nature explaining it. And John has reached out to Apex about whether or not they function exactly the way ASI does, by covering only generics and needing a note from their Dr that the brand name that they are using is medically necessary. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-18 15:04:16', '2018-07-19 07:18:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020333042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044781088', 'Ramandeep Singh', NULL, '7-18-18 He is healthy but has high cholesterol and takes meds. Daughter has asthma and told him to decide if worth the risk. He has an HSA already. His work coverage ended June 1st and Cobra will be $1000 a month but has already met deductible for 2018. So, going to run the numbers to decide if it''s best to remain on Cobra through 2018 or to switch now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-18 12:39:02', '2018-07-18 12:39:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020333037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', NULL, '7-18-18 Helped upload 4 bills dating back to 12/21/17 up to 3/28/18. They were all from East West Integrated Medicine. Best way to avoid 1 year wait is to start with acupuncture and get referred in! She''s happy with her services thus far! She wanted hand holding to deal with all of these bills that she''s already paid for. We got her account squared away. Her renewal date is 3/1/18 so not wise to switch now that she has bills already for 2018. We can revisit next year if need be. She again wanted to understand the value of the $50 a month since wasn''t receiving the support she wanted initially. But, good to go now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-18 11:49:38', '2018-07-18 11:49:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020333029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', NULL, 'New Anamcar@113 LHS', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-18 11:33:24', '2018-07-18 11:46:51'),
