  ('zcrm_1579374000020341003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, 'client called in because the dermatologist was not accepting her MPowering card, and she needed a phone number, I told her that derm checks are not covered by Apex, and told her what she did asking for a cash discount was right on. She said she does not have her Apex card, I said I will bring up the situation with John. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-18 10:40:38', '2018-07-18 10:40:38'),
