Good morning, a couple weeks ago I went to the doctor for a test, the doctor took my insurance, with no issues, however the lab sent me a bill, and asked for insurance info, I am not sure what to give them? The number on my MEC card? Or is it Sedera health info they are asking for? Any guidance would be much appreciated.. thank you
You Mon Jul 16 11:02 AM

Hi William, what were the tests that you received? Part of an annual and physical? or were they due to symptoms that you were experiencing?  
