Well my girlfriend has crohns, and is on inflectra, and got Staff infection on her skin, which they put her on antobiotics, her doctor asked if I would get tested for Staff to make sure she hadn''t spread it to me or vice versa, and my tests came back negative for the staff
You Mon Jul 16 11:39 AM

OK, I am gad to hear that the tests came back negative, and hope your girlfriend feels better as well!  The MEC card is used for preventative/well visits. ....  
