  ('zcrm_1579374000020168008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881295', 'Lu Corvelli', NULL, 'Lu called in because she didn''t know if John was with Sedera or not, I told her that no, he is here at MPowering Benefits, but she didn''t know who she should be speaking with.  She went to a Dr that says that in fact she did need the surgery, BUT could not fit her in  to do the surgery this week,  I asked her to call them before, she did, and I also told her to call again and let them know what was going on, I told her that they may want to utilize 2nd MD, and if that was the case, that she should call and get this expedited as soon as possible. I gave her Sedera''s number again.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-16 09:55:59', '2018-07-16 09:55:59'),
