  ('zcrm_1579374000020193003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015937096', 'Ramon Pinela', NULL, 'Spoke to member is very busy. Will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-16 09:43:57', '2018-07-16 09:43:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020188003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008628057', 'Anthony Belisle', NULL, 'Tony called in.  Optometrist told he he has cataracts.  Wanted to know the process.  I told him to call Sedera first.....go to ophthalmologist to provide diagnosis and treatment recommendations.  if surgery is recommended, initiate the 2nd md process.  Always tell providers your a cash patient and ask for a cash discount.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-07-16 09:41:03', '2018-07-16 09:41:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020168003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005653027', 'Trude Moyer', NULL, 'Trude called in about a bill, that bounced back to her after she had her annual blood work. The date of service is 2/27, she is sending the detailed bill,  she says originally the bill was over $200 now it is $54, I told her that I would speak with John as well as send him the bill.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-16 08:50:06', '2018-07-16 08:50:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020167003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740011', 'Kathleen VanGoethem', NULL, 'Kathleen reached out via myahe.org e-mail asking about a preventative care e-mail, containing the preventative care search links. I then replied to her e-mail through the crm, stating that she received them the same day as she had her welcome call. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-16 07:57:44', '2018-07-16 07:57:44'),
