  ('zcrm_1579374000020121008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001196081', 'Kate Hamilton', NULL, '7-13-18 Looking to switch for Aug. 1st possibly. Just moved to CA last week. She wanted to use a Dr. that doesn''t accept any in-network insurance, he''s only out of network. So, she might find other recommendations since surgery will be expensive. She will take another look at the BC/BS plans PPO options silver or gold to see what might work. HEP won''t work since she needs a surgery right away. She''ll call me back in the next week or two.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-13 11:56:38', '2018-07-13 11:56:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020067041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881295', 'Lu Corvelli', NULL, 'Lu is going to have some sort of procedure done to fix the situation with her eyes, she said that she is getting close to her IUA and needed to know Sedera''s phone number. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-13 11:27:41', '2018-07-13 11:27:41'),
