  ('zcrm_1579374000020119008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005318258', 'Gina Yaeger', NULL, '07.13.18:  Called Gina.  Explained program options for her needs.  She likes Partial Self-directed.  Told her I would get the numbers for her and send them (age 51).  Emailed info. along w/flyer.  Gina emailed back - asked if she could join for Aug. 1 start.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-07-13 10:06:31', '2018-07-13 12:30:31'),
