  ('zcrm_1579374000020067028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014189260', 'Quentin Green III', NULL, 'Quentin called and asked me to e-mail both he and his father a payment update form- done. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-13 07:42:02', '2018-07-13 07:42:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020068023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020307107', 'Heather Piper Musmanno Bianciotto', NULL, '7-12-18 Eric Bianciotto will go onto the HEP Group Plan grandfathered in and Heather will likely go onto the Co-Pay Network Plan bc she sees specialists for various items. They were added to the list sent to Rod and Patti to grandfather into HEP Group plan because spoke before the new options were available.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-12 16:10:33', '2018-07-12 16:10:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020068018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474018', 'Marcia Maunder', NULL, '7-12-18 Left vm to help find a solution for her since problems with payment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-12 14:43:19', '2018-07-12 14:43:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020068013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, 'Jose''s wife called in and said that he is very sick and she didn''t know what to do next. We went over Teledoc, we went over illness injury protocol, we went over wellness/preventative protocol. I sent out the Teledoc e-mail as well as gave her the number, I also sent out the preventative care e-mail and to go over when Jose is feeling better. We discussed the importance of a welcome call as well. I told her to call in anytime and I will walk her through it.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-12 14:02:09', '2018-07-12 14:02:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020068008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233227', 'Nory Oakes', NULL, 'Nory seemed very confused about the plan, so I tried to help.   She said that she needed to get a renal ultrasound because she gets checked every year. She doesn''t know if it is preventative or something she needs to get negotiated down with. It sounded like she was confusing ASI and Sedera.  I tried to speak with her about how to approach injury/illness and then how to approach preventative care.   She wanted a definitive yes or no questions, I am going to send her a link to the mpowering.com site, maybe that will help.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-12 13:13:22', '2018-07-12 13:13:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020068003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630149', 'Gary Shapiro', NULL, 'Gary is at about $900 with what he has spent so far with a pain in his neck, tomorrow he is going to see a neck specialist, his IUA is $1000 I told him that he can go ahead and call them before or after his appointment, because Sedera might be able to contact that doctors office and begin negotiating pricing.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-12 12:47:05', '2018-07-13 08:29:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020028023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020350047', 'John Knowlton', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1500 IUA CoPay', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-12 11:44:31', '2018-07-12 11:44:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020036074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004737105', 'Patricia F. Brunner', NULL, 'When speaking to Jan today she told me that there was an issue with Olivia''s bill bouncing back for $800, when all that was done was a women''s wellness visit. I told her that I would bring it to John''s attention tomorrow. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-12 11:30:09', '2018-07-12 11:30:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020036069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659967', 'Shawn Mynar', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-12 11:19:33', '2018-07-12 11:19:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020036064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594106', 'Sharon Carducci', NULL, 'I spoke with Jan- she will be reaching out, we both agreed that Sharon needs to have another welcome call. I sent a new scheduler.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-12 11:19:24', '2018-07-12 11:19:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020028018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007096103', 'Lesley Migdali', NULL, 'Per call into Liz this member wishes to cancel.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-12 11:08:22', '2018-07-12 11:08:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020036056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028294214', 'Bonnie Ormerod', NULL, '7-12-18 Came via Patricia Bedell. 62 and Cobra ending this month or next. Paying $700+. Healthy, used naturopathic doctor and pays for it herself. Has thyroid issue and takes 1/4 gram of levothyroxine. Also remembered had spot removed from cheek with Mohs surgery to remove it all. Also was hit by another skier 3 1/2 years ago and got ACL knee surgery but skied the next year and it''s been fine. Used to be in the pharma industry. So, she gets it. She''s looking at Medishare and maybe Aliera or Altrua as well. Told her to read those guidelines because of the holes in them. I sent her the Sedera Guildelines which she will read bc she read contracts for work and realized the importance of it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-12 11:02:59', '2018-07-12 11:02:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020036048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111152', 'Tara Frix', NULL, 'IUA $500 Member and Spouse', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-12 09:58:14', '2019-12-23 08:42:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020036040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111152', 'Tara Frix', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member didn''t have any questions. I said if her husband has any further questions or concerns to call us at 1-800-519-2969. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-12 09:44:21', '2019-12-23 08:42:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020036035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111152', 'Tara Frix', NULL, 'JC called in to ask about what insurance would he give to the lab for bloodwork, I asked if it was preventative or diagnostic, he said that it was for diagnostic lab work, so I told him that he wouldn''t use the insurance card, but that he would tell them he is a self-paying patient,  He mentioned that he really didn''t know how the plan worked, I asked if he had a welcome call, he said that he thought he had, there was nothing here, notes or other wise so I told him it may be a good idea that if he had no idea how anything worked he should do another welcome call, that it would be a very easy thing to schedule. I asked if he wanted me to send a scheduler to e-mail we had on file, or a different one. There was silence on the line, he sighed  and said "never-mind" and hung up. Vanessa to call for a welcome call- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-12 09:37:54', '2019-12-23 08:42:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020036027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779401', 'Kathleen Wilger', NULL, 'Kathleen was just calling to update us and to get direction about her next steps.  She went through a biopsy that came back normal but the dr wants to do a scraping because of polyps that were found. She is now over her $500 IUA, she was given %20 off her bills due to the cash discount she has been asking for. I gave her Sedera''s number again and told her that they may want her to use the 2nd MD service. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-12 09:04:13', '2018-07-12 09:04:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020036022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594106', 'Sharon Carducci', NULL, 'Sharon called in livid because she received a mamogram bill and that she had never gotten a medical bill in her life. She was using phrases, like she had been "had" and lied too, and scammed, She was told right off the bat that she could use her own doctors and facilities,  When I told her that yes, she can because it is a PPO network, but that didn''t mean that it would be %100 covered. She stated that she would not be responsible for any of this bill She calmed down a bit when I told her that she could send the detailed medical bill to me via e-mail. I told her that I would take a look at it and get back with her later when I knew more.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-12 08:52:26', '2018-07-12 11:14:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020036008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016101084', 'Vicky Smith', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Member totally overwhelmed with plan. Her husband put her on plan for it will save them money. Not good with computer either. Rushing the call as well.  She has to check with husband if they received her Apex card and MPB card. Told her to get back to us if didn''t receive. Confirmed address as well. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-12 08:29:26', '2018-07-12 08:45:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020028008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809309', 'Kyle Simpson', NULL, 'Member emailed Vanessa with questions re: Sedera price changes.  I advised him that present pricing wouldn''t change until Grp renewal and that he could not change IUA until that time as well.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-12 08:03:01', '2018-07-12 08:03:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000020036003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447129', 'Bruce Mayer', NULL, 'Bruce called on 7/11 a little after 4 o''clock asking for John, I told him that John was out of the office until Friday, but he told me that he was a friend and asked me to call John on his cell phone to ask him for a call back. I told him I would message John, I texted him at 4:06 pm.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-12 07:54:26', '2018-07-12 07:54:26'),
