  ('zcrm_1579374000019984033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', NULL, 'Catherine is going through a tough time, we talked for awhile. She is in desperate need of hand holding, she is drowning in bills from Liberty, and she just lost her father. I told her that she could e-mail them all to me and I will make sure that John gets them, but that he isn''t in until Friday.  She is admittedly overwhelmed and doesn''t know if she will stay with Liberty or not. I told her to talk with Wendy, let her know what was going on and maybe she could suggest a plan for her that will have a bit more support and care at this junction in her life. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-11 13:40:09', '2018-07-11 13:40:09'),
