  ('zcrm_1579374000019984023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003780093', 'Robert Parks', NULL, 'Robert called in to vent to me about the healthcare system raising it''s rates and Liberty just not paying for anything anymore.  Yesterday his wife when to a GP- they did not recognize Liberty HS, then today for her to get an MRI- they called Liberty and they were told that they have a deductible of 1500 before any such test would be covered.  -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-11 12:58:27', '2018-07-11 12:58:27'),
