  ('zcrm_1579374000019990008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000941033', 'Gary Sahadeo', NULL, '07.10.18:  Dottie called to relate what happened. Gary''s business credit card expired. They called Liberty w/new card and Liberty had no problem putting it through.Dottie said she called MPB to do the same and assumed the card went through. Dottie said she did not receive any email notifications regarding non-payment until June when Gary immediately called to give new c.c. #.  Joy called him back and said c.c would not go through.  Frustrated w/this situation, Gary then decided to cancel the HES program, feeling it wasn''t worth the hassle.  They are going to stay with LHS until Dottie goes on Medicare next year in October.  She asked if we have any supplemental insurance she could use.  I told her I would look into it for her.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-07-11 09:53:58', '2018-07-11 09:56:18'),
