  ('zcrm_1579374000019984008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299236', 'Sara Berry', NULL, 'Sara called the office looking for Ron, I told her that he was out of the office but that I would pass on her message, she said that she had a call scheduled with him for 9:00, so she was a little upset.- I called his line left a message and texted him-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-11 09:24:50', '2018-07-11 09:24:50'),
