  ('zcrm_1579374000019984003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474303', 'William DeForge', NULL, 'William called in to have preventative/MEC services explained.  if his doctor IS going to want bloodwork that does not fall under preventative, I told him about directlabs.com. I am sending him that link. - no other questions.- happy client- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-11 08:57:41', '2018-07-11 08:57:41'),
