  ('zcrm_1579374000019971003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011910125', 'Thomas Smith', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-11 07:54:58', '2018-07-11 07:54:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019964026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001936053', 'Christina Patton', NULL, 'Christina called after hours around 5:15 last night stating that she never heard back from anyone at the Telemedicine number that I gave her. I appologized and told her that I would let my suprivisor know and that she would hear back from one or both of us.  When I spoke with Jennie she told me to call Christina back and tell her that we were going to refund her monthly payment and that we had a call in to the service and were waiting for a call back.  She was very appreciative of all our attentiveness and the refund.  Jennie ended up calling her back and leaving a message on her voicemail.  I will be contacting Wendy this morning to see if this may be a situation where we "flip" the client to one of our newer plans so that she will be able to actually see a doctor and then have her mammogram and colonoscopy through the mec plan.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-11 07:17:25', '2018-07-11 07:17:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019964021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020603129', 'Amber Kingsley', NULL, '7-10-18  Send Liz Bradshaw an email.  She has earned $50 cash from Ron for sharing the lead.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-07-11 01:19:03', '2018-07-11 01:19:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019964013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020603129', 'Amber Kingsley', NULL, '7-10-18  Received a 2nd call from James.  He was upset Liz did not call him and wanted me to assist him.  I called Kelly and ask her to speak to Liz about this.  Kelly called me back and said Liz claim she has never done a phone enrollment and just go ahead and handle James.  I modified record to my name and did a complete presentation with James at our website.  He was going to speak to his wife and then enroll.  I will check with Patti to see if he did enroll last night.  Also send James the 1st approach letter.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-07-11 01:09:39', '2018-07-11 01:18:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019964008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005041069', 'Julie Allen', NULL, '7-10-18  Received a call from Julie wanting to know why she is still paying $50 to MPB when she cancelled around Dec/Jan 2017.  I told her Patti B would check into the issue and call her.  Julie''s number is  732-239-1028.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-07-11 00:51:39', '2018-07-11 00:51:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019964003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299236', 'Sara Berry', NULL, '7-10-18  Spoke with Sara.  Answered some additional questions and now she is ready to enroll herself and child.  Her husband will stay on Aetna at this time.  Schedule for 7-11 to enroll.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-07-11 00:43:41', '2018-07-11 00:43:41'),
