</brucemayer@cox.net>', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-07-10 18:39:01', '2018-07-10 18:39:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019921038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830450', 'Debbie Eubanks', NULL, 'Debbie called in to ask how our prescription program worked, I explained it all in detail as well as guided her to the prescription form that she can fill out and submit.  She complained about the service stating that it sounded like too much leg work.  I proposed that if she wanted she could give me a small list of her favorite pharmacies if that would help. She mentioned about nothing is the way that she thought it would be, I told her that I was sorry to hear that and that I would try to answer her questions the best way I could.   She wanted me to look on the "the list" to see if a facility was listed- I looked up Avista Surgery Center, told her that yes, it was on the list, she said she would just go ahead to her mammogram appointment that she had scheduled then.  I asked if she had any other questions, she said no.  -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-10 15:08:36', '2018-07-10 15:08:36');
