  ('zcrm_1579374000019884023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083032', 'Sorel Haruf', NULL, 'I went over preventative care protocol as well as sent ANOTHER preventative care e-mail. I looked up the obgyn that she was interested in seeing and saw that she was on the list- she told me that the dr office asked if her plan was the PPO one, and because of that, I told her to contact ASI herself to make sure that her Dr is in network and that there will be no out of pocket expense.  After talking with her I spoke to Vanessa about her because she had just had the welcome call- we both agreed that 3 of us went over the same questions- client is very sweet, just go slow.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-10 10:00:00', '2018-07-10 10:00:00'),
