  ('zcrm_1579374000019821028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012416098', 'Richard Bemis', NULL, 'Notified ASi of the dispute by this member.  Spoke with Lena in Eligiability, she told me that she would put a note in their system that if any claims come in for him she will be notified and that she will contact us.  Jennie also notified Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-09 14:24:56', '2018-07-09 14:26:41'),
