  ('zcrm_1579374000019839003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645404', 'James (JP) Boylan', NULL, '7-9-18 Paying $300 bi-monthly through wife''s employer right now. They are all healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco or anything. Has HSA already funding. Looked into USAA ad cost is $1600 month. They want to travel internationally with 2 and 5 year old. This works well for that! Once wife moves to half time they will likely switch to this. They just lost their babysitter so she might change work status sooner than later.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-09 13:27:00', '2018-07-09 13:27:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019821023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590004', 'Isabel Graefin Von Rittberg', NULL, 'I helped Isabel log onto the US Corporate site, she wanted to know about what is covered Chiropracticly- I went over the guidelines and gave Sedera''s number. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-09 13:20:02', '2018-07-09 13:20:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019821018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009143063', 'Adam Rothberg', NULL, 'Adam is going to the orthopedist tomorrow and wanted to make sure that he does everything right- I told him to call Sedera and that they would help him with the bills that are already piling up as well as get him in contact with 2nd MD.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-09 13:00:28', '2018-07-09 13:00:28'),
