  ('zcrm_1579374000019821013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, 'Suzanne admittedly doesn''t do well when it comes to computers, so I stayed on the phone with her the entire time while she filled out her health assessment on US Corporate web site.  I also did some DR hunting for her as well. I told her that she can call anytime.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-09 12:41:23', '2018-07-09 12:41:23'),
