  ('zcrm_1579374000019709008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881295', 'Lu Corvelli', NULL, 'Lu and her husband called in because Lu has been having issues with her eyes. They know that they need to go through their welcome call, but wanted to know how to proceed with this issue, I asked how long ago the symptoms started and she said back in Feburary and March, and that eye dr said that if the symptoms persisted she would need to go to a retinal specialist. Lu has an appointment on Monday, I told her that they should call Sedera with this issue, since now the two Dr bills and seeing a specialist on Monday, I told them how awesome the company was and gave the number. You can tell these clients are really trying to understand how everything works, go slow with them. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-06 10:36:54', '2018-07-06 10:36:54'),
