  ('zcrm_1579374000019624013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012724369', 'Tracy Maxwell', NULL, 'Tracy called in a bit distraught because on Jun 8th she told me that she had already spoken with 2nd MD and wanted to make sure that Sedera knew what was going on with her.  She said she was really nervous because the surgery is scheduled for next Wednesday. I transferred the call to John.  He called Sedera and we were told that they were going to reach out with Tracy.  -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-05 14:28:42', '2018-07-05 14:28:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019628016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819577', 'Nanci Alpert', NULL, '7-5-18 Spoke with Nanci. She is all set for July 1st start. She might actually like to sign up for Cloud Medical per Merret''s recommendation. She was asking how to go about getting ultrasound for potential for gall stones. She had one long ago and fine. But, I told her Cloud would be a good addition to her membership for that type of issue. Also told her she can cancel MEC+ in 2019 since laws changing. I forgot to mention she will get a small discount by including Cloud at this point.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-05 13:59:16', '2018-07-05 13:59:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019633078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083032', 'Sorel Haruf', NULL, 'Member called in with questions regarding annual wellness visits.  She hasn''t completed the welcome call.  She scheduled it for this evening.  Sent results of provider search.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-07-05 12:57:39', '2018-07-05 12:57:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019628008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019634002', 'Colleen Mangeot', NULL, '7-5-18 "Hi Wendy,
First, my apologies for missing our appt on June 5.  For some reason I had in my head that I was to call you to schedule an appt that day, not that I already had an appt with you.
We were in the midst of a house sale and packing to move and celebrating our 25th wedding anniversary.  Whew!  We are now moved to Asheville NC.  I am still working at my current job and therefore still have group insurance, however, I would like to keep your information and will contact you next year as I expect to quit my job then.  My husband will be able to enroll in Medicare by then so I will likely be the one needing insurance, unless you also offer something for Medicare or to compete with Medicare. 
Please let me know on that. 
Thanks again and my apologies for missing our appt. 
Colleen"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-07-05 12:30:24', '2018-07-05 12:31:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019622023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899548', 'Christina Davies', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Reminded her of the health risk assessment is overdue. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-07-05 11:40:40', '2018-07-05 11:42:02'),
