  ('zcrm_1579374000019624008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508208', 'Donna DeFede', NULL, 'I called Donna back to explain that the Labcorp bill wasn''t a detailed medical bill containing the correct coding for ASI to reimburse her. I told her to call her doctors office and ask them to scan or send the detail/coded medical bill to her and then gave her the option of either e-mailing the info to ASI directlly or she could always submit it to us and then we could get it to ASI. - update- she got the bill right away and sent it off to ASI.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-05 10:52:33', '2018-07-05 10:52:33'),
