I have a great concern that the kind of products 
And so called exercise experts are actually good for the
Members.  While this idea of having a shared insurance plan
I woke highly encourage you all to look into
Things before posting them. 
Is the supplement your advertising organic? 
Yes or No?
If it’s a no, then you cannot use the term health
Excellence. This means you are promoting
Glyphosate which is a known carcinogen found 
In Roundup. 
Secondly, your fitness expert said burpees are a good
Exercise.  This is false, more injuries come from 
Burpees, push-ups, and poor mechanic squats.
The army banned sit-ups because of how much compression
And deterioration occur in the intervertebral discs which were
A leading cause to injuries.
Here is a link that will bring insight to true & safe
Strength and flexibility beyond the veil of aesthetic
Training.  https://www.theptdc.com/2017/04/back-pain-myths/

Jay

