  ('zcrm_1579374000019580008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508208', 'Donna DeFede', NULL, 'Donna called in because a pap smear bill from labcorp came in the mail, she didn''t understand because it was a standard pap smear. The dr visit was covered, she doesn''t understand why this test wasn''t, I asked her to scan a copy of it into the office so we can take a look at it. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-05 08:30:28', '2018-07-05 08:30:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019567018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024380', 'Michael Esposito', NULL, 'Received Cancellation Survey back emailed ASi &amp; Sedera and will cancel him out of FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-07-05 08:10:07', '2018-07-05 08:10:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019580003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899548', 'Christina Davies', NULL, 'Christina called in because she said she left her insurance card at home and that she was at the dermatologist, she wanted to know if I could fax the card information to the office, or give the information over the phone. I asked her why she was there and she said for a dr to take a look at a mole. I explained why this type of visit does not fall under the realm of preventative care, I told her to ask for a cash discount, pay with out of pocket or with her HSA card and to always ask for a detailed medical bill to keep just in case the medical event turns into a sharable need.  no welcome call. I will talk with Vanessa about it.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-05 07:56:26', '2018-07-05 07:56:26'),
