  ('zcrm_1579374000019350003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610603', 'Robert Morey', NULL, 'Kirsten called in with all sorts of preventative service questions, she asked me to do all of the multiplan searches for her because she wasn''t near a computer and I did.  Then I went over how to present the card, I told her that she should always call ahead first, and not to assume, I also told her that in her case, she needs to get a script from her Dr that says that the 3D ultrasound is medically necessary, AND to give ASI a call to see whether or not they will cover it or not. To avoid any hidden fees.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-07-02 08:00:43', '2018-07-02 08:00:43'),
