  ('zcrm_1579374000019310003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243295', 'Brooke Spencer', NULL, 'I''ve left mssg and sent email regarding HRA. Also, left notes on this account but it''s not saving. I hope it works this time.', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-06-30 04:50:30', '2018-06-30 04:50:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019289018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471144', 'Scott Kendrick', NULL, '6-29-18 Sent Scott NG STM to apply and tried to leave vm but it''s full. Sent separate email to give him heads up to enroll asap as well. Joining for 32 days for about $305.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-29 16:00:17', '2018-06-29 16:00:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019307013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007902007', 'Natalie Wood', NULL, 'Natalie called because she thought we were Sedera, she has been having the same abdominal issues since the end of last year, and nothing is improving. She has already been speaking to Dania at Sedera about bills being submitted to them since November 2017.  She is going to go to a GI doctor now and wanted to let Sedera know what was going on. I affirmed that this was the perfect course of action, and to just call Sedera back to fill them in on whats going on as well as to go ahead and submit the newest bills to them. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-29 14:32:13', '2018-06-29 14:32:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019289013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019308021', 'Rachel Ravey', NULL, '6-30-18 Her B-Day is tomorrow! She''s turning 37 and her husband is 31 or 32. They are healthy and currently on Cobra for $1500. They have about 8 months left on Cobra. BUT, she''s 5 weeks pregnant, so these aren''t good options for her now until she has the baby. She might need to be on state ins for an additional month first to get past birth. Told her to call me and told her monthly deadlines for first of month start date. She gets it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-29 14:09:09', '2018-06-29 14:09:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019289008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007733007', 'Nanette Kushel', NULL, '6-29-18 Left vm for Nan after she called me. Couldn''t understand what she needs from her vm...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-29 13:31:35', '2018-06-29 13:31:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019307008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004971047', 'Jeff Myers', NULL, 'Pam called in because she wasn''t finding any sort of facility that would do a mammogram, so I told her that I would help do a search for her. I found a facility and left a voicemail message with her as well as e-mailed her all  of the info.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-29 13:02:49', '2018-06-29 13:02:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019288018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474018', 'Marcia Maunder', NULL, 'Sent cancel pending email to member and emailed Wendy to notify. JB 6/29/18', 'Julie Bloomdahl', 'Julie Bloomdahl', '2018-06-29 12:56:47', '2018-07-02 06:53:02'),
