  ('zcrm_1579374000019307003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010331105', 'Kathleen White', NULL, 'Kathleen called in to speak with a Dr, she hadn''t known about Teladoc, so I sent her that e-mail and explained, she also wanted to know about seeing a GP and the process- I sent her the preventative care e-mail as well as well as explained the process. I noticed she never set up her welcome call, so asked if she would like her welcome call right then, Liz said she could do it in 5 minutes. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-29 12:19:47', '2018-06-29 12:19:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019254008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819577', 'Nanci Alpert', NULL, 'Received cancellation confirmation from Apex, have submitted info to ASi.  Have notified Sedera they will change.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-29 11:55:53', '2018-06-29 11:55:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019293008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819577', 'Nanci Alpert', NULL, 'Will refund member full amount from MPBA account and recharge her when the new application is completed for the MPB Group.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-06-29 11:47:10', '2018-06-29 11:47:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019292008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006461003', 'Steven Sanders', NULL, 'Lisa called in to check on lab bill.  It''s in her share box (I uploaded it twice) no movement yet.  She had two docs to e-sign.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-06-29 11:32:37', '2018-06-29 11:32:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019293003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862262', 'Pete Scifo', NULL, 'Member called to make a payment for July.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-06-29 11:28:15', '2018-06-29 11:28:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019292003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819577', 'Nanci Alpert', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to make sure that Merret Mann, the individual who referred her, got credit for the referral.  she also asked to have her IUA changed to the same as her friends plan - 1000.  She als asked why her monthly was higher when she had a higher AUA.  Ron put her in the access plan rather than the Select program.  Patti is changing her over to the MPB Group.  Wendy is the affiliate who enrolled Mann.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-06-29 11:28:10', '2018-06-29 11:28:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019260023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919719', 'Dan Haski', NULL, 'Spoke to member will speak with wife to see when they can both be on the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to book online. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-06-29 11:20:22', '2018-06-29 11:20:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019289003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362116', 'Natasha Thompson', NULL, '6-29-18 Spoke to Natasha about her boyfriend, 44 and does not have Green card or Visa. He does not need to be ACA compliant therefore, the self-directed plan will be best for him. He will not get the MEC+ for wellness. He can do that on his own. He''s not a tobacco user. Looking at the $1000 IUA for $230 perhaps.  They might get married in fall. If so, told her best to put him on her plan and not the other way around bc her plan is more comprehensive. He likely wants an Aug. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-29 11:18:11', '2018-06-29 11:18:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019288003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899416', 'Talia Tiram', NULL, 'Refunded for July, and cancelled recurring charges', 'Julie Bloomdahl', 'Julie Bloomdahl', '2018-06-29 11:16:32', '2018-06-29 11:16:32'),
