  ('zcrm_1579374000019248008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610129', 'Bethany Stoll', NULL, 'I did some research about Bethany''s daughters pediatrician being on the Multi Plan, Bethany had a hard time with that search engine, but I did find the Dr on there, just not the facility, Bethany sent in those bills to ASI as well. I sent her instructions so that she can use the site easier.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-29 09:48:27', '2018-06-29 09:48:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019248003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610129', 'Bethany Stoll', NULL, 'Bethany called in because she did receive a check for compensation from ASI for her Dr visit, but her mammography receipt was sent back with a message stating that it wasn''t sufficient information.  Bethany says it is only a cash receipt and she has had a lot of trouble getting a detailed medical bill from North side Radiology, where she goes every year. I asked if she had ever had an issue with breast cancer and she stated no, that she just goes every year to be safe.  The date of service was May 8th. I told her to take some good pictures of what she has and send them in, I told her that I would forward them over to John, who is always in contact with these cases and ASI.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-29 09:26:30', '2018-06-29 09:26:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019232013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819248', 'Linda Pan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Sent email of providers and services of preventative care also. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-06-29 09:20:59', '2018-06-29 09:22:13'),
