  ('zcrm_1579374000019201008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752067', 'Michael Brown', NULL, 'Linda called me and asked about her receipts from us .  She is saying that all she gets in her email is an email with just our logo.  I told her that I would email her all of the receipts.  She also asked if there was a place where she could go in and get them.  I let her know that the member portal was being built at this time and would be up and running in about 60 days.  Receipts emailed to her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-29 07:01:21', '2018-06-29 07:01:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019201003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533031', 'Jeffrey Hattrick', NULL, 'Received cancellation request from this member.  Attached below.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-29 06:22:19', '2018-06-29 06:22:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019177011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017078368', 'Diane Humphrey', NULL, 'Diane call me back to notify me that she completed the health risk assessment. She mentioned that she takes a mild and a depressant because it runs in her family but does not have depression and it is in control. She also shared that she has menopause and wants to lose 10 lb.', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-06-28 16:22:51', '2018-06-28 16:22:51'),
