  ('zcrm_1579374000019138043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053678052', 'Dennis Bakken', NULL, 'spoke with Dennise. He said that he completed HRA. Checking with John to confirm. He is working on losing 20 lbs and is open to coaching. Sent email with my info', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-06-28 15:24:41', '2018-06-28 15:33:37'),
