  ('zcrm_1579374000019138033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243027', 'Lucia Leao', NULL, 'Lucia called in to cancel liberty rx, when asked if it was because I had found her a better price on medicine- she said yes! Patti said she was going to cancel her.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-28 14:16:01', '2018-12-01 09:30:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019138028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068311', 'Jessica Bates', NULL, 'Kyle called in to let us know that Jessica is pregnant,  and that they are out of town and Jessica is experiencing some spotting and wanted to see a Dr just to be safe, I told them that a good tool was healthgrades.com as well as told them to just give Sedera a call so that they can walk them through what to expect during the pregnancy. Gave Sedera''s phone number. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-28 14:13:35', '2018-06-28 14:13:35'),
