  ('zcrm_1579374000019172003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020482017', 'Steven Thomas', NULL, '6-28-18 Healthy, individual, 48 in Tulsa OK. Found an article about Sedera he read and contacted them directly and spoke to Bill Thomas who passed Steve to me. He has no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco, etc. Has an HSA already which is fully funded already for 2018. Wants to keep that. He''s a Financial Services Provider. He has a separate dental plan that he will keep and likes. He''s enrolling right now for the $1000/$296 for Association HEP PSD.  He''s paying $580 mo for BC/BS right now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-28 12:30:19', '2018-06-28 12:32:56'),
