  ('zcrm_1579374000019080023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624001', 'Rachel Holden', NULL, '6-27-18 Super healthy family of 3, Rachel 37, husband 45, and son 5.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-27 17:23:23', '2018-06-27 17:23:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019080018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019120001', 'Ian Perry', NULL, '6-27-18 He''s going to get CU''s plan which is basically no deductible and no co-pays if you seek service on campus somehow. He''ll be in school for 2 years. He pays by semester and sounds affordable. He''s all set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-27 15:06:03', '2018-06-27 15:06:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019074101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273646', 'Shannon Quinn', NULL, 'as of today I have left Shannon 2 voicemails and 1 e-mail regarding her address and check.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-27 14:15:23', '2018-06-27 14:15:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019074091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176467', 'Joan Pistone', NULL, 'Member called in and said that she started Medicare effective 6/1 however did not notify us I will refund June pmt &amp; cancel.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-27 14:04:16', '2018-06-27 14:04:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019074086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362116', 'Natasha Thompson', NULL, 'Emp Only $1000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-27 13:38:04', '2018-06-27 13:38:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019074081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533031', 'Jeffrey Hattrick', NULL, 'Jefferey called in wanting to know what the plan offeres to him, since he just learned that he was paying for us along with Liberty, after reviewing his benefits with him, he said that he might want to keep us due to the telemedicine component, but if he wanted to cancel he wanted to know how to do that. I guided him to the mpoweringbenefits.com site and showed him where to find the cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-27 12:21:24', '2018-06-27 12:21:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019071022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533031', 'Jeffrey Hattrick', 'ZOHO SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 342 
Question : I am currently a member of Liberty Health Share.  I am also paying a $50 membership fee to My Academy Of Health Excellence.  I am wanting to understand the separate fee, what I am receiving for that, and should I decide to cancel that service how to go about that.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2018-06-27 12:04:31', '2018-06-27 12:04:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019098008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299236', 'Sara Berry', NULL, '5-27-18  Sara called me back.  Spent more than an hour covering our entire program.  Took her to our website and discussed the Partially Self Directed plan.  They are a family of 4 (2) kids, 11 + 14).  Husband is self-employed.  He is covered on Anthem.   Husband is 53, Sara 46.  Sara has minor psoriasis and is take medication to stop drinking (Antabuse) but is ok if she has to pay for it through the discount programs.  Not in rehab.  She wants to speak with her husband tonight but will most likely enroll.  Scheduled to talk again on Thursday 5-28 @ 3pm EST.   Emailed her the 1st approach letter.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-06-27 11:34:11', '2018-06-27 11:41:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019074076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862462', 'Randy James', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-06-27 11:16:43', '2018-06-27 11:16:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019074071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243146', 'Patricia Lekawa', NULL, 'very difficult client, upset about Fadi''s e-mail, our e-mails, not at all happy with anything. -I told her that John or Liz would give her a call back.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-27 11:04:08', '2018-06-27 11:04:08'),
