  ('zcrm_1579374000019074061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233082', 'Daniel Wisdom', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-06-27 10:31:57', '2018-06-27 10:31:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019108003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362116', 'Natasha Thompson', NULL, '6-27-18 I had written Dan Kaplan as referring member but she says Kristen Boyle. I have no idea why I thought Dan... I have not gotten a response from Kathy Miller in WA about STM. But, I should call Patti and get the final paperwork in for Nat. Gen for STM. Her Gabapentin is for nerve pain/damage. Has had the problem for a year and not really changing and may get better or disappear. She also might get a job in a few months and get benefits. She might get married to her boyfriend in a few months as well. She would want to add him at that point to get better savings. Enrollment complete for Aug. 1st start date. $1000/$249.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-27 10:28:44', '2018-06-27 10:52:37'),
