  ('zcrm_1579374000019065013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299236', 'Sara Berry', NULL, '5-27-18  Tried to call Sara again.  No answer left a VM.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-06-27 08:57:37', '2018-06-27 08:57:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019065008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819353', 'David Silverstein', NULL, '5-27-18  Called Patti and she did some detective work about Silverstein.  She alerted me Silverstein sent me an email on the 25th (which I missed opening) stating he had concerns about family members health conditions that maybe he didn''t provide to MPA or Sedera.  Patti recommended we cancel his July 1st enrollment due to the mismatch of information he provided to MPB and Sedera.  I sent Patti and Jeff an email requested we DO cancel his enrollment.  I have left 3 messages today for Silverstein to call me so we can discuss all this concerns and issues.  Special Note:  Silverstein has been somewhat difficult always comparing our program to health insurance.  I told him he needs to learn more about MCS and our program because it''s not health insurance and will have significant difference between them.  I feel he does have Affiliate potential but he needs to have lots of training and under our program and services in much greater detail.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-06-27 08:53:55', '2018-06-27 08:53:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019065003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819353', 'David Silverstein', NULL, '5-27-18  Spoke to Jeff today and said he heard that David was considering canceling his enrollment (July 1st) because he''s concerned he''s not hearing anything back from us.  Jeff ask me to call him and find out what his issues are.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-06-27 08:47:05', '2018-06-27 08:47:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019062013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819353', 'David Silverstein', NULL, 'Patti,

In light of Mr. Silverstein''s email, at this time please cancel his July 1st. membership based on mismatched information he provided to MPB and Sedera Health.  Jeff Kanter and I will discuss a go forward plan (or not) with him.

Thank You

Ron Patterson', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-27 08:36:02', '2018-06-27 08:36:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019062008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013677493', 'Caroline McClure', NULL, 'Member''s voicemail is still not set up. Not able to leave message. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-06-27 08:14:49', '2018-06-27 08:14:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019062003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819353', 'David Silverstein', NULL, 'Subject: Start over
From: David Silverstein <David.Silverstein@leanmethods.com>
Date: Thu, June 21, 2018 7:24 am
To: "REP@mympb.com" <REP@mympb.com>


Ron, let’s go ahead and cancel my application for July 1 start. Too many errors. I’ll start it over and my HR manager is looking at who else we might add to start a small group. The application process missed my wife, and most importantly, let’s of pre-existing conditions. I guess it was looking for all of them in one input box, but I only listed me. Didn’t catch anything with the kids. Daughter’s torn Achilles, other daughter hospitalized with Guillain barre last year. Need to make sure we get all of that. And I had changed it to the $5,000 versus $500. I am most interested in the learning versus the coverage. I have that. Please go ahead and cancel and we’ll start again for August 1 start.
 
Thank you', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-27 08:13:01', '2018-06-27 08:13:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019052003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779530', 'Jaelynne Lay', NULL, 'Betsy Gray paying for this member she is her employee.  In speaking with Betsy I asked her to have Jaylynne sign up for the Welcome Call.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-26 17:41:57', '2018-06-26 17:41:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018993110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471144', 'Scott Kendrick', NULL, '6-26-18 Update - emailed Scott to call his Dr. to find out what his records state as far as his skin issues.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-26 15:32:05', '2018-06-26 15:32:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018993105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362080', 'David Kimble', NULL, '6-26-18 Dave is enrolling for the family now for Aug. 1st. He missed the July 1st start date. I just sent him a STM IHC for $1034 for July. Completed HEP Group plan for family at $1000/$638. He will email me if he comes up with any pre-x conditions that his family members have if there are any. He can''t think of any other than mild allergies that they never takes prescriptions for, only OTC for hay fever.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-26 15:30:06', '2018-06-26 15:57:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019019038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862096', 'Edward Christopher Wiencek', NULL, 'I spoke to Mary about how to go about preventative care visits, I sent her a preventative care e-mail.  She also asked about if surgery would be covered for excess skin on her eyelid. So after speaking with Patti I told Mary that if she gets a diagnosis and the Dr wants to opt for surgery she needed to call Sedera and let them know so that they can share after the IUA was met. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-26 14:43:31', '2018-06-26 14:43:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018967073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537054', 'Michael Sharpe', NULL, 'Received message from Liz regarding Mike needing help with losing weight. Left him a message and sent email to connect.', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-06-26 13:39:39', '2018-06-26 13:39:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019019033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667255', 'Kathleen Kronz', NULL, 'I honestly do not know what Kathleen called in about, but she was upset. I tried to answer questions for her- it seemed like she called in wanting to cancel and then after hearing about what we are here to offer her she wanted to stay, asking - "well, if I want to cancel now, but wanted to re-enroll could I?"  I told her that no, she wouldn''t be able too because the Liberty and MPowering were sold together as a package when she purchased both plans.  She needed to hang up because she hadn''t thought how long the phone call would be and then said she''d call me back. I spoke to Patti about it for a heads up.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-26 13:32:47', '2018-06-26 13:32:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018993100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474018', 'Marcia Maunder', NULL, '6-26-18 Left vm to help her update her payment information and told her email was sent to do so online as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-26 13:11:42', '2018-06-26 13:11:42'),
