  ('zcrm_1579374000019019018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508120', 'Christopher Newpower', NULL, 'Chris called to ask if preventative colonoscopies were covered by ASI. I told him that they were and the process, as well as sent a provider network/facility search engine. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-26 09:54:55', '2018-06-26 09:54:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000019019013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809045', 'Walter Godber', NULL, 'Walter called in because he think that he may go to the Mayo Clinic in Scottsdale because he has been having symptoms with no diagnosis for years.  For awhile it sounded like he confused the 2nd md process with what Sedera will share in. John told him that even though, in this case his symptoms will be considered pre-existing, Sedera might be able to at least reach out to get him into the mayo clinic program, and help negotiate down bills for him. We gave him Sedera''s member support number.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-26 09:47:30', '2018-06-26 09:47:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018993061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017078316', 'Jeffery Page', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-06-26 09:47:18', '2018-06-26 09:47:18'),
