  ('zcrm_1579374000019019003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017307157', 'John Kniepmann', NULL, 'I followed up with John today letting him know that I went ahead and nominated his daughters dr on multiplan and emailed him this  	062618A2O tracking number. I also told him that he could submit the receipt for the $12 birth control to ASI for reimbursement since they cover the cost of generic birth control. Client happy for the follow up.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-26 08:54:08', '2018-06-26 08:54:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018993051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919652', 'Chris Nielsen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Also reminded him of his overdue health risk assessment. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-06-26 08:48:15', '2018-06-26 08:48:15'),
