  ('zcrm_1579374000018967063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017330039', 'Linda Colombo', NULL, 'Linda said she completed her risk assessment.', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-06-26 06:26:07', '2018-06-26 06:26:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018976027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471144', 'Scott Kendrick', NULL, '6-25-18 Scott came to me via HEP Select member Seth Owen. Scott is 50 and just ended coverage with Aspen Skiing Company with Cigna plan. He''s getting divorced and his coverage ends June 29th. I sent him a STM with IHC for July. He gets cluster headaches sometimes 2x a year for week or a month and sometimes not all for a few years. He buys 9 pills per packet of 2.5 mg, 1 dose packet for $18-$36. Naratriptan- Amerge. I found them super affordable online on GoodRx, so not a concern. Will apply on his own. Scott had already read email #1 from Robert Morey that he forwarded.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-25 17:44:12', '2018-06-25 19:32:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018976008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362116', 'Natasha Thompson', NULL, '6-25-18 She ended job May 31st and has been without insurance during June. Moved to Vancouver WA and is looking for a job around September. Might be a job with benefits or might do her own business without benefits. So, she''d keep this membership. She also wants to have her boyfriend whose from Mexico and not a US citizen to get on this. He has a tax payer ID #. Finding out if that works. He''s 44. Natasha takes Gabapentin 1x daily. She didn''t share with me what it''s for but explanation online says for seizures or nerve pain. So, I need to make sure I make it adamantly clear about the pre-x clause. I definitely went over it carefully 2x now but a 3rd time is a charm. I''m looking for a STM for July but none showing in WA. Looking for agent in WA that is with 5 Rings.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-25 16:43:14', '2018-06-25 16:59:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018933014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004940069', 'Christine Heinritz', 'ZOHO SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 341 
