  ('zcrm_1579374000018967053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111554', 'Julio Penaloza', NULL, 'Spoke with Amy Nielson. Julio doesn''t speak English very well and we need to speak to his son Erick Barrita to translate at 651.295.5276. His wife, Yolanda Barrita needs to complete the Risk Assessment as well.', 'Fadi Malouf', 'Fadi Malouf', '2018-06-25 13:58:13', '2018-06-25 13:58:13'),
