  ('zcrm_1579374000018984003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003039017', 'CarolAnn Maritato', NULL, 'CarolAnne called in saying that Liberty told her to call us and cancel us too.  I told her that there would be no need too. She said that she would be dropping coverage soon, because she works at a hospital and still needs so much work done and that it would be unfair to put on a health sharing company.   She told me about everything that she has gone through medically and said thankyou over and over saying that she appreciates everything we have done for her.- very sweet- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-25 13:02:32', '2018-06-25 13:02:32'),
