  ('zcrm_1579374000018976003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839004', 'Joel Hocknell', NULL, '6-25-18 Lives in Aspen area. Just turned 50 and needed colonoscopy. He learned Anthem had never charged his account so was uncovered. He would have to pay them pay $6000 bc $1000 per month to have them cover his colonoscopy. So, he decided to let it go and get his own policy per Robbie''s recommendation. He''s healthy, no pre-x, just wants catastrophic insurance. He has an HSA already. His 16 year old daughter has a good Anthem plan that he will keep her on because she has a pre-x condition.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-25 11:52:21', '2018-06-25 11:52:21'),
