  ('zcrm_1579374000018953008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017330039', 'Linda Colombo', NULL, 'This past Wednesday morning Linda was struck with extreme pain and nausea, she went to the emergency room and stayed for a day. I asked if she had any symptoms up to this and she said no, that it hit out of nowhere. I answered many questions as Linda is so new to the program that she hasn''t even gotten a welcome call yet. I explained a bit how Sedera worked. Gave her their number. she thanked me for all my help.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-25 10:44:49', '2018-06-25 10:44:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018929031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939004', 'Mary J Lineback', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-06-25 10:42:22', '2018-06-25 10:42:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018956003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083052', 'Machelle Evans', NULL, 'Paid July and Aug 2018 via post-dated check for 11/13/2018.  Sent email to the member.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-06-25 10:25:36', '2018-06-25 11:32:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018953003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014539053', 'Daryl Mackie', NULL, 'I talked to Heather at length.  I explained more than once that allergy testing is not preventative care, she tried to fight me on it. Then she brought up a bill that was submitted to ASI and they turned around and paid the Dr. so that the Dr was paid twice. - I told her to call ASI, ask about the bill, and to ask about if allergy testing is preventative. -difficult client.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-25 10:21:46', '2018-06-25 10:21:46'),
