  ('zcrm_1579374000018902003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716047', 'Andrew Leister-Frazier', NULL, 'Member called to request cancellation. Sent link. Will refund once payment has processed.  Deleted recurring from FTNI.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-06-25 06:19:48', '2018-06-25 06:19:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018858008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019120001', 'Ian Perry', NULL, '6-22-18 Ian is 25, healthy, no tobacco, no drugs, no meds. Mom took him off her plan Dec. 31, 2017. He thought he was still covered and was trying to find a way to get a SEP but doesn''t have a legit reason until he gets married Oct. 11, 2018. He was looking at a Kaiser plan that cost about $338 silver HSA. Has an HSA funded to about $500 now. Priced out $1000, $1500 and $2500 IUA, $261, $243, $225. We have follow up next week. He''s going to find out about CU''s plan as well since will be grad student and could access their programs. He soon to be wife is on her parents Tri Care through military but will be kicked off once married. He will likely add her to his plan at that point.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-22 15:12:18', '2018-06-22 15:12:18'),
