  ('zcrm_1579374000018842023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362002', 'Deb Bear', NULL, 'called into front desk, Aug 1st start date. she said that she did not see her Naturapath listed on Multiplan and asked about nominating, I told her that she could do that with the link provided on the multiplan site.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-22 13:10:59', '2018-06-22 13:10:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018826028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007925147', 'Linda Johnston', NULL, 'Spoke to Elizabeth at Sedera.  They have 1165 submitted, sent check for 116 and another one just got processed for 49.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-06-22 12:34:53', '2018-06-22 12:34:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018842018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033386', 'Ruth Charles', NULL, 'Ruth called in to ask if all she needed to do was search five different sites to find the best prices on medication she rattled off a few and asked if that was all there was to it?    I told her that although I use a few of those search engines I also have contact with Reid at world meds, and will do all the leg work for her.  I sent out a prescription drug form and told her how to fill it out. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-22 11:17:59', '2018-06-22 11:17:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018847060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474186', 'Cierra McNamara', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-06-22 11:04:15', '2018-06-22 11:04:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018847055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014743027', 'Jay Land', NULL, 'Spoke to member he was busy at a camp. He has email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. He didn''t need me to resend. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-06-22 10:59:15', '2018-06-22 10:59:15'),
