  ('zcrm_1579374000018842013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012416027', 'Judson Rogers', NULL, 'When I spoke to a Kelly, over at the pediatricians office she said that the office does accept the PHSC network, when I asked about billing directly to ASI she couldn''t tell me for sure, so I left a message with Susie in billing. sent a message off to Jud. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-22 10:46:05', '2018-06-22 10:46:05'),
