  ('zcrm_1579374000018820011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819216', 'Rebecca Brignole', NULL, 'I called this enrollee to get Children''s SS#''s.  She wants to know who this information is shared with.  Especially does not want it shared with Govt.  I have a call into Apex to get this information.  She is ok with her application being pended until 8/1 until she gets this information.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-22 10:24:53', '2018-06-22 10:24:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018847040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716907', 'Joleen Gerber', NULL, 'Spoke to member she is having a closing on her new home today. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call when she settles in. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-06-22 10:23:32', '2018-06-22 10:23:32'),
