  ('zcrm_1579374000018858003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010714227', 'Elizabeth Kayser', NULL, '6-22-18 Elizabeth needs to upload some bills for a broken toe. I think John is helping her. She wanted to make sure her account looks good and understands these are per incidents so she hasn''t reached her IUA for either incident, therefore she will continue to pay until she hits $1000 per incident.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-22 09:58:27', '2018-06-22 09:58:27'),
