  ('zcrm_1579374000018491085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594132', 'Tracy Snider', NULL, '5-18-18  I took a call from Tracy who said she wants to cancel before the end of June.  She took a job with benefits and doesn''t need our program.  I told her to email a cancellation letter to Patti immediately to cancel.   Ron P', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-06-18 20:46:23', '2018-06-18 20:46:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018520008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165427', 'Melissa Mitchell', NULL, '6-18-18 Deciding if she wants to do HEP Assoc as an individual for use APTC for her and husband. Medicaid is showing husband as unemployed and kids on Medicaid. But, household income is going to mess that up. They are changing from LLC to S Corp and adding him to the company. But, they may still get penalized on taxes bc of their household income once they file their taxes for 2018. She''s worried about the cost for the two of them when they switch to an S-Corp. So, depending on APTC for both of them that might be the way to go also depending on how much they plan to report in income. She''ll call me early tomorrow for my assistance. Sons B-Day this week so running around too much.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-18 17:15:53', '2018-06-18 17:15:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018520003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819616', 'David Assell', NULL, '6-18-18 Analisa is on vacation so I spoke with clients. Dave''s wife has hemorroids since birth which flare up sometimes. She has at least 3 more visits to a specialist to deal with them which cost about $350 each time as self-pay. I suggested the Co-Pay network plan bc of this and they may choose that option to help with specialist visits and labs. Her Dr. might not be in network but they also want the co-pay for labs. Emailed them the Financial Commentary for Sedera. They will decide in a day or so for July 1st start. Otherwise they are fine with an Aug. 1st start. Want to set up an HSA as well. Cigna plan costs twice the amount and covers non of their doctors anymore.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-18 17:00:18', '2018-06-18 17:00:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018503036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011019034', 'Cheryl Cunningham', NULL, 'I have also sent her an e-mail with script questions- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-18 14:30:19', '2018-06-18 14:30:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018503031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752112', 'Dana Marangi', NULL, 'I spent alot of time on the phone with Dana- I helped her log into the US Corporate website, I helped her register with Teladoc, navigate MultiPlan-showed her were she could  nominate providers, and told her she could call me concerning medications. client happy and less confused.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-18 13:30:39', '2018-06-18 13:30:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018458053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005041125', 'Valerie Hubbuch', 'MPB Concierge added a note in ZOHO SalesIQ', 'I have already reached out to Valerie via e-mail.-KC', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2018-06-18 12:33:41', '2018-06-18 12:33:41'),
