  ('zcrm_1579374000018503008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033139', 'Kim Rew', NULL, 'Kim called in because she was unsure as to whom to call for help.  She had an accident two weeks ago, with her knee, she had to go to urgent care and then to have an mri done because she has a torn miniscus, doctors are saying that  she needs to go to surgery. She was confused about who to call for help. She tried to get ahold of Sedera- she even called three times and no one got back to her. I made sure she was getting the correct number and told her to try calling again, I also told her about logging detailed medical records and that she will more than likely be utilizing second md.  I told her to shoot me an e-mail or a call to let me know how it goes. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-18 08:28:45', '2018-06-18 08:28:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018506013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819113', 'Rya Johnson', NULL, 'Member only $500 IUA PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-18 08:24:53', '2018-06-18 08:24:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018473096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819078', 'Malia Monaco', NULL, '3rd party billing - James Griffin', 'Julie Bloomdahl', 'Julie Bloomdahl', '2018-06-18 07:55:09', '2018-06-18 07:55:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018506008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018505034', 'Mary Sundblom', NULL, 'Emp Only $1000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-18 07:54:23', '2018-06-18 07:54:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018506003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018505034', 'Mary Sundblom', NULL, 'Per Wendy''s request I will enroll her with AK address.  She will put in address  change request when she returns from AK.  CO Address: 271 Sunlight Dr, Carbondale, CO 81623', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-18 07:49:07', '2018-06-18 07:49:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018503003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451009', 'Kay Sasser', NULL, 'David called in to make sure that he and his wife Kay were correctly signed up for using MPowering Benefits and programs beginning in July.  Very smart and nice.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-18 07:09:18', '2018-06-18 07:09:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018473088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008568067', 'Andrea Williamson', NULL, 'Payment update form submitted. Updated in FTNI.', 'Julie Bloomdahl', 'Julie Bloomdahl', '2018-06-18 07:07:20', '2018-06-18 07:07:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018473083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871160', 'Katie Roth', NULL, 'payment change form received from Kenneth Roth to update payment. Sent email to verify.', 'Julie Bloomdahl', 'Julie Bloomdahl', '2018-06-18 07:00:51', '2018-06-19 09:37:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018452023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819686', 'Christine Pembleton', NULL, '06.15.18:  Caren Nealon called - referred Christine - asked me to call her re:  HEP.  Spoke to Christine, explained HEP, focused on Redirect option. Sent flyers for Redirect and Partial Self-directed, as well as link to HEP site. She is very interested, says she wants to enroll. Asked to speak w/her again to review specifics of plans before she enrolls.  Her husband has insurance from his job.  She would have to pay $780/mo. plus $2500 ea. for deductible for her and her 2 children.  They are healthy.  Christine is age 45.  Gave her pricing for Redirect and Self-Directed plans.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-06-16 09:39:25', '2018-06-16 09:39:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018499031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018505034', 'Mary Sundblom', NULL, '6-15-18 
Mary Sundblom wants her Apex and ASi cards to be sent to AK which is a temporary address for 3 months. She''d like to keep her CO in our system since that''s her permanent address.

Please send the cards to:

Mary Sundblom
PO Box 6506
Sitka, AK 99835

Do we need to contact Apex separately?', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-15 16:55:23', '2018-06-15 16:55:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018499023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018505034', 'Mary Sundblom', NULL, '6-15-18 Enrolling now in HEP MPB Group. Referred by Matt Ross. Walking her through enrollment now. Choosing $1000 IUA / $249.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-15 16:26:02', '2018-06-15 16:35:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018499018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819248', 'Linda Pan', NULL, '6-15-18 Healthy, exercises, went to Dr. 3x only in last 5 years and doesn''t like the concept of traditional ins or being forced into it. Has 8 yr old daughter whose currently on x-husband''s plan. Linda only takes birth control pills. She''s going to show this to her boyfriend and get his thoughts as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-15 14:39:03', '2018-06-15 14:39:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018475018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752446', 'Sabine Kortals', NULL, 'Sabine called in about getting a bill for the mamagram she had done, and she was confused because the person handling the billing said that she would be all set, I asked if she had found the facility through the Multi Plan site- she said no, I told her that that may be an issue, as well as if there are diagnostic codes. She kept saying that the reason she picked this plan was because she thought she could pick any doctor or facility she liked. I told her that she could, but that ASI would pay for 130% of medicaid allowable, she asked me to explain I did. I went over everything with her , and she thanked me for being patient with her because she was overwhelmed. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-15 14:25:35', '2018-06-15 14:25:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018490008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005041125', 'Valerie Hubbuch', 'ZOHO SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 338 
Question : Hello,', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2018-06-15 14:21:03', '2018-06-15 14:21:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018475013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679123', 'John McBride', NULL, 'John called about the status of a bill that was submitted a month ago, I told him to use the Sedera app as well as informed him that it generally takes 3--8 weeks for claims to be paid.  He said it felt kinda fishy so I told him to give Sedera a call so that they could put his mind at ease.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-15 13:18:59', '2018-06-15 13:18:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018499013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165427', 'Melissa Mitchell', NULL, 'Left vm for her to help her decide if using APTC for just her for a month or two is best. Or, STM or HEP Assoc.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-15 13:16:13', '2018-06-15 13:16:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018499008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819039', 'Matthew VerMilyea', NULL, '6-15-18 Matt is 38, wife 35 and kids 2 and 4. Healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco, or drugs. Want a July 1st start date. His tax advisor recommended Sedera. Was employed by a large corporation but decided go on as an Independent Contractor. Paying $7637 per year which is $636 a month. I''m assuming that is their portion and the company pays the rest. They also want information on dental which I need to send. Have our follow up call on Monday to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-15 13:01:18', '2018-06-15 13:01:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018499003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881277', 'Brandon Dwight', NULL, '6-15-18 Brandon is wanting to sign up his company Donnelly Sports. He called in and spoke to Luke who helped him and then sent him to Jason McKinley at McKinley and DeMarco Ins. Services knowing Brandon is an MPB client already. Luke didnt think we were doing groups! Brandon has asked to stay with me as their agent for the company and signed an AOR. I will complete the process BUT this excludes the MBP portion of the membership. :-( I''ve decided to pay Jason $100 for doing some of the work before I learned of what happened.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-15 12:39:23', '2018-06-15 12:39:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018475008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537031', 'Maureen Mulkey', NULL, 'Maureen called and wanted to know what the course of action was when it comes to going to a routine derm apt. I gave her the run down and also sent her a list of other dermatologists in her area that she can compare to see if they are cheaper.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-15 12:32:26', '2018-06-15 12:32:26'),
