  ('zcrm_1579374000018376003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819469', 'Joseph Stafford', NULL, '5-13-18  Kelly called today and wanted to enroll.  I ask her how she found us and she could not remember the rep she spoke to quite a while ago.  We finally discovered it was Robin Kemp.  She ask me to explain the program again.  She didn''t know what  medical cost sharing was.  I took her to our website and did an entire presentation.  She wanted to talk to her husband and she said she would get back to me to enroll soon.

