  ('zcrm_1579374000018366021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005271339', 'Christina KUB', NULL, '6-13-18 Chrys is looking for a short-term disability solution to cover about $4K a month to live comfortably. Cost is about $106 for 10 yr. term at NLG or $138 with accident added. Can get longer 20 yr term that is convertible at 15 yrs. Or 10 yr. is convertible at 10. Fixed UL is $652 a month, but IUL will be best to use if wants income stream in future from policy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-13 15:09:30', '2018-06-13 15:09:30'),
