  ('zcrm_1579374000018212013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243295', 'Brooke Spencer', NULL, 'I gave her a call because her MPowering cards came back to us. Her apt number 1331 was not listed in her account, I just added it. She also had a  question about her husbands name not being on the asi card. I told her that he will have no problem using it because he is on the account.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-11 12:57:41', '2018-06-11 12:57:41'),
