  ('zcrm_1579374000018212003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017307054', 'Michael Brooks', NULL, 'Michael was calling in to speak with Vanessa regarding a request to schedule a welcome call. He also wanted to know what to do...his child needed to go to the emergency room  and accrued a bill for over a thousand dollars, he wanted to know if the pediatrician appointment that is coming up as a follow up would be covered because it was over 1,000.  I told him that he needed to speak to Sedera about the entire situation so that they can do what they do best as soon as possible. I gave client the phone number. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-11 12:24:30', '2018-06-11 12:24:30'),
