  ('zcrm_1579374000018158008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003927009', 'Marc Harrington', NULL, 'Hello Patti. 
 My name is Marc Harrington. I cancelled my liberty Insurance once my employer provided it for me.  I wasn’t told I needed to also cancel HES. I have been billed for many months and I’m extremely bitter.  I have been working in Wyoming for a year and there aren’t any Chase banks there so it was hard to get a printout of money coming out.  I closed that account so the bleeding will stop.  I won’t pay another cent for something that I haven’t used. It seems your organization has found a lucrative way to milk the public.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-09 09:55:31', '2018-06-09 09:55:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018158003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004515038', 'Dawn Bush', NULL, 'Member called in and had a conversion with Rod.  Says she cancelled LHS months ago.  Per Rod will refund 1 month then cancel', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-09 09:46:12', '2018-06-09 09:46:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018110018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017307054', 'Michael Brooks', NULL, 'Michael called in because he wanted his son to use Teladoc,  he is very new to the plan so I sent him registration instructions and well as gave him the phone number to reach them at. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-08 14:53:54', '2018-06-08 14:53:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018110013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002519033', 'Diane Bailey', NULL, 'Diane called in to speak to John about receipts as well as see if there was a better price for the Taytulla birth control that her daughter is on. They have been paying roughly $230 a month for it.  I found a generic for $13.92 and sent it to her. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-08 12:05:36', '2018-06-08 12:05:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018119008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830414', 'Ann Wilkinson', NULL, 'Payment for setup fee was declined by the bank.  Sent email to the member to update payment info.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-06-08 11:50:00', '2018-06-08 11:50:00'),
