  ('zcrm_1579374000018099031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017330039', 'Linda Colombo', NULL, 'Member doesn''t have computer at this time and can''t afford another one. Told her to register with Teledoc at 1-800 Teledoc and indicate your with Sedera health. We are waiving for her not to have to do required health risk assessment. She stated medicare goes into place as of Nov. 1, 2018 so she will be canceling then. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-06-08 11:32:05', '2018-06-08 11:32:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018110008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, 'Heather called in today with many questions about her families plan because she and her husband will be going out of town leaving the kids in the care of the oldest son who is 19. I went over what he should do if there was an emergent situation, I reminded them to utilize Teladoc as well.  Heather wanted to know if mental health needs were shareable, I told her no, but told her about Sedera''s counseling service and e-mailed her all of the info on it.   She sounded really interested in it. I also resent her preventative care links.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-08 11:08:56', '2018-06-08 11:08:56'),
