  ('zcrm_1579374000018002033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990381', 'Elena Garet', NULL, 'Elena called in because her husband was bit by a tick and she and the new natropath think that he may have Lymes disease, she told me that between the blood work and exam, it will be around $700. I told her that I would call her back because I was unsure about whether or not Sedera would cover the expenses because it is Natropathic in  nature, but that I would cal her back with the answer. John told me to tell Elena to call Sedera herself to see if it will be sharable in nature.   Left message on machine. -I also stressed the importance of a welcome call, and told her that she might not be so frustrated, or that she doesn''t know how anything works if she just took the 15-20 min.  Gave her Sedera''s number -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-07 14:36:38', '2018-06-07 14:56:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000018002028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017078234', 'Keith Flakne', NULL, 'Keith called in because upon trying to register for Teladoc they told him that he couldn''t because he was labeled as female in their records. MPowering and ASI have him as Male.  I called Sedera and they had him mislabeled in their system and will correct it so that it will be updated tomorrow (Friday) but that Teladoc will not have it updated until Monday.  I relayed all of the info to Keith. He is find, no need for Teladoc right now, he was just making sure that all accounts were active and ready to go.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-07 13:34:46', '2018-06-07 13:34:46'),
