  ('zcrm_1579374000017962003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243256', 'Miguel Sanchez', NULL, 'Member didnt have access to a computer during the welcome call', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-06-06 18:21:37', '2018-06-06 18:21:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017961003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937091', 'Brandi Nelson', NULL, '6-6-18 Brandi is 44 and husband is 47. Family of 4 healthy. Daughter diagnosed with asthma that they are treating naturally, no meds. Son got concussion in hockey this year and fine. Brandi has nodule found on her thyroid in 2001. It grew in 2016 or 2017. They tested 7-12 months ago it and it''s benign and says no concern. I explained pre-x clause carefully to make her think about it. Sending her pricing for ACCESS Association option.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-06 15:00:33', '2018-06-06 15:00:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017951018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474088', 'Terry Lopez', NULL, 'I spoke with Terry''s husband about how to approach the pharmacy for the first time with discount coupons. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-06 14:08:21', '2018-06-06 14:08:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017951013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716955', 'Wes Richardson', NULL, 'Wes called in to get some instruction on how to submit his wife''s preventative care blood work bill as well as his daughters pediatrician well visit for reimbursement.  He said that he made sure to get the detailed coded bills- I told them to  copy and then send them to the address on the back of his ASI card, he asked about e-mailing them to ASI, I told him that he is welcome to give them a call and ask if he could do it that way. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-06 12:33:42', '2018-06-06 12:33:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017933108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033139', 'Kim Rew', NULL, 'Member requests all notifications to go to her and her spouse.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-06-06 12:08:01', '2018-06-06 12:08:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017936122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830047', 'Robert Chavez', NULL, '2nd VM to member requesting Children''s SS#''s', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-06 12:02:53', '2018-06-06 12:02:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017936117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018402156', 'Jeanette Malki', NULL, 'Per Elizabeth this member only registered w/Sedera did not do either of the applications.  I emailed Robin and advised her of this and asked to have her complete ASAP.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-06 11:58:50', '2018-06-06 11:58:50'),
