  ('zcrm_1579374000017951003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899362', 'Joe Dan Higgins', NULL, 'Joe Dan called to get instructions on cancelling and had a few questions for Patti. I guided him through how to get to the online form that he can fill out and Patti is speaking to him now. He thanked us for all of the help over the last few months. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-06 09:21:25', '2018-06-06 09:21:25'),
