  ('zcrm_1579374000017924024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003524079', 'Tonya Hall', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that they had cancelled LHS on 4/30.  they were not aware of who we were.  I will cancel and refund 1 month', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-05 14:39:59', '2018-06-05 14:39:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017933011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362080', 'David Kimble', NULL, 'Dave is 59 and wife is 60 with 19 and 21 year old kids who are FT students and dependents still. They are all above average health wise. Only pre-x is wife''s allergies of hay fever and spring pollen. She takes only OTC for that. No other meds except daughter might take BC. They are all athletic, vegan, he plays basketball 3x week and other exercise, wife does yoga 3x week and lifts weights, etc. Daughter was gymnast but now runs I think and son body builder. This fits with their belief system. Quoted him MPB Group HEP.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-05 12:41:01', '2018-06-05 13:33:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017924019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925108', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', NULL, 'Emp Only $1000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-05 12:31:36', '2018-06-05 12:31:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017936013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779212', 'Timothy Gustafson', NULL, 'Member''s spouse called in stating she couldnt access the HRA. I called back and left a VM.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-06-05 12:31:32', '2018-06-05 12:31:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017936008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899160', 'Rosemary Veilleux', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member needs an ASi card', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-06-05 12:24:30', '2018-06-05 12:24:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017936003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568233', 'Sherry Lewis', NULL, 'Member needs an ASI card. Welcome call complete.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-06-05 11:53:47', '2018-06-05 11:53:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017924011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925007', 'Rani Reichow', NULL, 'Emp &amp; Fam $1000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-06-05 11:41:03', '2018-06-05 11:41:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017933003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017932016', 'Charles Martin DeFrance', NULL, '6-5-18 His mom Helen Mary called to get help and then handed it over to her son Charles Martin. He goes by Martin! He has epilepsy and will need some outpatient surgery this year. He aging out of parents ins. on his Birthday when turns 26. He''s working on a start up company and expects about $32K before expenses, so $24K estimated after deducting expenses. Got APTC of $198.52. Anthem Silver Pathway X HMO 2000 for $217.22. Dr. Brooke Allen and Dr. Dave Borchers in Basalt are his docs he''s sticking with in Roaring Fork Valley, 81621. Also spoke with Devon at C4 to add the Continue button. Tkt 180-605-124 9507. Cobra expires June 18th. Helen Mary called back and is planning to apply for his IHC for the few weeks he''ll be uninsured. She knows pre-x aren''t covered in case he has a seizure. She said her car insurance lapsed 4 days once and she had an accident. So, she''ll never make that mistake again. Helen''s # is 601-672-2990. I sent a $75.77 Bridge plan for June IHC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-06-05 11:25:19', '2018-06-05 20:41:12'),
