  ('zcrm_1579374000017814003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033534', 'Nicole Carter McGill', NULL, 'Nicole called in late Friday wondering how she would bring her baby to the Dr on Monday morning when he had not received her ASI card yet- I explained the reason why she did not get it yet and John called over to ASI and requested that she be sent a temporary card straight away. I stayed in communication with her until she verbally verified that she had received it in her e-mail.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-04 07:11:33', '2018-06-04 07:11:33'),
