  ('zcrm_1579374000017756003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610440', 'Kreston Rohrig', NULL, 'apparently Kreston does not want to be contacted after sending "Stop contacting me!" in response to our newsletter,  so I have opted him out of our e-mails as well as Skipio. PLEASE NOTE THAT CLIENT IS OPTING OUT OF E-MAILS- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-06-01 08:02:51', '2018-06-01 08:02:51'),
