  ('zcrm_1579374000017721021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810847', 'Sally Hammond', NULL, '5-31-18 Told them about deadline of today for current MPB Group HEP membership. Aren''t ready to decide today so I told them the new pricing and that they don''t have to do the referral or health risk assessment with new option. They also want dental and vision and have VSP right now. I''ll send them dental discount plan options. Sally is 57 and Pete 58. Sally no health issues at all. Pete had minor ankle surgery over 3 years ago in the spring. So, no pre-x. They might work on retiring or ending coverage with current company soon. They may choose July 1st or a few months beyond. She''s hoping to have 30 days to get all in order and will contact me then. Know of 20th of the month deadline as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-31 16:49:21', '2018-05-31 16:49:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017711048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830324', 'Terry Thomsen', NULL, 'Emp Only $1000 IUA +Lib Rx', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-05-31 14:36:42', '2018-06-01 07:44:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017711043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005806087', 'Silvia Wilson', NULL, 'Member cancelled LHS and we were not notified.  Per John I refunded the Apr &amp; May pmts &amp; Cancelled her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-05-31 14:24:31', '2018-05-31 14:24:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017711038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830286', 'Maureen Gannon (Hanson)', NULL, 'Emp Only $500 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-05-31 14:02:45', '2018-05-31 14:02:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017712079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679123', 'John McBride', NULL, 'John reported that he had updated on how his claim is going from Sedera, and I told him about the Sedera''s new updated app.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-31 13:51:34', '2018-05-31 13:51:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017721013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010714227', 'Elizabeth Kayser', NULL, '5-31-18 Pwd 27822782 Uploaded dr. bill for a recent visit for sleep/headache issues. Cost was $110 labs and $145 office visits with the self-pay discount. Currently does not meet her $1000 IUA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-31 13:47:31', '2018-05-31 13:53:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017712074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679123', 'John McBride', NULL, 'John called and wanted to know the status of the bills he uploaded to Sedera 2 weeks ago- he seemed a bit confused about the difference between Sedera and MPowering Benefits and to whom he submitted the bills too.  I told him that I would be more than happy to speak to John about it so that maybe we could give a call in or send an e-mail to check on the status of it.  but in the end decided to give Sedera a call and if he couldn''t get a hold of anyone that he would call back for additional assistance.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-31 13:39:57', '2018-05-31 13:39:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017701057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659360', 'Rachel Brenneman', NULL, 'Spoke to Kareen at ASI.  Informed her that Rachel paid lab bill and to reimburse her for payment.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-05-31 13:19:34', '2018-05-31 13:19:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017721008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010714227', 'Elizabeth Kayser', NULL, '5-31-18 Called for help in uploading new non-wellness bills to Sedera. She had labs done for $110 and dr. visit for $145 as a self-pay patient. I showed her how to upload the bills and hopefully it''s intuitive the rest of the way. She has the line for the Concierge if she needs further help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-31 13:14:00', '2018-05-31 13:14:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017712066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191454', 'Jennifer McMahon', NULL, 'Jennifer called in from a walk-in clinic because one of her children needed ear medication- I helped her by searching the drug ONLY on goodrx.com, the client somehow remembered getting it at Publix cheaper- I told her that it was $91 at Publix and sent her a coupon to get the meds for $32.20 -KC
*note* she called back and wanted a coupon from Walgreens instead- coupon sent', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-31 13:13:32', '2018-05-31 13:20:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017701049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659360', 'Rachel Brenneman', NULL, 'Spoke to Rachel.  Dr. King out of network. Bill of $360 - re-priced to 168.20. She understands how a PPO works.  Resubmitted the Lab bill.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-05-31 13:12:16', '2018-05-31 13:14:29'),
