  ('zcrm_1579374000017712045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009790107', 'Stephen Hill', NULL, 'Stephen called in today to get help with uploading bills from his childs birth 3 weeks. I guided him to the app, but he forgot his password, I provided him with Sedera''s phone number so they could help him with his password so he could submit his bills.  CANCELLATION PENDING -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-31 09:53:02', '2018-05-31 09:53:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017712040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676815', 'Stephen Carr', NULL, 'Stephen called in because he couldn''t find any GI Dr''s on the Liberty providers list- John and I then did a search ourselves and found nothing within a 50 mile radius. So I called him back and told him that we couldn''t find anything as well, but if he called Liberty, asked for Provider Relations and told them about his search- that they could possibly know of some providers that they have done business with in the past that do not have an agreement with them that they could refer him too instead as an option.  Client was very happy for the help and thanked us for our guidance.  KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-31 09:44:15', '2018-05-31 09:44:15'),
