  ('zcrm_1579374000017712035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000255524', 'Ana Leighton', NULL, 'I spoke wiht Ana today- she wanted to know how to submit her annual physical bills to ASI- I told her that it was the address on the back of her card, she said she rather not send them off that way and rathered that she could electronically send them in. I told her that she could send them to John and he could send them in instead. She will be getting a mamogram, colonoscopy AND bone density tests soon and wanted to know if they would be covered by ASI- I told her that if they are preventative they would be- she thanked me for all of the help- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-31 09:26:45', '2018-05-31 09:56:01'),
