  ('zcrm_1579374000017658008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716047', 'Andrew Leister-Frazier', NULL, 'I called and spoke with Dania at Sedera and told her about what  is going on with Andrew and his mother trying to take care of everything. Dania told me that she would reach out to Valnora and take it from there, if she needed anything else she will give us a call.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-30 08:59:49', '2018-05-30 08:59:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017658003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716047', 'Andrew Leister-Frazier', NULL, 'I had a long talk with Valnora, it turns out that Andrew is in the hospital involuntary- that Police were involved. I told her that it was bittersweet news, as Sedera will only help out if he was in the hospital due to involuntary hospitalization. She also told me that his medications were just too expensive, I told her that once Andrew is released to call me and let me know what the updated medications were so I can search for better prices. I told her that she can call on us anytime. I gave Sedera''s member services phone number, as well as told her about the counseling service that they offer.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-30 07:42:40', '2018-05-30 07:42:40'),
