  ('zcrm_1579374000017631003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086209', 'Samantha Creach', NULL, '5-29-18 John spoke with Dania about Teledoc problems Sammi is having. Dania said her entire family is in the Teledoc system. Guessing she called the wrong # to reach Teledoc and thus her account wasn''t pulling up. But, it''s all in their system. John is going to call Sammi right now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-29 14:31:17', '2018-05-29 14:31:17'),
