aprilbaca@icloud.com', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-29 14:09:05', '2018-05-29 14:09:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017612043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716047', 'Andrew Leister-Frazier', NULL, 'I spoke with Andrew''s mother Valnora, she said that he was in dire need of mental health care- she wants GAP insurance for him but has been denied because he has proof of insurance with his ASI card.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-29 14:03:33', '2018-05-29 14:03:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017612038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024247', 'Barbara Hull', NULL, 'Member stated she doesnt have an ASI card and is using temporary card still. Also sent her a provider list with female doctors for gynecology and general practice.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-05-29 14:00:13', '2018-05-29 14:00:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017608088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993452', 'Holly Wiese', NULL, '5-29-18 Holly is totally healthy no problem, no meds except takes birth control.. Husband Greg had thyroid cancer and lymphoma over 10 years ago and both in remission. But, lymphoma could possibly come back. She will discuss with Greg but probably not a good idea for him. He takes thyroid meds right now as well since he no longer has a thyroid. She was asking about Krohn''s disease as well. I''m guessing her brother Ryan might have that and meds are necessary for that as well. Could flare up and need surgery for that. Both are self-employed. Greg is in Portland right now but coming to CO on Thurs. Not sure if he lives there or is just traveling. Greg is paying $500+ a month and Holly is paying about $366+ a month. She is 45 and he''s 55. Both have Birthdays upcoming in June! Sent her email to read. She''s overwhelmed at how much detail I just provided her. Will read it all over and ask more questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-29 12:43:18', '2018-05-29 12:43:18'),
