  ('zcrm_1579374000017605014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001799013', 'Ray Iglesias', NULL, '5-29-18  Called Ray first thing and spoke to him.  He told me he spoke with John who explained we are still offering our current plan.  I provided Ray with the new web address: MPoweringbenfits.com so he can look over plans and see the pricing.  He did not know that.  I invited Ray to come intot the office and I would sit down and explain the plans and show him the comparisons and differences in the plans and give him copies of the plan to take with.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-05-29 08:05:46', '2018-05-29 08:05:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017605009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001799013', 'Ray Iglesias', NULL, '5/25-18  John K called Ron to share Ray still awaiting to hear from me about our new plans.  I called Ray immediately and left him a vm to call me.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-05-29 08:02:28', '2018-05-29 08:02:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017565006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919496', 'Dana Green', 'ZOHO SalesIQ chat with MyAHE', 'Visit ID : 331 
Question : I am signing up my son who is 29 and currently has no insurance.  He will soon be eligible for insurance through his employer, though not until August or September and that only if he stays at this job.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2018-05-27 05:23:34', '2018-05-27 05:23:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017557003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740251', 'Evan Altman', NULL, 'Lori has multiple issues.  Sleep study - to be negotiated by Sedera - member is sending CPT code.  Also needs Sedera to check pricing on tests, member sending test names.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-05-25 13:39:08', '2018-05-25 13:39:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017547008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830168', 'Laura Zaunbrecher', NULL, '5-25-18 Laura is 35 and Charles 36 and looking to get pregnant soon. Laura''s insurance is $405 a month with $5800 ded / 30% coinsurance. She has asthma and needs affordable meds. Costing her $250 a month with ins. Dulera 120 doses, 200mcg/5mcg and Proair HFA is 8.5 mcg / 90 mcg 1 inhaler. Goodrx $56.59. Otherwise, super healthy, active, eats well. Charles has no issues. He''s only paying $233 a month with $5000 ded and $35 co-pay, or $50 co-pay. They know the deadline is May 31 to be grandfathered into HEP MPB Group.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-25 13:33:16', '2018-05-25 13:33:16'),
