  ('zcrm_1579374000017479003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038161', 'Karee Watson', NULL, 'Karee called in frustrated that she is not at all privy to using computers- and that everything is online. I stayed on the phone with her for a half an hour just to get one very simple project done, but our phone call hit a wall when she could not figure out how to open an attatchment on an email- I even sent it again. She is stressed and confused over the situation and I told her that I would be speaking with John about it today to see if we can come up with a solution.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-25 07:54:39', '2018-05-25 07:54:39'),
