  ('zcrm_1579374000017403023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578042', 'James Forro', NULL, 'James called in uncertain as to when he could make his first preventative care appointment, in AZ or in MN  as he is traveling back and forth from there for the next month (he is in the military) he wanted to know about our welcome calls and after seeing that Vanessa had already done one, I told him that if he ever felt as though he needed to sharpen up he is always welcome to schedule another call with us. Client grateful for all of our help.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-23 14:51:17', '2018-05-23 14:51:17'),
