  ('zcrm_1579374000017409006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033139', 'Kim Rew', NULL, '05.23.18:  Emailed Kim to notify her that her referral, Brooke Spenser &amp; her husband, Tim were approved for HEP.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-05-23 13:52:16', '2018-05-23 13:52:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017403018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451062', 'Patricia Bedell', NULL, '5-23-18 Family of 4, kids 18 and 20 and both in school at CU and UNC as dependents. John has low thyroid and meds cost $9 a month and also well managed high blood pressure. He''s 61, wife Pat 54. Kids had asthma as kids and have grown out of it. They have an HSA already and they never use their ins. He''s spent $5000 already this year and just used it to clean ear wax out of ear. Wife fainted sometime, maybe last year and friend took her to hospital. She was there for 2-3 hours and the bill was $6K!  Found nothing wrong with her. Crazy. Paying $1800 now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-23 13:31:56', '2018-05-30 15:31:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017403013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009790107', 'Stephen Hill', NULL, '5-23-18 Left vm with Stephen. Patti says he''s switching to Solidarity for price reasons. But, their pre-x clause does not include putting $ towards her current pregnancy. So, they may be getting themselves into trouble by doing this.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-23 12:43:44', '2018-05-23 12:43:44'),
