  ('zcrm_1579374000017329013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830254', 'Robert Brown', NULL, '4-22-18 Patti received a call from Bob.  He shared a sorted conversation with Patti about Sedera.   I called him straight away and he explained his company is working with Jamie at Sedera.  There is a family relationship between one of the three partners at their financial company.  He was sure why setting up the group was taking so long.  They have been trying for a couple months to make it happen.  Alden Hagadern has already enrolled from the company with us.  Robert''s enrollment today was referred by Alden.  Robert is going to speak to his partners to discuss having everyone enroll into the MPB platform and each person will be the next person''s referral.  I will follow-up with him on what they decide to do.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-05-22 11:33:00', '2018-05-22 11:33:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017329008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899178', 'Daniel Klein', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member''s wife Carmen stated they didn''t receive their ASI cards.  Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-05-22 11:20:29', '2018-05-22 11:20:29'),
