  ('zcrm_1579374000017334003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006461083', 'Jason Garvin', NULL, '5-22-18 Jason wants to renew his membership. He and wife both got new jobs with benefits. On Medicaid now until July 1st. They can get UHC through Jason''s work at $891 mo with $4500 Ded or wifes''s for basically $493 mo with $2500 ded and $5000 mop per person or $9000 mop per family. So, LHS and HES at $499 will protect them way better with the $1500 AUA. Mark with LHS is emailing Jason the paper app to complete bc he said it will be easiest.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-22 11:01:22', '2018-05-22 11:01:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017310073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009604129', 'Lori Frisbie', NULL, 'Lori called in wanting to know how to go about seeing doctors for her annual general practice Dr and to see an obgyn- I sent her the latest provider list.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-22 10:36:42', '2018-05-22 10:36:42'),
