  ('zcrm_1579374000017284003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024247', 'Barbara Hull', NULL, 'called to get provider network info- we  spoke about the welcome call, she said she never got to have one. but said that she would really like to have one.- also no ASI card. I told her that she would be sent a temporary one as well as the actual card. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-21 14:46:18', '2018-05-21 14:46:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017265050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004940069', 'Christine Heinritz', NULL, 'Kevin in Tampa finally got a hold of Christine and said he didn''t know why she couldn''t access the Telemed247 website like she had done before but that he would forward all of this to someone higher up to fix it, he gave Christine a company card and told her to register and use drondemand.com, Christine was very happy for all of the follow-up we did with her this afternoon - I thanked her for being extremely kind and patient through the whole situation and that we hope she gets better soon.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-21 14:25:43', '2018-05-21 14:25:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017265040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862150', 'Judy Flanagan', NULL, 'went over preventative care services and provider links.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-21 14:19:45', '2018-05-21 14:19:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017265035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004940069', 'Christine Heinritz', NULL, 'Christine has been waiting to speak to a Dr via telemed for close to 2 hours now- we are waiting another half an hour to see what happens after a call into our rep.  I told Christine that I would give her any updates that I get and that we will make sure that she is taken care of. I also told her that if she did feel as though she needed to go to an urgent care that she should and then if it goes over her AUA to just submit bill to Liberty.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-21 13:35:31', '2018-05-21 13:35:31'),
