  ('zcrm_1579374000017211021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243389', 'Edward Seymour', NULL, '5-18-18 Eric Blakely doesn''t appear to be a member with MPB so referral goes to me. Ed practices yoga and helps him remain balanced. He''s applying now as an individual. $1000/$249. Set up his own patent business recently.  He completed his enrollment just now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-18 14:05:06', '2018-05-18 14:39:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017226003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659096', 'Ann Renee Hassle', NULL, 'See e-mail...... preventative immunizations are covered however, if administered at a pharmacy, the pharmacy must submit the bill or provide a bill with their tax ID and the proper CPT codes in order to be processed.  Most pharmacies won''t do that.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-05-18 13:09:19', '2018-05-18 13:09:19'),
