  ('zcrm_1579374000017211013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243567', 'Tanya Dueri', NULL, '5-18-18 Tonya is enrolling right now for $1000/$249. She may email Tom and Beth White O''Connor to hear their experience thus far. Her only health problem is some anti-depressant meds. Asked many questions and seems to be comfortable now moving forward. Completed enrollment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-18 12:21:19', '2018-05-18 12:45:50'),
