  ('zcrm_1579374000017085003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017078368', 'Diane Humphrey', NULL, '3rd split sale with Steve Cox. June 1st start date. She is with Kaiser paying $700+ a month and is tired of doing so. Has sleep apnea, well managed and oxygen levels in high 90''s now. Low thyroid and manages with cheap meds. Understands she has to pay for ongoing maintenance and meds (with use of Concierge). Also on low dose of anti-depressants. Her neighbor is a Dr. Jennifer Lentz and has started her own DPC and is part of Doximity to pool money (sounds like). Diane is not part of DPC. Has her own HSA and will fund it up to $4450 bc over 55. Choosing $1000/$249.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-15 10:25:51', '2018-05-15 10:33:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017079018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005185397', 'Brian Curtice', NULL, 'Received cancellation request for this member.  Attached. Will cancel immediately', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-05-15 10:16:21', '2018-05-15 10:16:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017083003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009790155', 'Todd Nelson', NULL, 'Todd called in, at first, to get the full rundown on plan the in''s and out''s because he didn''t know how anything worked,  after looking at his account I recommended that he go ahead and schedule the welcome call with us. Then he said that the other reason he called was because there is a freckle on the back of his son''s eye that has recently changed colors and that he has an appointment tomorrow with a retinal specialist. I went over how he should handle tomorrow- say that he is a cash paying patient, ask for a cash discount, ask for a detailed medical bill, scan bill onto computer desk top so that he can stay organized and simply upload to sedera if this particular need goes over his IUA- call Sedera if need is close to or goes over IUA.-I explained that process twice- I recommended that he make a welcome call appointment for tomorrow. Reached out to Analisa to go over the plan again with Todd.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-15 10:06:04', '2018-05-15 10:10:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017079013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011910001', 'John Singleton', NULL, 'Notified by Vanessa that this member wishes to cancel Lib Rx.  I will notify Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-05-15 09:48:59', '2018-05-15 09:48:59'),
