Shoreham, NY 11786', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-05-14 10:58:21', '2018-05-14 10:58:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017061003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017165004', 'Mary Rachel Hostetter', NULL, '5-14-18 Needs a STM for 2 months while moiving from MN to CO for a new job. Living with parents in Louisville for 2 months before job starts. Found an IHC plan for $75.77 $2500 ded, 70% coinsurance, $6000 OOP. She had been shown a UHC plan also around the same cost but thought she wanted something cheaper until I explained how it works better. Then seems good with not being exposed to over $20K if something bad happens. Has a high ded plan currently through exchange in MN. Her work is  a 9 month contract every year so will need gap plan for 3 months next year. Once law goes away she can get a STM for 90 days each year thereafter likely.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-14 10:43:33', '2018-05-14 10:43:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017043036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, 'Christine Harvey called in from the ER her son is going to be taken to a local childrens hospital for further treatment for seizures.-I told her to call Sedera on her sons behalf. she said she got them involved the first time and I told her that it still was the correct route to go. Just needed some guidance during this difficult time.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-14 10:42:53', '2018-05-14 10:42:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017059013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033139', 'Kim Rew', NULL, '05.14.18:  Called Kim. She explained what happened w/her applicatio process w/Sedera. Said Sedera emailed her that her phone number was wrong and not permitting the application process to complete.  She said she had called them several times on Friday and did not hear back from them.  Told her I would speak w/Patti about it and to try Sedera again today.  I called Patti. She resolved issue w/Sedera who told Patti Kim is approved for June 1st start date  Patti said she will charge Kim the set-up fee today.  Called Kim and relayed Patti''s message to her.  All is now a go!
Kim gave me 2 names for referral:  Brooke Spenser and Terri Kelley.  Will contact them.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-05-14 10:02:24', '2018-05-14 10:02:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017059008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033139', 'Kim Rew', NULL, '05.13.18:  Called Kim - l/m to c/b with any questions or needs.  Also mentioned I can help with any referrals she has.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-05-14 09:57:48', '2018-05-14 09:57:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017043031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862078', 'Marissa Merchant', NULL, 'Marissa phoned in today because she just found out that she was pregnant, she wanted a bit of a refresher because now she will be going to see an obgyn and eventually finding a facility for birth- I brought up that having an HSA account if she didn''t already would be a great idea. I sent her new provider links-hsa set up -congratulated her! Client was very happy.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-14 09:57:32', '2018-05-14 09:57:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017059003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033139', 'Kim Rew', NULL, '05.12.18:  Patti called, said Kim and her husband were trying enroll in program and were having difficulties w/Sedera part.  Patti helped them.  Asked me to call Kim re: prospects she has.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-05-14 09:57:00', '2018-05-14 09:57:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017032038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033064', 'Michael Matyasz', NULL, 'Emp Only $500 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-05-14 09:40:00', '2018-05-14 09:40:00'),
