  ('zcrm_1579374000017043023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005185397', 'Brian Curtice', NULL, 'Brian called in because he just got divorced and never knew that he had been paying for Liberty as well as MPowering Benefits.- He wanted to me to tell him about what we do here- after rundown he said that he will think about whether or not he will cancel or not.-also will be cancelling his exwife either way-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-14 09:23:19', '2018-05-14 09:23:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017032023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919258', 'Erika Overholt', NULL, 'Was copied on an email that was sent to Sedera inquiring about lower priced plans.   I let Wendy know and forwarded her the email so she could f/u.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-05-14 09:09:35', '2018-05-14 09:09:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017032018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033139', 'Kim Rew', NULL, '5/11-Spent 45 mins on the phone with this enrollee, she was having problems enrolling.  I got her as far as the Sedera registration and she was having problems with creating passcode.  I gave her Sedera Mbr Svs #.  Said she had other people to refer.  I advised her that program was ending and I would have Joan f/u with her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-05-14 09:04:39', '2018-05-14 09:04:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017043018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881700', 'Thomas (Tom) Traxler', NULL, 'Dena phoned in to ask if her yearly cardiologist appts are covered in the MEC plan, I told her to give ASI a call.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-14 08:48:29', '2018-05-14 08:48:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017037082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474303', 'William DeForge', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-05-14 08:47:20', '2018-05-14 08:47:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017043013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083120', 'Margaret Noonan', NULL, 'I called Maggie this morning regarding her vaccine question this morning- told her that whenever it comes to a specific question regarding preventative services that she should give ASI a call and that they would be more than happy to answer her questions. Also told her how to nominate a Dr or facility out of network.Maggie thanked me so much for all of the helpfulness.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-14 08:08:51', '2018-05-14 08:08:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017032013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013778010', 'Rachel Wright', NULL, 'Member submitted Plan Change form to remove her children from plan.  I email ASi &amp; Sedera.  Billing has been updated.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-05-14 07:57:22', '2018-05-14 07:57:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017043008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068058', 'Alden Hagardorn', NULL, 'Alden called me back and we went over the details of the scripts again and over the prescription quote I sent out- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-14 07:52:22', '2018-05-14 07:52:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017043003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000255524', 'Ana Leighton', NULL, 'Ana rang in this morning because she was at the Dr''s office, they didn''t recognize the ASI card and she didn''t remember if she found the office on the providers list or not, I told her that was fine, just get a detailed medical receipt and ask for a cash discount and pay with HSA card.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-14 07:42:07', '2018-05-14 07:42:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000017037066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013046075', 'Patience Kozak', NULL, 'No info for Cathy Kingsley. Referral paid to Jeff.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-05-14 07:20:57', '2018-05-14 07:20:57'),
