  ('zcrm_1579374000017032003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007222073', 'Renetta Asaro', NULL, 'From: Renetta Asaro [mailto:renasaro@gmail.com] 
Sent: Wednesday, May 09, 2018 1:18 PM
To: liberty@myahe.org
Subject: Cancellation of My Academy dues

To whom it concerns, 

Please cancel my account (Liberty #142312301) with your company effective immediately. I spoke with one of your representatives last month and stated I would no longer be able to pay yet and yet I was charged again this month. I respectfully ask for a refund of this month''s payment. When I spoke with Liberty they said you were no longer associated with their company and had not been for some time.

Please let me know immediately if there''s anything else I need to do to request a refund, and cancel this charge permanently..

Sincerely, 
Renetta Asaro
760-845-1486', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-05-14 06:57:47', '2018-05-14 06:57:47');
