  ('zcrm_1579374000016661014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012791050', 'Phillip Mauger', NULL, 'Phil called in because it looks like his wife got bit in the face by an insect and her face is swolllen and puffy- he wanted to know if the Dr wanted to do blood work what route should he take?  I told him about direct labs.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-07 07:45:08', '2018-05-07 07:45:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016661003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779401', 'Kathleen Wilger', NULL, 'Kathleen went to see her obgyn recently for spotting- and at the time the Dr wanted her to get a transvaginal ultrasound as well as an abdominal one.  Since then the spotting has stopped but she wants to have it done for peace of mind. She has been collecting all of her bills- $164 for the office visit- and the quoted prices from the Oregon Medical group of $350 for the transvaginal ultrasound and $301 for the abdominal. I explained the difference between ASI and preventative care and Sedera with there is an illness or injury-I gave Sedera''s phone number and suggested that she should call-KC  (her call was at the end of the day and I told her that on Monday when John gets in that we could help her further- as in finding the lowest prices on imaging ext.)-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-07 07:25:04', '2018-05-07 07:34:44'),
