  ('zcrm_1579374000016515013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '5-2-18 Wants to set up Welcome Call to complete health assessment, etc. I sent her the email. She also has more work that came in unexpectedly and plans to delay on-boarding process for AR.  She might do it later when life settles down.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-02 11:46:49', '2018-05-02 11:46:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016515008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165427', 'Melissa Mitchell', NULL, '5-2-18 Approved for STM with IHC and now working on CHP+ for kids. Made about $39K in past. Expecting $45K or so. Just had baby in September and doesn''t see doctor for anything other than annual visits. Zip 80022. At $48L APTC is $435.38. They''ve always had Kaiser but now prefer alternative doctors.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-02 11:43:36', '2018-06-11 16:11:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016511022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881395', 'Elaine Rampone', NULL, 'Elaine called in  today because she thinks that a few major issues happened because of her stress,  3 seperate legions on her skin,  and that her something was "wrong" with her endocrine system. and needed to see her OBGYN.  She also wanted to see a primary DR so I did a lookup while we were on the phone, -the Dr that she wanted is not in the system but the medical director is. - Elaine called back to say that the strange looking lesions were-in fact- chocolate from a kind bar that had dried on her stomach during her red eye flight.  what a sense of humor!  I helped her on multiplan find a primary Dr.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-02 11:32:52', '2018-05-02 11:32:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016515003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243567', 'Tanya Dueri', NULL, '5-2-18 Has been self-employed for long time in past. Just recently got laid off from job and looked at C4 options that weren''t good. She has depression and takes meds and has Celliac Disease but not diagnosed with endoscopy. So, might not be accurately diagnosed. She has stopped eating gluten all together. Already has an HSA. She''s 43. Wants to look it over and will get back to me when ready to enroll. Knows the deadlines.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-02 11:17:56', '2018-05-02 11:17:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016501018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015937096', 'Ramon Pinela', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-05-02 11:15:19', '2018-05-02 11:15:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016511008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, 'Tania called in because she got a nail in her eye and needed to go to the emergency room and see a specialist, I asked how much her bills were and she said around 1600 I gave her Sedera''s member services number and told her to feel better.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-02 11:13:20', '2018-05-02 11:13:20'),
