  ('zcrm_1579374000016469013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005553209', 'Brenda Legel', NULL, 'Kelly from Libertyhealth called me to say that this client called them to say that our phone number wasn''t any good, so Liberty called to see if there was any issue with 1-800-519-2969 and got a hold of me right away.  I was asked to reach out to this client, which I did and left a message on her machine. Liberty told me that she was trying to get ahold of us to cancel.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-02 08:48:30', '2018-05-02 08:48:30'),
