  ('zcrm_1579374000016469003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752067', 'Michael Brown', NULL, 'Linda called in today to let me know that Michael received a bad injury to his hand, and now it is very painful and swollen, so she wanted to know what the next steps would be.  I told her because his hand was so swollen and painful and feels broken that they should go to an urgent care- I gave Sedera''s phone number to call when the bill is close to or is over their initial unshared amount.  -say that they are self paying patients, pay with HSA card, and get detailed medical bills to submit.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-02 07:26:34', '2018-05-02 07:26:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016415116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014539053', 'Daryl Mackie', NULL, 'Heather called in tonight to find out how to go about seeing a provider that is out of network, I told her about how they would need to pay in full and submit the bill themselves. -I also told her where to go to nominate her own provider to be on the network.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-01 14:39:42', '2018-05-01 14:39:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016415111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'First attempt to call Ellie and let her know that her Nuvaring reimbursement is to go through ASI shortly. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-01 14:32:35', '2018-05-01 14:32:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016415106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899362', 'Joe Dan Higgins', NULL, 'Joe Dan gave a call in to make sure that he has completed and set up everything that is needed as he goes forward in the plan, I sent a link to mpoweringbenefits.com site and told him about the checklist we made for him.- Joe says that he is very happy with our company!- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-01 13:02:17', '2018-05-01 13:02:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016418011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012064120', 'Robert Land', NULL, '5-1-2018  Spoke to Bob today.  I discussed the new Broker Program vs. him getting paid $100 for non-personal referrals.  His leads are his clients.  We will pay the $100 referral fee for Dr. Michael Hicks.  After that I''m hoping we will agree to the new program paying residual $10/per mo.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-05-01 12:44:19', '2018-05-01 12:44:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016415101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016721056', 'Susan Crocker', NULL, '5-1-18 Susan 61 and Dave 63. Were on ACA paying $214 month but got inheritance and full priced plan will cost $1500 month and they don''t want to have to pay back that money at end of year. Sort of healthy. Dave has Addison''s Disease for last 22 years and well managed by meds with prednisone and flourinef ($79 for 3 months). Pays out of pocket for both. Susan had frozen should back in 2015 and not sure exact date then issue resolved. She''ll look at records for pre-x. Both recognize the pre-x clause and risks involved if move forward. Also Susan is or was an accountant of sorts and was wanting to see MEC+ paperwork but less concerned since Tom and Beth received the 1095 form for tax purposes. She knows that''s what''s needed. Working on getting our new MEC+ plan docs.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-05-01 12:41:02', '2018-05-01 12:41:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016423021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899120', 'Candi Broeffle', NULL, 'Member called in a spoke to Jennie expressed that her husband had started on Medicare and wanted to cancel him effective 5/1.  Also they have quit tobacco 1 yr ago I have a question into Elizabeth about this.  I will let Elizabeth know and change FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-05-01 12:06:24', '2018-05-01 12:06:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016415093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497127', 'Carol Walker', NULL, 'non stop laughing at me when I wouldn''t tell her what bloodwork would be covered by ASI- in fact she paused from laughing to tell me " I am laughing at you because this is no help at all" rude woman- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-01 11:48:56', '2018-05-01 11:48:56'),
