  ('zcrm_1579374000016396013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919872', 'Hilary Schofield', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-05-01 08:15:10', '2018-05-01 08:15:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016396008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809076', 'Phil McGee', NULL, 'Phil called in today to see if we would negotiate a bill down for his wife''s asthma visit, his wife''s asthma is pre-existing,  the bill was $315 rather than the $150-ish quote that they had given over the phone.  I explained to him the differences between a pre-existing condition which is his responsibility, and a need that Sedera would jump in and help with after he would meet his IUA.-he understood by the end of the phone call, very nice.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-01 08:14:17', '2018-05-01 08:14:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016400008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017078004', 'Jason Scheier', NULL, 'Emp Only $500 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-05-01 08:12:14', '2018-05-01 08:12:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016400003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610129', 'Bethany Stoll', NULL, 'left message', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-05-01 07:58:55', '2018-05-01 07:58:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016396003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'Ellie called in last night before close and wanted to know where her OBGYN could send the letter that the NUVAring was medically necessary.  She was at the appointment with her Dr asking questions while on the phone with me, I told her that she needed to contact ASI, because it would be them that would make the final decision and pay for the NUVAring in the end.  She sounded very anxious, The Dr in the background was upset that I could not provide a fax number. I reiterated that she needs to call ASI- I gave her their phone number. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-05-01 07:19:00', '2018-05-01 07:19:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016338141', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411228', 'Emily McGill', NULL, '4-30-18 Enrolling right now. Choosing to use cc so no chance of overdrawing account bc doesn''t leave much money in there. Knows of the $15 mo. fee. June 1st start date. I think she chose $249/$1000. Completed application in 20 mins. Super easy and she''s excited. Told her to schedule welcome call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-30 15:07:29', '2018-04-30 15:23:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016338136', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016570002', 'Michael Wisner', NULL, '4-30-18 Super healthy, just wants acyclovir w/o needing to visit Dr. to get prescription. Wondering if he can get it through Teledoc. He travels internationally a lot. Has been getting ex-pat insurance at $150-$200 or so per month plus a supplemental option. He''s 54 and earns $40K+. He''s an artist of some sort. We''re going to enroll him on Wednesday for June 1st start and IHC for 1 month for May. He''s applying for that today.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-30 14:10:52', '2018-04-30 14:10:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016349033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014189229', 'Gemma Lynn Davis', NULL, 'Gemma called because she wanted help registering for Teladoc- I talked her through the process.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-30 13:43:28', '2018-04-30 13:43:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016349028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005039', 'Ryan Richards', NULL, 'Ryan called to make sure that his plan would be effective by midnight tonight because he is cancelling his old plan. I told him that he was all set, and told him to schedule a welcome call sooner rather than later.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-30 12:31:41', '2018-04-30 12:31:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016338131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291620', 'Natalia Guidi', NULL, '4-13-18 Super sweet! She didn''t understand what HES was for and wished she had understood since it took her 7 months to get reimbursed from LHS. She is fed up with them and was planning to cancel come Jan. 1st. I explained HEP with Sedera and she''s very excited about it and wants to sign up once she reads the materials I just sent. She''ll call me when she''s read through it. I''ll walk her through the application process. I need to mention the $50 set up fee and the $100 will be waived. She felt like LHS was a scam since she was put on hold for many hours.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-30 11:58:55', '2018-04-30 11:58:55'),
