  ('zcrm_1579374000016294018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028354134', 'Mary Geitner', NULL, '4-27-18 Came to 4/10/18 WWW and wasn''t available for April Money 101. But, wants to come to next WWW and bring husband to next Money 101. Available in May and not in June. Fall will become more calm. She''s also interested in learning how to create income with 5 Rings. She''s open to meeting with Trevor and I one on one after she goes to Money 101. She has a financial advisor with Wells Fargo and is learning and shopping around but didn''t want conflict of interest and wants to be up front. I told her it''s best to learn and that I too have my money invested with MS And with our products as it''s best to diversify. Not a conflict of interest, just smart to become educated and they don''t have same knowledge of what we offer. Their offerings are different. She''s super appreciative. She might come with Jill again to www or bring another friend.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-27 16:35:03', '2018-04-27 16:35:03'),
