  ('zcrm_1579374000016294013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018505034', 'Mary Sundblom', NULL, '4-27-18 Chose IHC for month of May. Was on Medicaid 3-4 yrs. Went to massage school and is now earning too much. Guessing $40K-$45K in 2018. Is going to AK to practice for a few months. Traveling to HI first and then will be in SLC. No ins. now. Healthy. Lives in Carbondale near Matt Ross and remembered his post on FB from months ago! No tobacco. Thinks she''ll chose the $500/$299 option but not certain. We have appt set for upon return from her travels to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-27 15:35:06', '2018-04-27 15:35:06'),
