  ('zcrm_1579374000016294003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411228', 'Emily McGill', NULL, '4-27-18 Lives in NY and was working for a PR/Ad Agency 6 weeks ago and Cobra was going to cost her $800+! She chose not to use it and is w/o ins. right now. She got an offer from Disney for part-time work through end of September but isn''t sure she''ll have enough hours to qualify for their benes. She likes what we have! Healthy, no pre-x. Had stomach ulcers 10 years ago and those were dealt with w/ meds and has been fine shortly thereafter. No problems. She was recently given medication for excema from Dermatologist and knows she''ll have to pay for those meds. Used to have an HSA with former employer also and likes that. She wants to be fully self employed soon. She''s 32 turning 33 this summer. She will enroll with me on Monday 4/30/18.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-27 14:33:29', '2018-04-27 14:33:29'),
