  ('zcrm_1579374000016226003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243389', 'Edward Seymour', NULL, '4-26-18 Ed is 59 and wife is 55, son is turning 18 in May and going off to college to TX A&M. About to graduate from HS in OR and family moving to townhome in Austin at that point. Son takes myorisan at 40mg 2x daily and it''s $312 w/ ins and can be $1200 otherwise. I found it for about $320 for 60 tablets online. Asking Reid next. Ed''s paying $400+ for his own UHC plan and more for wife and son but not sure how much. He''s tired of traditional insurance and sees dr. not practicing bc of how bad it is. Likes this concept. Will want a June 1st start with TX address. Healthy other than sons acne.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-26 15:40:59', '2018-04-26 15:40:59'),
