  ('zcrm_1579374000016162028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990381', 'Elena Garet', NULL, 'I spoke with Elena about the meds she wanted to be priced out, she told me that they were for her sister and she wanted to show her that she didn''t need traditional insurance to get her meds at a fair price.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-25 12:39:16', '2018-04-25 12:39:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016161028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191470', 'Deborah Wickham', NULL, 'This member called in on 4/20 and let me know that she had requested cancellation back in 6/17 and that had never been done.  I looked into this and found out frm John that this request had never made it to me.  I was able to refund 4 mos ($200) frm Subcriptions.  I will send out remaining $350 via check to her.  Check #1051 AHE acct.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-04-25 12:13:56', '2018-04-25 12:13:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016161023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004801452', 'Roberta Carney', NULL, 'Member called in to cancel.  Cancelled LHS as well', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-04-25 12:01:44', '2018-04-25 12:01:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016161018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521614', 'Eleonora Steinberg', NULL, 'Member called in requesting to remove her daughter from plan.  I sent out Member Change Link and advised her of effective date.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-04-25 11:54:11', '2018-04-25 11:54:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016161013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176205', 'Moises Lopez', NULL, 'Hi,

   Patty, thank you for answering my call. I am very disappointed and dissatisfied with your customer service representatives. (NOT YOU SPECIFICALLY)... I''ve been told I had to have this membership before, and that it was part of the plan to best exercise my Liberty Health Shared Plan Health Insurance.

   Your company has previously told me that your company is the one to call so if I was in need of using the Liberty Health Coverage to make them pay up since they''re not very responding on paying members dues when needed. I''ve heard from your company that Liberty Health is no good in customer service and ignores taking care of their clients, and that your company "highly" recommends to keep you active on my account to push them to pay up.

As of now, I want my My Academy of HealthExcellence membership to be IMMEDIATELY CANCELLED, and no longer billed.

Please cancel my account today. If I have any problems moving forward, I will forward all the information I have to the Arizona Department of Insurance...

Thank you!
-- 
Moises Lopez
602-758-9014', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-04-25 11:39:21', '2018-04-25 11:39:21'),
