  ('zcrm_1579374000016158003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659195', 'Jennifer Lederer', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-25 07:52:51', '2018-04-25 07:52:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016140008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497127', 'Carol Walker', NULL, 'Carol called in saying that she has had diarrhea for two and a half weeks and that she is very tired, that she went to her chiropracter and he said it may be parasites.  I told her that she could try to find a gastro Dr and that they could do the testing. Then she said that she didn''t want to go to a specialist, maybe an urgent care.  Maybe Teledoc- I told her that would be fine, that it was a great idea- so, she said that she would call Teledoc and I offered to price out medications for her.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-24 14:46:24', '2018-04-24 14:46:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016135008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006420111', 'Elizabeth Young', NULL, 'This email is to request cancellation of our policy. We have canceled our membership with liberty health share as of March 1st, 2018 and would like to cancel our membership with my health excellence as well. If you have any questions my contact number is 321-277-2719.
Thank you,
Elizabeth Young', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-04-24 14:09:36', '2018-04-24 14:09:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016115056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243146', 'Patricia Lekawa', NULL, '4-24-18  Returned a call from Pat.  Was on the phone for more than 1 hr because he was an insurance agent and wanted me to explain why his wife, age 61, should choose medical cost sharing, the stability of MCS and if Sedera would cover her at her age if she pop up with a cancer or some other major health issue.  He was a little argumentative about MCS.  I think I got him settled down and he wants to think about it further and talk to his wife.   I sent him the 1st approach letter and will follow-up with him in a couple days.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-04-24 11:42:26', '2018-04-24 11:42:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016139008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899434', 'Courtney Herzog', NULL, 'Called,  mailbox was full, reschedule email sent', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-04-24 11:33:52', '2018-04-24 11:33:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016140003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007637033', 'Nancy Elgie', NULL, 'Nancy called in today because she believes she injured her knee at the gym, - so she asked about the process, I told her to keep detailed medical receipts so that if need be when she is about to hit her IUA  she can just give Sedera a call let them know what is going on and give them the medical receipts at that time. $500 IUA.. I quickly went over 2nd MD as well.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-24 11:18:54', '2018-04-24 11:18:54'),
