  ('zcrm_1579374000016115051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016132018', 'Robert Campbell', NULL, '4-24-18  Due to a bad email address I was unable to send him information about HSA Bank.  I corrected his email and sent him the information today.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-04-24 08:37:45', '2018-04-24 08:37:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016115046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016132018', 'Robert Campbell', NULL, '4-24-18   Spoke to Robert to follow-up regarding his enrollment issue.   Sedera sent him an email to provide the additional dependent to his application.  Patti said she believes it all look fine at this point.  Robert also realized he inverted his banking information into the wrong fields and went on-line and fixed.  Patty confirmed he knows there will be an immediate $936 charge to his bank account and Robert confirmed yes via phone.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-04-24 08:36:45', '2018-04-24 08:36:45'),
