  ('zcrm_1579374000016115041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243146', 'Patricia Lekawa', NULL, '4-23-18  I called Pat back at 7:30 and got his voice mail.  I will attempt to reach him tomorrow again.  A task reminder has been set.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-04-23 17:45:21', '2018-04-23 17:45:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016115036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243146', 'Patricia Lekawa', NULL, '4-23-18  Pat did call back today but I was on another call and he left me a message to call him.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-04-23 17:44:24', '2018-04-23 17:44:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016115031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243146', 'Patricia Lekawa', NULL, '4-23-18  Received inbound call today from Pat Lekawa.  He is on Medicare and was calling on behalf of his wife Pat.  I was in the middle of presenting our plan and the phone once went dead in the middle of the call cutting us of.  I immediately called him back but no answer so I left a message for him  to call back at his earliest convenience.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-04-23 17:43:42', '2018-04-23 17:43:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016115018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016132018', 'Robert Campbell', NULL, '4-23-18  Spoke to Robert and stayed with him through the enrollment process.  We completed the MPB enrollment and he got half way through the Sedera and he got hung in the system.  We called Sedera for assistance the woman who answered attempted to fix the issue also had difficulties and told Robert someone from Sedera will call him back tomorrow morning.  The two individuals were in a meeting that could help with this situation was in a conference meeting.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-04-23 15:17:49', '2018-04-23 17:13:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016107076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521039', 'John Castolene', NULL, 'Client called in very very anxious because a tick bit him and he felt like his situation was urgent.  He said that he had been calling all day without any help. I apologized and tried to calm him down as I sent Teladoc registration as well as guided him to the website. I assured him that he would speak with a doctor and that the doctor would let him know if it would be in his best interest to either go to an urgent care or the emergency room, but suggested that he give Teladoc a try. I told him to keep us in the loop as to what''s happening.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-23 14:28:34', '2018-04-23 14:28:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016115013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016132018', 'Robert Campbell', NULL, '4-23-18  Called Robert, he wanted more information and said he was interested in enrolling.  His health insurance was ending at the end of this month.  I ask Patti if he enrolled today could we put him through.  She agreed to allow it.    I spent some time going over our program, took him to our website to show him around.  He schedule with me to enroll around 4-5 pm today.   I sent him the 1st approach letter and HSA Bank information.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-04-23 13:44:49', '2018-04-23 13:44:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016107071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003468031', 'Timothy Virkkala', NULL, 'Timothy called in to ask about how he could find the best prices on lab work- I was going to price out labs on directlabs.com, but Tim stopped himself to say that I probably need the actual blood test name, and laughed and said he would call me back.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-23 12:35:29', '2018-04-23 12:35:29'),
