  ('zcrm_1579374000016086108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006723029', 'Leah Sparks', NULL, '04.23.18:  Called Leah. Explained change-over to HEP. She is interested - needs health insurance for her daughter. Said she was paying $150 + $50 for Kelly with HES. Asked if this is more expensive.  Said I would let her know when new HEP info. is available.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-04-23 10:49:53', '2018-04-23 10:49:53'),
