  ('zcrm_1579374000016121028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857102', 'Kimi Mischke', NULL, 'Spoke with Kimi on 4/20 and she told me that her ASi card said Emp &amp; Sp not Emp &amp; Fam.  Researched the spreadsheet that was sent to ASi and her children were missed.  Caleb back dating their enrollment to 12/1 and will send out new cards', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-04-23 09:57:46', '2018-04-23 09:57:46'),
