  ('zcrm_1579374000016107031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015937219', 'Abigail McMurray', NULL, 'Abigail called in because she is new to our plan and just giving up mainstream insurance. She said she is very anxious but I talked her through some things and feels a bit better about the process.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-20 13:52:23', '2018-04-20 13:52:23'),
