  ('zcrm_1579374000016107021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330097', 'Craig Nelson', NULL, 'Craig gave me a call back about the immunizations that he wants to get before his family travels to India, he knows he needs to schedule a welcome call, simply to understand a bit more, but he wanted to tell me how happy he was with the program thus far. I sent a provider list so that he may find a Dr from there and I also said that there were a few vaccines that ASI covers.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-20 12:52:00', '2018-04-20 12:52:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016107016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004771011', 'Karen Baker', NULL, 'Karen called because she has some huge bills that needed to be submitted and she doesn''t know where to start.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-20 11:54:21', '2018-04-20 11:54:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016107008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005654049', 'Kathy Price', NULL, 'called in to get the name and number of the "health track coach" as well as to say that her husband''s back has been deteriorating over this past year and she didn''t know where to start as far as helping him out.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-20 11:49:00', '2018-04-20 11:52:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016086053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'We will contact Sedera in regards to medical tourism and follow up with the member. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-20 11:23:50', '2018-04-20 11:23:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016086048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member travels international often asked if process is the same when going to a doctor  I said yes just bills need to be in English. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-20 10:57:05', '2018-04-20 10:57:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016107003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'Marc called stating that he was enrolling all 3 of his kids into summer camp and that they want them all to have insurance cards as well as prescription cards, I told him that I would need to ask someone about that. I spoke with Patti and she said that the only card he can give is the MEC card, that there was nothing he could give besides explaining the rest of the program. Client was unhappy with that answer, and said I was wasting his time and that he wanted us to "make up" a prescription card and insurance card.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-20 10:43:43', '2018-04-20 10:43:43'),
