  ('zcrm_1579374000016029028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009790025', 'Rosalynde smith', NULL, 'Rosalynd called and stated that her child''s school was giving her a hard time about proof of health insurance so she wanted to help me find an e-mail with some sort of contract or agreement that she could send to the school. So I found an e-mail with a contract signed back in January sent from Patti, and I just forwarded it back to Rosalynde. She was happy for all of the help.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-18 15:02:22', '2018-04-18 15:02:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016049023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011307015', 'Kathryn Clemen', NULL, 'Received check for referral back I f/u w/ Laura and she gave me her new address I updated.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-04-18 14:38:26', '2018-04-18 14:38:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016029023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881563', 'Juan Tapia', NULL, 'Juan called today to find out the process behind going to his doctor for an annual physical,  very nice man, spanish speaking family, I went through the process verbally as well as guiding him on the computer-showed him where to nominate his doctor. Does not have an ASI card- only MPowering Benefits, John is now making sure that he is sent a temporary one first followed by the actual plastic card.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-18 14:09:36', '2018-04-18 14:09:36'),
