  ('zcrm_1579374000016049008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038124', 'Isabelle Laak', NULL, 'The CC info that this member gave us is invalid.  I followed up with her and she will be supplying Bank info tomorrow.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-04-18 13:29:47', '2018-04-18 13:29:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016029018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508227', 'Debra Heap', NULL, 'Debra called back to see if ASI would cover a 3D ultrasound- I told her that she is free to call and ask and see what they say, but that it would be only if it were Dr scripted, and usually when it is it falls out of the annual/preventative care umbrella. She will go ahead and call ASI to check, other that, she said she was very happy with all of the help we gave her today.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-18 13:26:10', '2018-04-18 13:26:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016029013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012223122', 'Elizabeth Daly', NULL, 'Elizabeth Daley called because she wanted to find a ENT for her daughter, whom she said was already on medication and that at one point needed sinus surgery, also one doctor said it was due to mold and fungus and that she had lyme disease, but not anymore- that was or is the pre-existing condition.  As you can tell this got confusing and in the end after offering that she use Teladoc and her refusals I told her to give Sedera a call and let them know what was going on, so that they can figure out- what is pre-existing and what is not for billing. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-18 13:13:32', '2018-04-18 13:13:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016049003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038124', 'Isabelle Laak', NULL, 'Emp Only $1000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-04-18 13:09:40', '2018-04-18 13:09:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016029008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014658118', 'Gillian Ahouanvoheke', NULL, 'Gillian called in, apparently she never got the coupon texted to her so I went ahead and e-mailed it to her so that she can print it out and bring it to her pharmacy.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-18 12:58:51', '2018-04-18 12:58:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016029003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, 'Christine called in today and I walked her through purchasing the bloodwork panels that I helped find her.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-18 11:58:27', '2018-04-18 11:58:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016006018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508227', 'Debra Heap', NULL, 'Debra had just spoken to Liz on a welcome call but called back because she had a question about setting up a mammograph for herself- she said that she found the facility in the link that we sent, I told her to go ahead, give them a call to make sure that they took her asi card, and that no, she should not be paying anything out of pocket if it falls beneath a preventative screen.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-18 11:42:07', '2018-04-18 11:42:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016013048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659160', 'Alicia Venegas', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-18 11:19:49', '2018-04-18 11:19:49'),
