  ('zcrm_1579374000016013038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752164', 'Q. Patrick Coleman', NULL, 'Spoke to member he said he had his welcome call in Jan. He had no further questions or concerns. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-18 10:58:02', '2018-04-18 10:58:02'),
