  ('zcrm_1579374000016006008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659360', 'Rachel Brenneman', NULL, 'my response via Skipio-Hello again, I just spoke with John and he recommends that you call Sedera at-(855) 973-3372 as soon as you can, to go over your injury, and now your physical therapy. And then we can help you with submitting the bills. Please continue to make sure that you are asking for the detailed medical bills. -Kelly', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-18 09:58:20', '2018-04-18 09:58:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016013008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779401', 'Kathleen Wilger', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-18 09:52:36', '2018-04-18 09:52:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016013003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779401', 'Kathleen Wilger', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-18 09:52:16', '2018-04-18 09:52:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016010003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005005', 'Sarah Stoke', NULL, 'Emp &amp; Fam $500 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-04-18 09:51:00', '2018-04-18 09:51:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000016006003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881351', 'Ronald Stear', NULL, 'Maria called  in this morning to ask how she can submit her child''s annual wellness bill into Sedera for processing- I made sure that she understood that it would need to be submitted through ASI and not Sedera, I asked if she had a welcome call already and she said she did (lots of crying kids and babies in background) I told her that mpoweringbenefits.com had a wealth of information if she needed and that she could call to ask anything anytime.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-18 09:43:43', '2018-04-18 09:43:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015988053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011910001', 'John Singleton', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-18 09:16:37', '2018-04-18 09:16:37'),
