  ('zcrm_1579374000015984008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014658118', 'Gillian Ahouanvoheke', NULL, 'Gillian called in today because her 4 year old son was sent home from daycare due to his eye''s being weepy, a soar throat and a mild fever.  I told her to go ahead and register and use Teledoc, I sent out all forms. I told her to call me with the prescription information and name of pharmacy so I can send along coupons to her phone. -note-I told her if she felt it necessary to go ahead and go to Urgent care or ER, but that the Teladoc Dr would let her know if they find it necessary.-I also told her that when her child is better and she has a few minutes to schedule a welcome call.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-18 08:50:16', '2018-04-18 08:50:16'),
