  ('zcrm_1579374000015988003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610459', 'Michelle Pouliot', NULL, 'Spoke to member she will book online the 15 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-18 08:11:56', '2018-04-18 08:11:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015984003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191463', 'Melvin Roberts', NULL, 'Melvin called in to ask about where the cheapest place to get bloodwork is,  through his doctors office it was going to be about $600 and that the quest office that is apparently "connected" to his Dr''s office will not submit the bill to Liberty directly, and that he and his wife do not have the money for both of them to get that price of bloodwork. He needed a yearly panel that that included a lipid panel as well as a blood pressure medication check, and he said that his wife will need a yearly panel w/ blood sugar testing. He doesn''t need the blood work done right away-not until September, but he is trying to be proactive about it. He asked what blood work site we used and I told him it was directlabs.com, he couldn''t understand his doctors handwriting and therefor could not look up what the bloodwork actually cost.   He is going to go to his doctors office so that they can spell it all out for him and then he will call me with the info.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-18 07:50:35', '2018-04-18 07:50:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015967003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011307015', 'Kathryn Clemen', NULL, 'Called and left a VM. Reschedule email sent. Elizabeth Bradshaw.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-04-18 04:18:58', '2018-04-18 04:20:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015948078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038124', 'Isabelle Laak', NULL, '4-17-18 Enrolling now $1000/$249 and loves this concept. Doesn''t understand why everyone doesn''t do this. Her employer did not want to do this but she tried. She will add her husband once his knee is healed. It''s a bone bruise and she wants to make sure it''s healed first.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-17 14:25:33', '2018-04-17 14:25:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015942020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001837009', 'Andrea Hinman', NULL, 'Andrea called in because she had a Dr''s visit in February that included blood work, she ended up receiving a bill for the blood work and is having a hard time figuring out why. I explained that there might have possibly been a diagnostic code or something just outside the "realm" of preventative care.  I gave her ASI''s phone number. Also Andrea stated that the medical bills that came back say things like "just outside her coverage" exc. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-17 13:47:24', '2018-04-17 13:47:24'),
