  ('zcrm_1579374000015948018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497204', 'Charles Strother', NULL, 'Welcome call complete by Sedera.', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-17 08:41:30', '2018-04-17 08:41:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015942010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233227', 'Nory Oakes', NULL, 'Nory hurt her back last week and this past weekend went to the chiropractor,  she is better now, but she wanted to know how to report such bills if they ever get to the IUA to Sedera. I told her to just hold on to the bills and if anything extra needs to happen, her Dr needs to come up with a chiro plan for Sedera.   She asked if it would be ok to submit psychiatric bills as a need, and I told her that it was unsharable. I did mention the counseling that Sedera offered.  She had questions about what Sedera would cover as far as psych hospitalization and I told her to call Sedera. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-17 08:40:58', '2018-04-17 08:40:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015948013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508059', 'Marla Ratcliff', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-17 08:36:18', '2018-04-17 08:36:18'),
