  ('zcrm_1579374000015942003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919089', 'Nancy Hoglund', NULL, 'Nancy called to speak to John about follow up questions she had about Health Share. - activity made.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-17 07:15:29', '2018-04-17 07:15:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015920003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675121', 'Anthony Silva', NULL, 'member did not have access to a computer during the welcome call', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-04-16 18:09:53', '2018-04-16 18:09:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015918003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015937096', 'Ramon Pinela', NULL, '4-16-18 Referred by his employer Marie-Christine Carel. She will help pay for it tomorrow when we apply and provide him a computer to do so. A female in background helped him to understand what I was explaining. He has slightly high cholesterol and was recently prescribed meds 2 weeks ago. He also has too high sugar as he calls it. I asked him if he''s borderline diabetic and he didn''t know. But, he''s on meds for this just every 3 days or so. They are recommending he changes his diet and exercises more. He''s not changing his behavior. No tobacco, no drinking. He used to get a subsidy but earned too much and has to pay almost $6K back to gov so cancelled his plan this year. Was paying $250 and went up to $500+. He''ll read over information and we''ll enroll tomorrow morning.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-16 17:38:46', '2018-04-16 17:38:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015916013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740251', 'Evan Altman', NULL, 'Member and spouse need an ASI card and requested two Mpowering Benefits cards. New codes logged in', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-04-16 14:39:04', '2018-04-16 14:39:04'),
