  ('zcrm_1579374000015916003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007248065', 'Richard Cornell', NULL, 'Dear Mr. Cornell,

I apologize for the lapse in cancellation for your subscription.  I have cancelled your membership and you should not be receiving any other notices regarding this. 

