1-855-816-4650 ext 504


From: R T Cornell <gxwcentral-shop@yahoo.com> 
Sent: Saturday, April 14, 2018 2:52 PM
To: Billing and Accounts <message-service@sender.zohosubscriptions.com>; admin@myahe.org
Subject: Re: Health Excellence Select subscription has been cancelled

Dear Billing and Accounts,

I have attempted to cancel this account for several months now as I am covered with Medicaid since November of last year. However, for some reason, the cancellation has not been processed. I am experiencing financial difficulties and am receiving both Medicaid and food stamps. But I don''t see this as longterm and will be interested in your coverage at another time in the hopeful near future, once my financial situation improves. However, the fact that it is taking nearly six months to cancel this service does concern me.

Thank you,
Richard Cornell', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-04-16 12:54:42', '2018-04-16 12:54:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015910018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, 'Kallie called in today to get some help finding a facility that accepts her ASI card for a preventative mammogram,  I went onto the network with her and we found many facilities, but she was wondering about going to one that was out of network, I told her that she could, that she had to pay for everything up front get a detailed medical bill and submit it herself. I also reminded her that when she makes an appointment to tell the person over the phone that it is through the phcs network- that is what they will recognize for billing. I told her to keep us in the loop with all that is going on. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-16 11:59:31', '2018-04-16 11:59:31'),
