  ('zcrm_1579374000015910013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, 'Joy called back and told me that Dr Emma Mccarty''s receptionist told her that she would have to be a self paid patient and submit whatever bill she is to get herself. I called Joy back after speaking with John and she told me she didn''t get the name of the person she spoke with earlier.  I told her to tell me what she told them about her policy over the phone. I told her to call back and tell them that she was in the PHCS network. Kinda cranky, but I told her it''s a learning curve and not to worry about it, we are here to guide her through. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-16 10:10:13', '2018-04-16 10:10:13'),
