  ('zcrm_1579374000015893003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809121', 'Annette Wolf', NULL, 'Annette left a message with Back office Bettie''s  about help finding an internal medicine doctor.  She said she could not find any doctor that would take her because she is self-paying and that there is a shortage of doctors. I went to the multi plan network with her after I sent a newer provider e-mail out. she had some confusion but I just let her yell about it and tried to calm her down until she felt better and I made sure that all of her questions had answered. we found dozens of internal medicine doctors in her area- we even found one that specialized in sleep- happy client- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-13 14:32:13', '2018-04-13 14:32:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015891003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508164', 'Kerri Wade', NULL, 'Member updated address via change survey', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-04-13 14:07:33', '2018-04-13 14:07:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015858003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005137', 'Katie Irvine', NULL, '4-13-18 Katie completed her application just now and it was super easy. She chose the $1000/$485 for her and husband. Super healthy, no pre-x to report. Checked on the fact that they go by states laws for drug question. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-13 11:29:02', '2018-04-13 11:29:02'),
