  ('zcrm_1579374000015749003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659360', 'Rachel Brenneman', NULL, 'Spoke to Rachel.  Gave her bad news..... ASI doesn''t have bill,need to resubmit.  She has to get a copy from the doc (she sent original) and send it to me.  I''ll submit to Kareen.  Did GoTo Meeting to instruct on bill submission.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-04-12 08:46:11', '2018-04-12 08:46:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015732008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004086010', 'Paul Blakeslee', NULL, 'Paul called this morning saying that he just cancelled with Liberty last month and that it was a shock to him when he received a $50 charge on the 5th- he would like a refund. I told him that Patti would give him a call in the next hour.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-12 08:12:17', '2018-04-12 08:12:17'),
