  ('zcrm_1579374000015714023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165429', 'Jodie Brenner', NULL, 'Jodie called in today to first- update her payment info, and second- possibly cancel. I guided her to the mpoweringbenefits website to member services and showed  her the different forms she could use. She said that she didn''t know if she wanted to cancel yet or not. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-11 14:39:45', '2018-04-11 14:39:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015714018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001950031', 'Eric Nehls', NULL, 'Eric called today, he wants John to speak to him concerning Liberty bills that were sent through in January, that Liberty is withholding $1,000 instead of $200 from the precious years balance.  I told Eric that John was in a phone meeting and asked if he would leave a message he scoffed, and asked if he could just use John''t voicmail, I paused and then "c''mon that was an easy enough answer for you, you should''ve known how to answer" to which I answered, "no I was just thinking how I normally do not disturb John when he''s on the phone, especially when he is on a phone meeting." 
John to follow up-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-11 13:28:42', '2018-04-11 13:28:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015714013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533005', 'Brian Mirsky', NULL, 'Brian will be have neck surgery in about 2 weeks time, after he see''s his primary, bld work done and surgery booked at Boca East. I told him to call the pre-authorization  number on his Liberty card, let them know all the medical history and what is ahead as far as Surgeon and facility. Brian said that his Doctors office was going to call Liberty- I said that he should as well and let them take it from there.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-11 13:16:17', '2018-04-11 13:16:17'),
