  ('zcrm_1579374000015716008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636885', 'Richard Wennerstrand', NULL, 'Member called in after hours and left VM.  I returned the call and he told me after reconciling his books he was being charged $50 that he was not aware of.  I explained, however still wants to cancel.  I emailed him so he could reply with letter of cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-04-11 10:32:44', '2018-06-19 08:12:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015703053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044571112', 'Cheryl Claman-Brennan', NULL, '4-11-18 She has Shingles but she pays for everything out of pocket already. Pays for all alternative type treatments such as acupuncture and her chronic pain Dr. is out of network and pays all meds on own. She just wants to be protected in case of something new and is paying $626 a month but later said $725 a month through UHC. Not sure which one is right but both are terrible. $5K ded and all. She has an HSA already and funds it. She has assets from her dad passing away but doesn''t want to tap into that in case something bad happens. I should share with her Living Benefits also. Takes pain meds every day which she pays for on own and is fine paying for. Will likely do a June 1st start date since going to OR ''til 20th. Told her I''m gone ''til 24th. Likes to meet in person but might be able to encourage phone chat since work from home.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-11 10:25:24', '2018-04-11 10:25:24'),
