  ('zcrm_1579374000015656043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001196081', 'Kate Hamilton', NULL, '4-20-18 Use 94110 and $70K. Robin recommends only BC/BS for her clients. Kate is moving from CO to CA in the next few months. She needs some surgery and is trying to determine if best to do it here or in CA. I sent her samples of BS plans PPO Silver and Gold per her request. Bronze won''t be sufficient and Platinum probably excessive and crazy expensive. Robin thinks I can be paid by BS but at 1.4% of premium. So, she feels it''s not worth it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-10 15:39:31', '2018-04-10 15:39:31'),
