  ('zcrm_1579374000015645018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919914', 'Tracy Sutton', NULL, 'Tracy called in with a sore throat and not feeling well, she said she was a newbie having to use any of MPowering Benefits resources.  I recommended Teladoc, I helped her register for it and told her to give me a call before she goes to the pharmacy so I can find a coupon for the meds and send it to her phone.  Client was happy for all the help.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-10 09:17:13', '2018-04-10 09:17:13'),
