  ('zcrm_1579374000015645013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521039', 'John Castolene', NULL, 'John called this morning to have me schedule his welcome call, he couldn''t figure out how to do it on his end. it is for 4/11 @3:00- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-10 08:22:09', '2018-04-10 08:22:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015645008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'Towards the end of day yesterday Ellie gave me a call to ask if I had found any discounted prices on the Nuvaring- I ended up sending her a coupon to go to Costco because she already had an account there- I called goodrx to see if by "one ring" they meant one box- they told me no that it didn''t- the price would be for one ring- I also helped her out by calling Costco to verify the price. She was emotional but thankful for all of the help throughout the day from us.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-10 07:33:07', '2018-04-10 07:33:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015645003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, 'ASA is transferring to APEX Management. He saw an out of network doctor and would like to know where to send information. She wants information on what Out of Network means. NOTE: She will be unavailable until 5 PM your time. -copied from ticket-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-10 07:21:54', '2018-04-10 07:21:54'),
