  ('zcrm_1579374000015591045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012223122', 'Elizabeth Daly', NULL, '4-9-18 She cancelled her DPC membership with Dr. Tusek for all family members except one family member. She''s planning to cancel son for May 1st. Has his annual wellness visit tomorrow and told her to use the new Apex membership card for tomorrow''s membership. She will. John and Patti will sort out what to do for May and let me know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-09 13:18:02', '2018-04-09 13:58:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015560120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'Ellie called in today inquiring about how we handle prescriptions, I told her about MPowering''s program, Ellie sounded a bit emotional and when filling out the Cognito prescription form and when she asked about what milligram and type- I asked what kind of med she was filling out a form for, she told me it was birth control and that''s when I suggested she call  ASI, because it was something I remembered seeing in our MEC plans'' services, I told her to call and ask- it wouldn''t hurt and in the meantime I would be price searching on this end.  (I realize that I acted on something that I was never trained to do, I apologize) John got involved and now is handling everything.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-09 13:06:49', '2018-04-09 13:10:53'),
