  ('zcrm_1579374000015591027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, '4-9-18 Choosing $500/$520 for emp/child. Her older son needs his own membership and Patti agreed we can waive $100 of the set up fee since same family and she''ll be paying for son since only 19 but filing own taxes. Julie completed app for herself and daughter. She''s going to have son go to Dr. one more time with Kaiser to get Adderall prescribed and then she may have him do a May 1st or June 1st start date. She knows I won''t be available May 18-20 so will apply before or wait for June 1st start.
