  ('zcrm_1579374000015533013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006366071', 'Michael Johnson', NULL, '4-6-18 I answered his final questions about when to expect getting paid for the health assessment and why drs. office didn''t know of MPB or Sedera. I explained.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-06 16:17:10', '2018-04-06 16:17:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015549003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010193015', 'Einar Haver', NULL, 'Einar wants to cancel- he says that we help him a lot but he cannot afford to pay for our services- I guided him to the cancellation cognito form.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-06 14:19:43', '2018-04-06 14:19:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015533008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038018', 'Alisha Kreeger', NULL, '4-6-18 Alisha is enrolling right now. Her accountant told her the HSA wasn''t worth it but I re-explained it to her and she now understands how it will benefit and that she should do it because earning more money this year as realtor and no longer in school. Just completed tests for massage school last week!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-06 14:18:17', '2018-04-06 14:18:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015542008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659360', 'Rachel Brenneman', NULL, 'Called ASI, spoke to Kareen (yes, correct spelling) and she is researching it.  Will call me back.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-04-06 14:10:23', '2018-04-06 14:10:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015542003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659360', 'Rachel Brenneman', NULL, 'Spoke to Rachel, gave her instructions for contacting Sedera regarding the procedure she''s having done.  Say''s she submitted bill for her physical to ASI and spoke with them', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-04-06 13:51:43', '2018-04-06 13:51:43'),
