  ('zcrm_1579374000015515013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659455', 'Emily Kassel', NULL, 'Emily called in upset because she just got out of the hospital with the Mumps, she has a 13,000 bill and thought that she was responsible for it because the hospital wouldn''t accept her ASI card, I told her not to worry, and asked John to step in and talk her through the  rest.- client has Sedera info-both app and phone number.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-06 13:30:52', '2018-04-06 13:30:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015526003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411075', 'Nancy Levinson', NULL, '4-6-18 Nancy, 54, is self employed and needs June 1st start date. Perfectly healthy, only goes to annual wellness visits every year. She''s getting all of those done now before June 1st including her colonoscopy. Does yoga often, exercises, eats well, etc. No Pre-X, no tobacco, no drugs and no alcohol. She wants to know why everyone doesn''t do this. She''s applying now in first call for $1000/$249. Loves everything natural including essential oils even though husband is a doctor.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-06 13:02:02', '2018-04-06 13:07:30'),
