  ('zcrm_1579374000015467018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011695018', 'Michael Finn', NULL, 'Michael called in just to go over what the protocol is for a wellness visit-he got it all right! -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-05 14:06:05', '2018-04-05 14:06:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015461026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830079', 'Jose Hernandez', NULL, '4-5-18 Anabella Aguilar referred Jose. He sounds Spanish speaking of course. Very healthy, has never smoked ever, self employed. Has son and x-wife. Will decide if this makes sense to add son and for x to get this for herself. Super nice and we have enrollment meeting scheduled for Mon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-05 14:03:36', '2018-04-05 14:03:36'),
