  ('zcrm_1579374000015463005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191463', 'Melvin Roberts', 'ZOHO SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 301 
Question : can''t log in', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2018-04-05 13:23:56', '2018-04-05 13:23:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015467011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001214169', 'Kirsten Zeller', NULL, 'Spoke to Kirsten..... pending bills need actual bills with CPT codes, not just a receipt.  She''ll call her doc to get the bill and submit to Liberty.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-04-05 13:19:50', '2018-04-05 13:19:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015461016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015937219', 'Abigail McMurray', NULL, '4-5-18 Got text message from Sedera saying her membership is approved. Has not received Welcome email yet and Patti should receive notification from Sedera any day now to activate account. Abby will wait until charge and email come through to cancel her current health ins. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-05 13:10:01', '2018-04-05 13:10:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015467003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679079', 'Bonnie Kern', NULL, 'I called Bonnie and tried to help her with the situation she and her husband are in, she thinks that if she waits the 3 months that they can get a "regular" physical under ASI and then recieve anxiety, depression and high blood pressure medication- I kept asking her to just follow through with Teladoc- but client insisted that they may not give her a 90 day script- I tried- client is very confused, and I feel bad for her. John is going to call later.-Kelly', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-05 13:09:55', '2018-04-05 13:09:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015461008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, '4-5-18 She just had questions about how to submit bills now from daughter''s incident. She also wants to know how husband can go in for his colonoscopy. I sent her the dr. network search info. I gave her Concierge phone #. Explained if goes out of network then may have to pay difference in reimbursement rate so best to go in network if possible. Also explained per incident with 5 max for family.  Told her best to call Concierge for assistance with all of this and to ask for a new MPB card bc she can''t find it. She seemed pleased with her experience thus far but was still confused as to how it all works. Has two bills, one for $800+ husband I think and one for daughter of $600+ for blood work for mono, I assume. Did not receive a cash discount for blood work so I told her to talk with Concierge to see if they can help get the price down.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-05 12:59:05', '2018-04-05 12:59:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015461003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005137', 'Katie Irvine', NULL, '4-5-18 Both Katie and husband are 28, self-employed, photographer, healthy, they do use marijuana but legal in CO, so ok. Had Anthem but payment got messed up and Anthem cancelled them before they received the letter to make the payment. Was supposed to be paying $500 mo with a $6K ded per person. This HEP sounds great to her and she will discuss with husband today. We have enrollment apt set for Mon to finish for a May 1st start date. Psyched for this option and to be able to go to any dr. Her husband gets annual skin checks bc grandfathered died of skin cancer. Understands they will need to pay for those on own and will use HSA for that! Sounds savvy and gets it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-05 12:45:43', '2018-04-05 12:45:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015434113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679079', 'Bonnie Kern', NULL, 'Bonnie Kern Thu Apr 05 1:50 PM

Hello... We are new to MPB eff 4/1/18. We are also new to Colorado and do not yet have a preventative care MD. My husband and I are both on medication for several years, due to anxiety, depression, high BP, and cholesterol. We need a doctor to prescribe this medication for us. We have been asked to not use our health share for 3 months, so we can''t use a preventative care doctor to prescribe our medication. We have been told the Teledoc might or might not prescribe the medication, but if he/she did, it would be for one time only, and not sure if that means a one month supply, which would then not cover the first three months that we are asked not to use the health share. This is a dilemma for us, and not sure what to do. Please advise. Bonnie Kern- SKIPIO', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-05 12:17:52', '2018-04-05 12:18:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015434108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086068', 'Janet Nichols', NULL, 'Jenny messaged back and said that we have the proper mailing address, she was simply out of town and had all mail returned to sender at that time.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-05 12:14:21', '2018-04-05 12:14:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015434103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474377', 'Lynette (Lynn) Arena', NULL, 'Lynette called in wondering why she was getting all the welcome call messages and she thought that she had already done it awhile back- I told her that was probably a Sedera call and I went over briefly as to what our welcome call goes over- she said yep that sounds great because I am still confused about a lot of things. She said she would reschedule- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-05 12:11:45', '2018-04-05 12:11:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015434098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005240386', 'Tammy Helart', NULL, 'Bruce Helart called in and first talked with Jennie on why he was being charged $50 every month since last year, then he called wanting to cancel, I guided him to the cancellation form-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-05 12:05:11', '2018-04-05 12:05:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015446003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003418023', 'Debra Panfil', NULL, '4-5-18 I need to make sure not to email Deb''s clients about WWW and Money 101. If I do by accident I will just refer them back to her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-05 11:32:45', '2018-04-05 11:32:45'),
