  ('zcrm_1579374000015434023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610246', 'Edward Smaha III', NULL, 'Mom called in for walk through.  Son had car acident, showed her how to submit bills.  (auto insurance will be the responsible payer)', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-04-05 10:17:26', '2018-04-05 10:17:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015434018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862480', 'Catherine Spinella', NULL, 'client called this morning just to discuss an annual appointment that she has made for tomorrow, but she needs to get her ears checked, and then she might get a new job with benefits and if she''s going for her ear is it covered? maybe I should cancel maybe I shouldn''t- so I just listened and answered what I could.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-05 10:13:38', '2018-04-05 10:13:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015434013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862462', 'Randy James', NULL, 'Spoke to his wife. Sent email so he can book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-05 10:12:02', '2018-04-05 10:12:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015434008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679123', 'John McBride', NULL, 'John called this morning to ask a few questions- he didn''t understand about what a qr life code was because he has not gotten his cards- so I gave him the one that we have on file and it helped him get into his personal assessment.  Also told him that when he receives his asi cards, his name and not his daughters will be on the cards, she can use the cards because she is on the plan, very nice, just anxious about getting everything done.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-05 09:44:44', '2018-04-05 09:44:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015434003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013475051', 'Krista Wilson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Sent email for prescription quote request as requested by member. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-05 09:42:10', '2018-04-05 09:42:10'),
