  ('zcrm_1579374000015409033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679198', 'Kari Rosckowff', NULL, 'I spoke to Kari and sent her coupons for her Bupropion xl- the Trazadone I told her she could get at walmart for 4 dollars- no coupon necessary. I walked her through all of the steps.- happy client-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-05 08:26:49', '2018-04-05 08:26:49'),
