  ('zcrm_1579374000015409018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009614029', 'Kathryn Tagenel', NULL, 'Welcome call completed', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-04-05 07:55:39', '2018-04-05 07:55:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015409013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871102', 'Julie Weck', NULL, 'Welcome call completed', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-04-05 07:54:46', '2018-04-05 07:54:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015409008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679198', 'Kari Rosckowff', NULL, 'Kari called this morning wondering what her prescription quotes were, I helped her find them in her junk mail- I told her that I didn''t know the conversation that she had with John, so I don''t know if he has coupons waiting or not. I told her that one of us would get back to her within the hour.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-05 07:47:54', '2018-04-05 07:47:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015409003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809076', 'Phil McGee', NULL, 'Phil called this morning from Labcorp and they did not recognize the ASI card that he presented, I told him that they would recognize the PHCS network symbol if anything.  They told him that he could pay for labs, submit it and receive %20 back. I told him, that he could pay for it outright and then submit it to the address on the back of the card and it would be reimbursed to him.  He said that he was at the particular labcorb that was suggested to him by MPowering Benefits. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-05 07:07:41', '2018-04-05 07:07:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015380199', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005663233', 'Jason Lewis', NULL, 'Jason called in for prescription pricing.  Sent coupon.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-04-04 15:40:36', '2018-04-04 15:40:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015380194', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919419', 'Leo Goodman', NULL, 'Leo called upset about the deductible that shows on his MEC card, John spoke to him and explained it all to him.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-04 15:02:44', '2018-04-04 15:02:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015380189', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521312', 'Cheryl Schack', NULL, 'Cheryl called multiple times while our lines were acting up- she had multiple questions but the one I told her that I needed help answering was- she is frustrated over some web based e-mails and she didn''t think that her e-signature went through- I told her that John would probably be the one calling back to solve her problems-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-04 14:31:23', '2018-04-04 14:31:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015377013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647053', 'Lester Tang', NULL, 'Emp &amp; Fam $1000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-04-04 14:31:16', '2018-04-04 14:31:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015394003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935075', 'Fabiola Gomes', NULL, 'Member was driving, no computer access. Post welcome call emails sent.', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-04-04 14:23:21', '2018-04-04 14:23:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015380184', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659542', 'Terry Fisher', NULL, 'Terry called in and ended up speaking with John about  his Dr apointment tomorrow, John could not find his Dr under our network, but nominated them to MultiPlan on his behalf.  John told him that he could go to the apt, and if Dr Parsley is not in their system, just pay upfront as a cash client, ask for a cash discount, get an itemized medical bill- and we can guide him through submitting it to ASI afterwards.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-04 14:19:06', '2018-04-04 14:19:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015377008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004884064', 'Philip Griffin', NULL, 'Hello John,
 
