Text message body…', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-03 14:57:55', '2018-04-03 14:57:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015363013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, '4-3-18 I spoke with Patti and we agreed to waiving the $100 for her sons separate membership since they have to have 2 memberships bc he''s 19 and filing own taxes. Seems the most fair. She also plans to share this with her 30 employees and thinks at least 10 will want it. She actually doesn''t want to manage it and therefore, they will become members as part of the MPB Group.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-03 14:43:05', '2018-04-03 14:43:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015363008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, '4-3-18 Julie is single mom- 54, with daughter-15, son-19. Daughter was just in hospital for flu and still sick. She has sports induced asthma or cold induced asthma. She is not concerned that daughter will land in hospital for asthma for any reason. It''s again only induced by extreme situations and she has inhaler- ProAir that she rarely uses. Son also had it but no longer treats it. Son lives in UT right now but will be coming back to CO in June and then attending school. But, son is filing his own taxes for 2018, therefore needs to be on own membership. Told her to include him on the Welcome Call to make sure he understands how to use membership. Son is on anti-depressants and has ADD, but otherwise healthy. Might smoke on occasion. I need to mention terms for smoking! Relatively healthy otherwise. He uses Adderall and Zoloft. Julie uses Zoloft. Julie has an HSA and still needs to fund it for this year and will use funds to pay for meds. Daughter is healthy other than asthma. Julie is paying for mental health visits out of pocket already, so used to that. Told her that''s not an included item to be shared. I will price out meds for her when she emails it to me. We have follow up appt for Mon. April 9th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-03 14:40:30', '2018-04-03 14:40:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015341013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716025', 'Richard O''Krepki', NULL, 'Richard called today concerning why his wife''s bill wasn''t covered at her visit- I told him that it can be submitted via the address on the back of his ASI card.  He was curious if mamograms were covered- then I talked about the difference between wellness and illness codes, and visits - so on and so forth. I asked if she gave the clinic her ASI card- and Richard admitted that she may not have even had it on her, but again, I stressed that all he needed to do was submit it to the address on the the back of the card. Good conversation, nice new client.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-03 14:09:47', '2018-04-03 14:09:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015364008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919652', 'Chris Nielsen', NULL, 'Called and left a VM, reschedule email sent', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-04-03 14:07:03', '2018-04-03 14:07:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015364003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862376', 'Rachel Hrezo', NULL, 'Rushed call, member was at work', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', 'Elizabeth Bradshaw', '2018-04-03 13:57:23', '2018-04-03 13:57:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015363003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033478', 'Michael Poynter', NULL, '4-3-18 David Scott''s Training Sale. None of the others have chosen to enroll yet. Deborah and family gave up their health insurance bc they had to pay back what they got in subsidies bc didn''t account for entire household income in past. Was going to have to pay $1100 and instead is paying back from before. Deborah has Hashimoto''s Thyroid Disease which is well managed by cheap meds. Has heard of Medishare on Christian radio but otherwise doesn''t know much about MCS. She''s going to discuss with husband and we have tentative meeting scheduled for April 13th, 10:00 am to enroll if husband on board.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-03 13:56:18', '2018-04-03 13:56:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015341008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919344', 'Todd Gander', NULL, 'Todd called because he needed to know the next step is as far as where to submit his bills for his heart condition- not pre-existing to the plan I spoke to him about it. I guided him to the mpowering benefits site and then too the Sedera portion. Client was happy about the latest texting system and all the help.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-03 13:29:14', '2018-04-03 13:29:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015341003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009790107', 'Stephen Hill', NULL, 'Stephen called because he wants to know the next steps he should be taking after he got a settlement price in regards to the upcoming birth. -John to call KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-03 13:02:12', '2018-04-03 13:02:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015333013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015376006', 'Shawn Petree', NULL, 'Emp Only $1000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-04-03 12:50:38', '2018-04-03 12:50:38'),
