  ('zcrm_1579374000015328028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535099', 'Shirley Ospina', NULL, 'Shirley reached out to us via Skipio today - Jennie replied to her payment inquiry and her other question was about  her asking for more cards and never getting them, I told her that I would be speaking to my supervisor right away about this so that we can get those out to her. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-03 11:02:37', '2018-04-03 11:02:37'),
