  ('zcrm_1579374000015302103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899274', 'Kevin Broadrick', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Sent email of providers and services as requested by member. Checking into if sent 25.00 for health risk assessment as requested by member. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-03 10:04:15', '2018-04-03 10:04:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015333003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521080', 'Amy Korres', NULL, 'Spoke with Amy and she had visited the ER when she thought she was have a Heart Attack.  However just panic attack.  She gave them the MEC Card and was told after the fact that it was not covered.  She has just received bill frm Hospital for $4200.  I told her to submit to Sedera and let them know what to do about $1000 she owes.  Also she has not opened up an HSA, directed her to HSA Bank online application.  Also ascertained that she did not have her welcome call and sent link out to schedule that.  Advised her that different visits are handled different ways.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-04-03 09:46:16', '2018-04-03 09:46:16'),
