  ('zcrm_1579374000015302073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509065', 'Joy Kelley', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Sent emails for providers and services as requested by member. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-03 09:15:57', '2018-04-03 09:15:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015328018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862462', 'Randy James', NULL, 'Randy called in today to update payment info and then he called back because he made a mistake and gave more money than he should- routed the call to Jennie. Client happy- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-03 08:49:37', '2018-04-03 08:49:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015328013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659360', 'Rachel Brenneman', NULL, 'Thank you. Also I have to get a procedure done at the gyno. It will be more than my $1000 deductible. I pay for it in full and then submit claim to you? Are there forms I need to fill out? Remind me what the address is. Thanks! -Rachel via Skipio at 10:38am ----KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-03 08:38:50', '2018-04-03 08:38:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015302068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508083', 'Lee Pabon', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-03 08:32:29', '2018-04-03 08:32:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015328008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659360', 'Rachel Brenneman', NULL, 'Rachel via Skipio this morning- Hi there. I submitted a claim weeks ago and called to follow up two weeks ago. I still haven''t seen payment. Can you check on that for me? 
I replied that we started working on the situation now. John is working on this now.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-03 08:21:04', '2018-04-03 08:21:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015302063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009614029', 'Kathryn Tagenel', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online for 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-03 08:15:42', '2018-04-03 08:15:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015328003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508120', 'Christopher Newpower', NULL, 'Client called to ask what steps he should take because last night his wife "rolled" both of her ankles and now cannot walk.   The client is very new, and spoke about an orthopedic Dr in the area called "Summit Orthopedic" - John took the rest of the call and guided him through the whole procedure, and told him to continue giving us updates and we will hold his hand through this.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-03 08:07:00', '2018-04-03 08:07:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015302058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716025', 'Richard O''Krepki', NULL, 'Spoke to member was in hurry to go into a meeting told him will send email to book online for the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-03 08:05:54', '2018-04-03 08:05:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015302053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740037', 'Lauren Wagner', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 15 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-04-03 08:00:36', '2018-04-03 08:00:36'),
