  ('zcrm_1579374000015293021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001214169', 'Kirsten Zeller', NULL, '4-2-18 Kirsten has questions about how to get reimbursed from LHS. Submitted bills and it''s showing that bill was reimbursed to member. Told her to call Concierge and speak with John Kach to go over Sharebox with her and explain what to expect. She will call him.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-02 15:28:31', '2018-04-02 15:28:31'),
