  ('zcrm_1579374000015293013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005039', 'Ryan Richards', NULL, '4-2-18 Ryan''s plan got cancelled unbeknownst to him with Kaiser. Discovered it when doing his taxes that no payment was taken out. Was paying $277 in 2017 for Silver Kaiser plan with $5K ded and 2018 was supposed to be $366 mo. but never got charged. Now he''s going to have Doreen set him up with STM for April and will do this for May 1st start date. Has a bunch of self-employed friends who might want to switch as well. Divorced and kids on wife''s plan through work. Daughter went to ER for possible head injury when fell in house when brushing teeth and later threw up in middle of night. Cost for a 2 min. visit by Dr. was over $3K! He''s pissed about that. He''s super healthy, 180, 6'' 2", same since college, no tobacco, did physical 2 years ago and they''re telling him he only needs one every 5 years. Did colonoscopy at that time as well and everything checked out fine. He''s choosing the $1000 IUA/ $249 since hasn''t had a doctor visit for 5-10 years other than physical. Enrolling now for May 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-04-02 12:40:35', '2018-04-02 12:41:19'),
