  ('zcrm_1579374000015272013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011019034', 'Cheryl Cunningham', NULL, 'Cheryl called with an update about her health- the  Teladoc call turned into a visit to Urgent care and then right after that she needed to go to go to the ER for an emergency appendectomy. She called to know what to do next and I told her to call Sedera and that they would take care of her after she reached her iua. I told the client that we were so happy to hear that she is doing better and on the mend.-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-02 10:34:02', '2018-04-02 10:34:02'),
