  ('zcrm_1579374000015272008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001659002', 'Dorothy Fears', NULL, 'Spoke with client and helped her to clarify her new billing now that she is with Sedera instead of Liberty.   I explained that the amount billed on 3/20 was for the "flip over" from Liberty to Sedara and on 3/22 the $249 is her monthly share amount.  I told her that the 22nd of each month is when she can expect to be billed the $249. Client sounded happy and satisfied with the answer.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-04-02 09:34:11', '2018-04-02 09:34:11'),
