  ('zcrm_1579374000015187018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006824147', 'Andrew Malishenko', NULL, '3-29-18 Looks like he''ll have to pay a penalty for missing 3 months of coverage in 2017! I researched and it says less than 3 months. Grrr... His penalty might be about $1000! Suggested he writes a letter for a hardship exemption since his UHC plan was ended unbeknownst to him Jan. 1st 2017. He thought it was auto-renewing but he had to manually select the new comparable plan and he didn''t do so in time. So, then found me and signed up for LHS April 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-29 15:41:13', '2018-03-29 15:41:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015176043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630057', 'Kathleen Campbell', NULL, 'Kathleen called today  to find out what she needed to do as far as getting a mama-graph, I told her that I was going to send her a link that included Drs and facilities in her area where she could get it done. I also told her that we request that all members wait the 90 days to schedule the larger diagnostic type wellness checks.  She got a bit upset, because apparently her last insurance company gave her a lot of trouble on this. I told her that it was a request, not a demand and that she could do the mammogram whenever she would like.  THEN she said that she was going to make the mammogram appointment at the first of May anyway so it was going to be the 90 days after all.  -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-29 14:15:20', '2018-03-29 14:15:20'),
