  ('zcrm_1579374000015176033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014539007', 'Kris Srnka', NULL, 'Kris called in today because she was "stuck" as far as she has all cards and info but can''t strart to use any apps until the first. I guided her to the mpoweringbenefits.com site and told her how to find the checklist to do in the meantime, as well as all of the education she can glean from there up until she officially starts with us in a few days. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-29 11:13:26', '2018-03-29 11:13:26'),
