  ('zcrm_1579374000015176018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001060051', 'Matthew Ross', NULL, 'Spoke to Matt.  Gave instructions for knee issue - already at the $500 IUA.  APP.SEDERA.COM - upload bills, call members services for guidance and instructions.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-03-28 12:43:10', '2018-03-28 12:43:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015178003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011307064', 'Thomas White-O''Connor', NULL, '3-28-18 "Hi Wendy,
Hope you''re doing well! We wanted to give you some glowing feedback about Mpowering Benefits and Sedera. I ended up having some weird flu complications and had to go to the ER and then the hospital for a couple of days in February. I''m fine now but, as you can imagine, that got expensive. We''re still not quite through with all the bill payments, but Sedera has been wonderful to work with. All along, they answered emails right away, as well as phone calls. Elizabeth and then Bridget who we primarily dealt with, were extremely helpful and responsive. The Karis group contact, Jonathan, who does the bill negotiation was sharp. We had our fingers crossed, waiting for the big check in the mail, and we received it two days ago for over $16,000.
So, we wanted to let you know how happy and relieved we are that it all went so smoothly. We know it''s important for you to get this kind of feedback too, so you can confidently recommend them. This was such a different experience than our past health insurance experiences. It felt like a team effort. We did our part, and were very organized and asked for the self pay discounts each step of the way, which made their job easier, submitted bills quickly, etc. And they did everything they said they were going to do, and quickly.

Thanks for hooking us up with this program! We are really glad we had it. Also, we just referred a friend to you, who has been evaluatin Health Share plans, and he may be giving you a call...Dave Crocker.

Best
Tom and Beth"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-28 12:36:18', '2018-03-28 12:36:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015176013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919089', 'Nancy Hoglund', NULL, 'Referred Steve Moeller.  notified Amy Nielsen.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-03-28 12:13:18', '2018-03-28 12:13:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015176008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630217', 'Rula Huber', NULL, 'Spoke to Elizabeth at Sedera.  Rula was included in the list sent to 2nd MD.  Elizabeth will contact her.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-03-28 12:12:32', '2018-03-28 12:12:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015167033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590004', 'Isabel Graefin Von Rittberg', NULL, 'Isabel called to make sure that she got everything she should''ve gotten in the mail. She told me that she got the ASI cards and the QR LIfe code cards but she was looking for a "welcome packet" I told her that there was probably a Sedera welcome pack in her spam and that it was very important to download and print it out- client was happy for the help-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-28 12:11:17', '2018-03-28 12:11:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015167028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001347005', 'Lyna Norberg', NULL, 'Lyna called this afternoon about a bill that the Dr''s office submitted to Liberty that she wasn''t hearing back about.   I told her that the best course of action at this point was to call Liberty, she asked "aren''t you supposed to know what''s going on?" I told her that she didn''t submit the bill to us, her Dr''s office submitted it to Liberty.  I asked about 3 times if she would like the phone number to Liberty and then she told me what it was. I also offered  to give a message to John after his meeting so he can call and try to help with the situation- she declined. -spoke to John about all of this, and he said he was going to reach out. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-28 12:00:06', '2018-03-28 12:00:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015176003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012935127', 'Chaz Mayer', NULL, 'Left message, sent email regarding deductible question.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-03-28 11:12:06', '2018-03-28 11:12:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015169013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015979122', 'Kyle Townsend', NULL, 'Emp Only $500 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-03-28 10:26:53', '2018-03-28 10:26:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015167023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233082', 'Daniel Wisdom', NULL, 'Daniel called in today and wanted to know which action he should be taking about his back bothering him, he has already gone to two chiropracters, but he likes the second one that actually took xrays and made a "chiro-plan" for him- he is very new to the plan and wondered how the plan worked.  I told him that he would need to meet his IUA before Sedera would step in to help but that he needed to keep and scan all itimized bills as well as the chiro-plan.  He admitted a few times that he needed the welcome call so he would''ve known all of the information already. He also brought up 2nd MD and I told him that it would be a very good idea for him to use. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-28 10:23:09', '2018-03-28 10:23:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015167018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779377', 'Jack Bowlin', NULL, 'I spoke to Jack and let him know that we found his Dr on the multiplan list and that the next thing he needed to do as far as "setting up" his colonoscopy is to speak to his Dr about where it will be performed and then check to see if that facility is covered- I sent over the the provider list and explained it to him. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-28 09:56:05', '2018-03-28 09:56:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015161033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014924104', 'Teresa Coviello', NULL, 'Monthly Share amount was returned by the bank.  Account closed. Emailed to receive payment.', 'Jennie Schluth', 'Jennie Schluth', '2018-03-28 09:34:51', '2018-03-28 09:34:51'),
