  ('zcrm_1579374000015161023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012724347', 'Wadd Blake Welch', NULL, 'Attempted welcome call but member didn''t feel well. Will set up online another call at a better time. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-03-28 08:45:19', '2018-03-28 08:45:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015167013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659967', 'Shawn Mynar', NULL, 'Shawn wanted to know the process if she needed to go to the dermatologist to get some suspicious spots checked out. She admitted that she never made a welcome call apt, but said that she would. I told her to tell the derm office that she was a self-pay patient, to keep all itimized receipts,  and also to ask for a discount.  Client was really grateful for all of the help. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-28 08:30:06', '2018-03-28 08:30:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015161018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899138', 'Andrew Eisenberg', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. member that is a doctor himself did health risk assessment and wrote in comments that didn''t agree to suggest a daily aspirin and to take psa test for prostate. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-03-28 08:24:32', '2018-03-28 08:24:32'),
