  ('zcrm_1579374000015167003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011019034', 'Cheryl Cunningham', NULL, 'Cheryl called this morning because she is having some symptoms that she said possibly could be appendicitis, she was in front of the computer so I guided her to the Sedara info as well as the Teledoc info. I assured her that the Teledoc Dr would tell her if they though her situation was emergent or not and she can go from there. I asked if she had done her welcome call and she said no, that she had not gotten around to it. I told her that once she feels better she should schedule one because it would help her any other issue with her health that came up. -client was happy and said she would get started with Teladoc. -KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-28 07:37:00', '2018-03-28 07:37:00'),
