  ('zcrm_1579374000015104101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954107', 'Shelby (Hank) Carter', NULL, '3-27-18 He finally chose to keep his membership after I let him know he missed open enrollment and the options are not good if ACA compliant. He''s going to wait until next year to re-evaluate. He truly has the best option for him at this point in my opinion.  Only have Anthem in his home area and crazy expensive for nothing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-27 16:20:17', '2018-03-27 16:20:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015104096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038018', 'Alisha Kreeger', NULL, '3-27-18 Alisha is 44 and used to be with BC/BS and 1 other carrier and has had terrible experiences. Paying $1800 month for family. Now x-husband has had a relapse with alcoholism and is not amendable to making changes but Aliera is Not serving them well. Apparently they have no cancer care, no pregnancy care, no med coverage and it''s religious based which she''s not a fan of. Aliera was costing $670 for their family. She calls herself and kids crazy healthy, seeks only naturopaths, acupuncture and perhaps seeks ped 1x year for minor kid infection or sickness. Alisha was cleared of breast cancer in 2011. She has seasonal allergies and asthma. She wants HEP and is calling me shortly to enroll. I need to finish explaining all components and utilization to her. Wants a May 1st start date bc Aliera has already charged her for April. She can cancel that and get on HEP with her kids and leave husband on Aliera. They weren''t legally on their since they are no longer married anyhow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-27 15:44:14', '2018-03-27 15:44:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015104091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015979073', 'Tomi Hanson', NULL, '3-27-18 Tomi is enrolling now. She completed enrollment. I''m not sure which level she chose. She''s healthy and application was easy. She knows of 90 day requested wait and is set to go for May 1st. Also knows to cancel her current plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-27 15:00:10', '2018-03-27 15:00:10'),
