  ('zcrm_1579374000015104066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015139029', 'Bailey Nelson', NULL, '3-27-18 Signed up for Bright Health last night since she is pregnant and has Trachial Stenosis which is an autoimmune disease. Her plan can start April 1st and she can cancel Cigna for herself but leave husband and kids on for April and then cancel entirely for May 1st once Ryan and kids are on HEP moving forward. She wants dental also. They only do cleanings so, I''ll send them Humana and dental discount plans. Was paying $1807 mo. for Cigna!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-27 13:05:27', '2018-03-27 13:05:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015104061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011695018', 'Michael Finn', NULL, 'Michael called in today wanting some direction as far as his sinus infection that turned into having cysts in his sinus infection- he said that the Dr may want him to have surgery, so I told him that Second MD would need to get involved if it did come to that. I also gave him Sedera''s phone number and contact e-mail. I guided him to the mpowering site, and showed him everything that he needs right now- 2nd MD and Sedera. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-27 12:54:13', '2018-03-27 12:54:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015104056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015979037', 'Ryan Nelson', NULL, '3-27-18 Bailey is signing up husband and kids for HEP and chose Bright Health for herself because pregnant and has trachial stenosis. Ryan is 37, Bailey is 31 and kids are 2 and 4. All have June Birthdays. They had a life changing event by moving to Silverthorne. Live 1/3 time in Denver and 2/3 time in Silverthorne. Was paying $1807 mo. for Cigna and can''t afford that. So, we found $433 for Bright Health for her and $427 mo./ $1000 IUA for Ryan and kids. Signing up now for May 1st start.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-27 12:41:46', '2018-03-27 12:41:46'),
