  ('zcrm_1579374000015104026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006532125', 'Frank Alvarez', NULL, 'Traci McCoid just called on Frank''s behalf because he would like to cancel. I sent a cancellation form to him via e-mail which was o''ked by Traci. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-27 10:37:52', '2018-03-27 10:37:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015104021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004869342', 'Theresa Lewak', NULL, 'Theresa called in today wanting to speak with John and sounding upset. John told her to contact Liberty and get them involved as soon as she could,- speaking of a biopsy. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-27 09:54:07', '2018-03-27 09:54:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015130003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014900011', 'Ahmed Munir', NULL, 'welcome call complete but member was in a rush to go into meeting. He said he will follow up at another time. He wanted to know if he would cancel if there were any penalties. I told him no just to notify by the 20th of previous month for cancelation. Had to rush through the welcome call.', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2018-03-27 08:43:14', '2018-03-27 08:43:14'),
