  ('zcrm_1579374000015100013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015937219', 'Abigail McMurray', NULL, '3-26-18 Healthy, but husband was born with bronchial asthma but has not been treated. Want a May 1st start date. Enrolling now for Abby and husband for $485/$1000 and leaving baby on trad ins at $286 for now while they try it out. Rarely go to Dr. and healthy. They both were smokers but have quit for longer than 12 months. Already has an HSA. Completed enrollment!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-26 16:47:37', '2018-03-26 17:16:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015100008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954107', 'Shelby (Hank) Carter', NULL, '3-26-18 He thought he was getting charged the wrong amount. He was under 30 when we talked but he turned 30 in Dec. and therefore being charged the 30-64 price. I just verified his DOB and he''s 30 for sure. He didn''t realize there was a price bump and I didn''t realize he was turning 30 so soon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-26 15:19:56', '2018-03-26 16:54:34'),
