  ('zcrm_1579374000015100003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862440', 'Robert (Greg) White', NULL, '3-26-18 I left vm for Greg letting him know I followed up and his banking was fixed again and he should be all set moving forward now. Jennie helped him this morning according to Patti. Patti double checked and it looks like he''s fixed to getting charged for $1000/$249 from his bank not cc.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-26 13:58:39', '2018-03-26 13:58:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015092033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798144', 'Erin La Grassa', NULL, 'I replied to Erin today via Skipio  when she asked about if we offer discounts on prescriptions- I told her that I would be happy to start doing that and posted the cognito prescription form link-she did open it up on her phone, I am eagerly waiting to to start working on it-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-26 13:03:06', '2018-03-26 13:03:06'),
