  ('zcrm_1579374000015090049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862326', 'Jennifer Soehngen', NULL, 'called in for directions on ordering non wellness labs.  directed to direct labs and gave instructions.  TSH = $36', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-03-26 12:40:45', '2018-03-26 12:40:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015092028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919496', 'Dana Green', NULL, 'Dana called in because she was going to the Dr and wanted to know the exact type of blood work that would be covered- Dana did not like my Wellness answer so I gave her ASI''s number. She also said that she was told the day of the welcome call that she would receive some emails that "never came" I told Dana that they were in fact sent, and that she should check her spam for the 9th when JDasia spoke with her and sent all the set-up style e-mails. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-26 11:59:39', '2018-03-26 11:59:39'),
