  ('zcrm_1579374000015089023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779251', 'Michael Massarelli', NULL, 'Recieved VM frm Betties that this member called in after hrs.  He expressed to me that he is taking a high priced med that needs coverage for.  John submitted this to World Meds however not enough savings for him.  So he will be cancelling. effective 4/1.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2018-03-26 10:31:15', '2018-03-26 10:31:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015092018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282015', 'Dan Gavere', NULL, 'Dan called in this afternoon about when he started and when this month ends for coverage. He said that he just paid for this month and wondered when he would be billed again.  I told him that we bill on the 22nd.  He then said that he wants to cancel and that he just started a new insurance- I guided him to the cancellation form online- and spoke with Patti about it. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-26 10:15:14', '2018-03-26 10:15:14'),
