  ('zcrm_1579374000015092008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779637', 'Meghan Logue', NULL, 'I spoke with Meghan via Skipio this morning because she wasn''t feeling well, I gave her the direction as far as signing up for Teladoc- the Teladoc Dr told her to go to the Dr and get tested for Mono, she asked if it would be covered, I told her that she had the initial unshared amount t', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-26 09:19:10', '2018-03-26 09:19:10'),
