  ('zcrm_1579374000015056003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474351', 'Karen Boelts', NULL, 'Karen called today regarding prescription medications that she told someone about a month ago, also she wanted help finding a Dr that specializes in Thyroid and autoimmune disease. I did a search on Healthgrades.com and told the client how many Dr''s I found, I then gave her the web address. -I ended up finding the prescription medications with coupons attached and told Karen that if was sent out a month ago- I sent it back out to her-KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-23 12:13:34', '2018-03-23 12:13:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000015044005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017280031', 'Scott McKenzie', NULL, '3-23-18 Self Employed and runs own home healthcare company. His plan ended in Dec. with Kaiser and he was tired of them anyhow. Feels they just provide bandaid instead of finding root cause of problem. Was only paying $111 a month but based on old income from 3 years ago of $17K and now income at $35K-$40K. He''s ok with paying more to get better coverage and access to better docs. He''s super healthy and prefers holistic docs who focus on mind, body and spirit, not the traditional Kaiser method. His only health issue is dry eyes and taking Restatis right now but believes there''s a more holistic way to heal the problem. He works with Michelle (?) in CA for Mastermind Personal Development and she referred him to Mara and Mara to me. He''s working with Mara now on his retirement plan. He wants a May 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-23 11:53:05', '2018-03-23 12:09:37'),
