  ('zcrm_1579374000014930019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798088', 'Cynthia Herman', NULL, '3-21-18 She wanted to cancel membership bc wanted to get entire family on membership for less than $786 but prefers the $500 IUA. Wanted to include 23 yr old son on membership but can''t since he''s filing own taxes. He works for Big O Tire or Discount Tire, one of those chains and they are claiming him as a PT employee even though he works more than 30 hrs and works overtime and is paid time and a half for overtime. They aren''t offering him insurance according to her son which is not legal. She''s going to have her son talk with employer. She clearly can''t make the insurance payment easily and wants me to talk with her husband bc sounds like they can''t afford it. They don''t really have any other options. Rules are all the same for U26 dependents vs ind.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-21 14:50:56', '2018-03-21 14:50:56'),
