  ('zcrm_1579374000014931011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447476', 'Mia Fanali-Skowronski', NULL, 'Mia called in today to make sure that her holistic mamograph would be covered.  She had just gotten off of the phone with ASI and they told her that it would be covered as long as not any of the codes indicate that it was diagnostic. I told her that they told her correctly. She is going to have this mammogram and submit the bill to ASI.- KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-21 10:54:13', '2018-03-21 10:54:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000014931003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009743055', 'Joyce Jordan', NULL, 'Client called in because she was having difficulty trying to apply for the HSA Account that we suggested siting that she tried to call but that they only take calls after you have set up an account with them, I apologized and said if that one wasn''t the right fit for her than she could find another one that did.  I gave her some ideas as to what those options would be and she was appreciative.  -I went to the Optum bank site while she was on the line and told her that it looked very informative and helpful. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-21 10:35:59', '2018-03-21 10:45:40'),
