  ('zcrm_1579374000014913013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083052', 'Machelle Evans', NULL, 'Client wants the exact name of the bloodwork that would be considered a wellness check and would like to know about if her mammogram is covered even if she has implants and the Dr recommends a 3D scan every year. 
