  ('zcrm_1579374000014904041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010714227', 'Elizabeth Kayser', NULL, '3-20-18 Left vm with detailed info letting her know her 3rd card from MPB is going out today. Usually go out once a month but specially sending yours out today. Let her know I will be happy to explain the difference on how and when to use the ASi card versus MPB card if she''d like to call me back. In her vm she still sounds confused.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-20 14:48:27', '2018-03-20 14:48:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000014904036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014901032', 'Sarah Nilstoft', NULL, '3-20-18 Sarah is the HR Generalist and is looking at HEP to give her non FTE employees an option other than marketplace or Medicaid. She likes the sounds of it. Their demographic is going to be younger 20''s and 30''s. The Rio has roughly 500 employees so large group. All set on that front. Servers also may have lower incomes so may not be perfect for everyone but can definitely fill a niche. Some might smoke or use tobacco as well. She wants to make sure Andy Malishenko will get credit for any of these referrals she provides. I told her yes and to connect me with employee via email and remind me to credit Andy for each. She''s going to do that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-20 14:30:28', '2018-03-20 14:30:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000014913008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005658080', 'Scott Kostel', NULL, 'A receptionist from a Dr''s office called and asked to know deductable info from us, after searching his CRM I found that he was with Liberty health share - and whilst looking up their number the call dropped. I tried to call Scott''s phone number but it went to fax. I e-mailed him Liberties phone number. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-20 14:28:25', '2018-03-20 14:28:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000014916003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014189229', 'Gemma Lynn Davis', NULL, 'Difficult.  Dr. Davis, (husband) pressed on alternative/naturopathic treatment and process for pre authorization. - he''s a chiropractor.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-03-20 14:21:24', '2018-03-20 14:21:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000014904029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007925147', 'Linda Johnston', NULL, '3-20-18 Wants to add an extra week to membership since doesn''t have Medicare cards yet. Told her via vm that she can extend for 1 month or sign up for STM for week but bill as monthly as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-20 13:29:20', '2018-03-20 13:29:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000014913003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447407', 'Elizabeth Friedlander', NULL, 'Elizabeth called saying that she may have already had the welcome call about a month ago, she asked if it would be ok for her to have another one now that she finally has her cards.  I told her that would be fine, that we want her to understand how to use the MPowering Benefits Platform of services.. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-20 13:27:07', '2018-03-20 13:27:07'),
