  ('zcrm_1579374000014814013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610584', 'William Calhoun', NULL, 'I spoke with Sedera  about what was going on-  they told me that Teladoc was not working for William because Sedera had the wrong birthdate  of Nov 11, 1968 as well as a middle initial of "S"- I was told that he would not be able to use Teladoc until the paperwork was fixed on their end and it will be submitted on Friday and the the latest  it would be resolved was this coming Monday- in the meantime Sedera said that if he needed to go to urgent care, that he could submit the bill and they would pay for it because of the inconvenience. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-20 09:30:22', '2018-03-20 09:30:22'),
