  ('zcrm_1579374000014639051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165336', 'Jacqueline Ambrose Woodward', NULL, '3-16-18 Arisa says they can''t reinstate plan bc she was properly notified on 10/15/17 that plan ended and the document shows in her portal which is illegible to me. I wasn''t notified and account still showed as active. But, I had to click on 2018 enrollments which it always defaulted to 2017 apparently. I''ve never seen that happen! She needs a life change event to gain coverage.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-16 18:14:53', '2018-03-16 18:14:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000014639046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881581', 'Jason (Jay) Wright', NULL, '3-16-18 Jay called bc he just realized I''m friends with Lindsay Yaw as well. He went to UVM and graduated in "99 and moved to Boston for 1 year then moved out here. Then lived in Aspen for many years, but just moved back to Boulder last year. Is engaged to Megan who is also client. Jay grew up in St. Albans! He''s realtor and listened to my presentation at BARA. Super nice and sounds like wants to hang sometime. Also used to play soccer and was curious if I played outdoor coed. He''d like to get back into it. It''s been 10 years since he''s played and not up for men''s coed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-16 17:09:59', '2018-03-16 17:09:59'),
