  ('zcrm_1579374000014668018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012416027', 'Judson Rogers', NULL, 'Judson called from Mountain Family Providers in CO for an annual and the facility did not recognize it or accept it but Client is very very certain that he found them listed on the provider search link that we sent him. I told him that he could call ASI/MEC to nominate the clinic as well as self pay- and get detailed bills to self submit to ASI and get reimbursed 130% of Medicare. Client was very kind and patient about his situation. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-15 10:29:19', '2018-03-15 10:29:19'),
