  ('zcrm_1579374000014668013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001950031', 'Eric Nehls', NULL, 'Client called in asking for John,  I told him that John had stepped out for a minute but if he would like to message I would give it to John as soon as I saw him. The owner scoffed and said "don''t you have a voicemail?" I told the client that yes we do, but that this is a multi line office. client did give me the best phone number for John to reach him back at. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-15 09:51:12', '2018-03-15 09:51:12'),
