  ('zcrm_1579374000014578003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020307107', 'Heather Piper Musmanno Bianciotto', NULL, '3-13-18 Leaving job May 3rd and covered through end of month. Needs June 1st start date. Told her prices might change and guidelines so the sooner the better and we just put start date as June 1st. She had hip replacement in 2014 and benign tumor removed in 2013. Has allergies and uses OTC Zyrtec and asthma but barely ever uses inhaler if at all. May not have used it in the last 3 years but buys it in case of an incident. Has had hand pain and injections and knee pain and PT. More of a muscular problem according to PT. Earns way too much for APTC like $160K for this year because of stock options. Also has hypothyroid and only uses meds which cost $10 generic on Werx.com Has one other med that''s $56 for 3 months. So, meds are affordable. Eric is totally healthy with no problems! She will determine if HEP or traditional is best. Most of her issues are muscular or items that she manages on her own already.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-13 12:53:25', '2018-03-13 12:53:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000014574003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779401', 'Kathleen Wilger', NULL, 'I e-mailed Kathleen Teledoc info as well as the link to mpowering benefits check off list. She told me that she had missed two opportunities to have the welcome call with us. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-13 11:39:58', '2018-03-13 11:49:43'),
