  ('zcrm_1579374000014533036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207461', 'Michael Schnelle', NULL, '3-12-18 Got kicked of Medicaid in Dec. and hasn''t had ins. since. Cost for trad was starting at $327 Kaiser but he missed open enrollment anyhow. He likes the idea of HEP and will look over email and let me know if he wants to move forward or not. Said sounds very interesting. He''ll let me know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-12 17:56:04', '2018-03-12 17:56:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000014533031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012048004', 'Paula Slick', NULL, '3-12-18 Paula called to find out how to get son off of CHP+. Told her to call # on back of card since I can''t help further. He doesn''t qualify and she doesn''t want to be penalized. He is on his dad''s plan already. So, they are all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-12 17:32:17', '2018-03-12 17:32:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000014533026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '3-12-18 Wants to get health license and sell HEP. Not interested in selling trad insurance but needs license to work with us. She is eager and I need to compile instructions to get her going.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-12 17:28:50', '2018-03-12 17:28:50'),
