  ('zcrm_1579374000014518018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083120', 'Margaret Noonan', NULL, 'Margaret called again needing a bit more help with her HSA setup. Super nice. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-12 12:05:29', '2018-03-12 12:05:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000014533003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014539053', 'Daryl Mackie', NULL, '3-12-18 Signed up just now for his family. Owns biz in Basalt and has helper Heather communicate with me at first. Wife got in a mtn bike accident this last year or so. Only pre-x. No tobacco, healthy. Choosing $1000/$638 since rarely go to dr. Hasn''t had physical in as long as he can remember. He''s super nice, has accent. He hopes to refer some folks soon. Explained the cards to him again and when to use it for wellness visits only. Told him to make sure to have wife and him on Welcome Call to get them totally acquainted with membership aspects.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-12 11:49:02', '2018-03-12 11:49:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000014518013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899548', 'Christina Davies', NULL, 'Christina called and wondered what steps she could take to resolve a sinus infection she has. She didn''t remember if she had a welcome call with us or not, but I explained how helpful in understanding the program they are. I explained the Teladoc service and told her that it would be perfect for her situation.  I sent out the registration to her as well as another welcome call scheduler e-mail. Client was very appreciative of all of the help. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-12 10:50:49', '2018-03-12 10:50:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000014518008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083120', 'Margaret Noonan', NULL, 'Client called and was wondering if it mattered what HSA bank she chooses.  I told her no, it doesn''t at all affect how the program functions. I sent the HSAbank link out to her anyway.  She also wanted to know if she was getting a referral fee for Robin Bernhard.  KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-12 10:40:07', '2018-03-12 10:40:07'),
