  ('zcrm_1579374000014518003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798088', 'Cynthia Herman', NULL, '"River City Docs" called wondering what Zachery''s plan covers and deductable, River City Docs is an orthopedic specialist office.  I told her that the card that she was inquiring about, the ASI card was only for well visits and it does not cover injury or illness.  The receptionist told me that she would let the client know all of that information.  KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-12 08:15:23', '2018-03-12 08:15:23'),
