  ('zcrm_1579374000014410008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862130', 'Marion Steed', NULL, 'Marion called in today wanting to know the process behind us finding her the best price on blood work.  I spoke to her about how John uses search tools so that our clients can purchase the labform online and then bring it into Quest.  She is going to call her Dr''s office to get the exact names of the test and then call or e-mail us the info. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-08 12:09:17', '2018-03-08 12:09:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000014386023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083191', 'Greg Haarburger', NULL, '3-8-18 Just called to understand pre-x clause bc fell off surf board a few months ago and hurt his neck a bit. Understands it better and knows all dr. records are accessible via MIB. Apologized for troubles with his account while he was in Africa as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-08 11:12:01', '2018-03-08 11:12:01'),
