  ('zcrm_1579374000014409010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, 'Daughter has mono.  member presented ASI card for bloodwork - told her to get bill, we will help submit to Sedera and have them negotiate prior to paying anything.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2018-03-08 10:53:38', '2018-03-08 10:53:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000014386018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679198', 'Kari Rosckowff', NULL, '3-8-18 Lost her job at end of March and lost her Kaiser ins at end of March. Just sent her a short-term option for her or for her and 9 yr. old son. X might put son on his plan. She is healthy but deals with depression and is on Trazadone 100mg and cost looks to be $4-$8 a month and Buproprion 150 mg for $17.74-$23 for 30. Lives in Westminster, Jefferson County, 38.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-08 10:50:21', '2018-03-08 10:50:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000014410003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207493', 'Eben Grace', NULL, 'Eben called in today saying the e-mail that I had sent him last month on the 28th was blank, I apologized and sent him all the info again. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-08 10:21:54', '2018-03-08 10:21:54'),
