  ('zcrm_1579374000014394003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007272051', 'Annie Zrubek', NULL, '3-7-18 Considering adding back HES or switching to HEP. Wants unlimited annual wellness and is willing to wait for 90 days to get mammogram. Was afraid to go with LHS bc wasn''t sure if it would be covered. Told her it''s $400 max. Has high blood pressure and was annoyed that it''s considered pre-x and therefore likes HEP since that''s exempt. She''s a realtor so makes good money and likes the idea of HSA also but wants help setting it up. Likely will choose the $500/$299. Likes the sound of HEP and will think it over. If switches wants to do so before May 1st since that''s renewal date for LHS and $75 fee.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-03-07 10:33:02', '2018-03-07 10:33:02'),
