  ('zcrm_1579374000014267013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521614', 'Eleonora Steinberg', NULL, 'Client called in wondering why the monthly charge had not yet come out of her account, I explained about us switching payment portals, it will be resolved in a few days. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-05 10:14:18', '2018-03-05 10:14:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000014267008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659598', 'Christina Bremner Anderson', NULL, 'Christie called this morning very emotional and upset because she had been diagnosed with pneumonia this past week and although she has been taking antibiotics she is feeling worse, her family and friends are telling her that she should just go to the ER, but she called because she wants to follow all of the appropriate steps.  I gave her Sedara''s number, and then told her (perJohn) that she should go back to her Dr''s office and let the Dr make the determination if she should go to the ER or not, if yes than she needed to put just a minimum amount on a credit card and then we would help her with the rest. I told Christie to keep us in the loop to whats going on, and also that she should call Sedara if she ends up at the hospital. She has kept all of the bills up to this point. Client said she was very grateful for the time and care we gave to her and that our kindness meant a lot. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-03-05 10:10:26', '2018-03-05 10:10:26'),
