  ('zcrm_1579374000013782041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822306', 'Michael Barnard', NULL, '2/20/18 Walked Michael through the enrollment process.  He understands the MPowering Benefit group program and independent contractor situation.  He understands the IUA and has decided to go with the $500/ IUA.  We discussed all of the particulars for about an hour.  He wants to enroll, is healthy, young and probably a good candidate,   JR', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2018-02-21 18:42:56', '2018-02-21 18:42:56'),
