  ('zcrm_1579374000013764008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447191', 'Johnnie Hharriman', NULL, 'I called and left a message on clients machine concerning some scripts she submitted in the Cognito forum. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-02-21 10:28:52', '2018-02-21 10:28:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000013772003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013475051', 'Krista Wilson', NULL, '2-21-18  John called and told me he took a call from Krista who was very pissed off because she was not given a return call.  It was concerning her son Colton who has ADHD and she wanted to know if he was going to be covered.   

I (Ron) called her and she was calm and just wondering if anyone had gotten an answer from Sedera.  We had a pleasant discussion and I reminded her of our discussion we had during the enrollment process.  She never shared Colton''s condition until she was completing the enrollment.  I explained to her the following.
1.  Colton''s condition would not be covered due to a pre-existing condition.
2. Any follow-up visits probably would not exceed $1k and would be paid out-of-pocket in any event.
3.  His medication is currently paid out-of-pocket now.  Because he''s on a maintenance med Sedera would not participate in the cost.  MyMPB disc. plans would help to locate them at the best prices for his meds.  
4.  His routine 6 mo check-ups for his ADHD would not be shared for the first 12-months and then 2,3,4 months as indicated by Sedera.
5.  Concerning his medication -  Vyvanse 30mg capsule (1x/daily) - we will provide her prices where best to buy at the best cost.  I sent a request to John to handle this request.

I asked Krista if she called Sedera to discuss Colton''s condition and she said she forgot to call.  I offered the Sedera phone number again and she declined.  She said she understood better how how the program works and was satisfied it would work for their family everyone else had not medical conditions or on medications.  I ask if she still wished to move forward and she answer yes.  I told her to call us if she has any other questions.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2018-02-21 10:04:09', '2018-02-21 10:09:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000013764003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809003', 'Tommy Turner', NULL, 'Tommy called with many quesitons this morning, I reminded him that he got a link to make a welcome call just the other day and that it would answer alot of the questions that he had. client booked a call for tomorrow before our phone coversation ended. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-02-21 09:26:56', '2018-02-21 09:26:56'),
