  ('zcrm_1579374000013737003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822110', 'Amanda Scanlon', NULL, '2-20-18 Healthy, 29 until June of 2018. Told her price change once she turns 30. She missed paying for her traditional insurance and is without coverage for the year. Liz thinks this is the best option for her for the year. Then they will revisit her option next open enrollment and perhaps switch back to traditional insurance. Liz is health licensed I think as well and helps Doreen Fitzgerald who is an agent as well. Applying right now for March 1st start date. Completed enrollment with $1000/$215.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-02-20 11:09:22', '2018-02-20 11:23:47'),
