  ('zcrm_1579374000013694009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822390', 'Lillian Chatham', NULL, '2-19-18 "I just went through the application process up to registering via Sedera. I received a text message about completing my primary profile but when I put in my phone number and a 8 numerical passcode, it says my phone number is invalid. I don''t believe I put it in wrong since I received a text message but maybe in the first part of the process it’s possible?




Lillian

