  ('zcrm_1579374000013694003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798088', 'Cynthia Herman', NULL, '2-19-18 John Oberg referred her but he''s not our client. She was put in touch with us via Sedera. She''s enrolling now. She might have to change the checking account info to John''s account if he''s going to pay for it. He''s her employer. Found the routing # from her husband and proceeding with app.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-02-19 11:14:04', '2018-02-19 11:28:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000013692009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809045', 'Walter Godber', NULL, 'John spoke to husband, Larry, wife has had vertigo for a little over a week, John advised that they utilize the Teledoc service, then Urgent care (he did pull up a number for them) and lastly ER-which will be determined at Urgent care. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-02-19 10:59:39', '2018-02-19 10:59:39'),
