  ('zcrm_1579374000013643033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822033', 'Barbara Beumee', NULL, '2-16-18 Super nice! Husband on Medicare. She''s 54. Rear ended 3x in last few years so has some shoulder issues that are now pretty well sorted out. She understands the pre-x clause. She''s on Medicaid right now but shouldn''t be. So, she''s super excited about HEP and we have enrollment date scheduled for Monday, Feb. 19th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-02-16 13:44:10', '2018-02-16 13:44:10'),
