  ('zcrm_1579374000013643021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590004', 'Isabel Graefin Von Rittberg', NULL, '2-16-18 Looks like she wound up enrolling on her own. I''m not sure if I gave her full explanation or not. I sent her all the information email #1, but not registration info. She seems to have gotten through it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-02-16 12:36:48', '2018-02-16 12:36:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000013643015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590042', 'Donald J. Hinz Jr.', NULL, '22-16-18 Enrolled on his own! :-)', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-02-16 12:33:54', '2018-02-16 12:33:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000013643009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590075', 'Jason Adams', NULL, '2-16-18 Sweet! Looks like completed app on his own!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-02-16 12:32:14', '2018-02-16 12:32:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000013643003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798088', 'Cynthia Herman', NULL, '2-16-18  Cindy is 57, husband, son 23 and 19. 23 year old is filing own taxes and no longer dependent. She''s bummed that he will have to pay for his own. That gets the cost a bit high. They are all healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco, meds, drugs or anything. Didn''t know how much plan was costing through previous employer. Was laid off in Mid-Jan. Her current employer is on the Board of Sedera.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-02-16 12:28:11', '2018-02-16 12:28:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000013640009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990282', 'Maryann Mcleod', NULL, 'Mary called to ask if she had any "Vision Insurance" , I told her that we do not offer that, but we do recommend and encourage our clients to use their HSA cards for services outside of just primary/preventative care and routine labs. KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-02-16 12:24:23', '2018-02-16 12:24:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000013640003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024204', 'Vipul Kumar', NULL, 'client called to ask about how to submit his primary Dr''s bill, I told him to hang on to it and to bring it up during the welcome call that he said he would schedule through the link that was sent to him just this past week. I also sent out the provider list so that he could see if his Dr was on the list.  KC', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2018-02-16 11:46:43', '2018-02-16 11:46:43'),
