  ('zcrm_1579374000013358035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013377044', 'Michael DeSocio', NULL, '2-12-18 Mike is super healthy. Just had a wart removed last year. No pre-x or any problems. Kaiser went up to $340 a month, no tobacco, no drugs. Chose the $1000 IUA and completed enrollment with me just now on phone. All set and he was easy and nice. Seemed to understand it all well. Self employed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-02-12 16:01:14', '2018-02-12 16:01:14'),
