  ('zcrm_1579374000013358013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001214017', 'Joe Morris', NULL, '2-12-18 Spoke with Joe to see status. He''s now waiting for LHS to send him a new link to fix account to be under his name now. Accounts are both fixed for the charges. He understands that part now. I told him Concierge reminded me must be member for 2 years for End of Life Assistance. She''s short about 15 days and I''m hoping they still honor it but wanted to give him the headas up in case they don''t. But, he has given them her death certificate already. Seems as if nothing else to do at this time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-02-12 12:48:37', '2018-02-12 12:48:37'),
