  ('zcrm_1579374000012946009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590075', 'Jason Adams', NULL, '2-1-18 Wanted a Feb. 1st start but missed the deadline. He is an engineer with corp ins. but got laid off and then went with Kaiser last year through C4. Now looking into Nextera and Kyra told his wife about Sedera. So they contacted Sedera directly and are not ready to offer to their employees yet but just for themselves. So, Luke sent them back to me. Wife is dentist with office across the way from Nextera. They looked into Liberty but didn''t like the extreme sports exclusion and were ok with the religious part but not thrilled. Going to run this by his wife and pretty certain they will move forward. Sent him the application instructions bc busy next week and thinks he can do it on his own. Told him discounted rate for DPC but not to quote me on price discount.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-02-01 16:05:38', '2018-02-01 16:05:38'),
