  ('zcrm_1579374000012942038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012379112', 'Paula Cole', NULL, '01.30.18:  Paula called - explained she didn''t recognize the MPB charge (thought is was supposed to be Sedera) and notified Amex not to pay it.  When she recvd. notice from MPB of cancellation, she reinstated the charge and paid it.  I called Patti to explain. Patti researched it and found her membership was not cancelled.  I asked Patti to send her an email confirming her membership re-instatment, which Patti said she would send.  I called Paula t let her know her start date is still 2/1/18 and she will be receiving an email from MPB as such.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2018-02-01 10:18:26', '2018-02-01 10:18:26'),
