  ('zcrm_1579374000012909055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012850560', 'Mary McCarthy', NULL, '1-31-18 Mary was bumped off of Transamerica/UHC at no fault of hers. She has outstanding bills and is trying to get it reinstated. Sent her a STM in case it''s not to protect her. She''s planning to apply tonight. Hopefully her PCOS and hypothyroid are not cause for rejection. Told her to apply right away so she can ensure start date of tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-01-31 16:48:10', '2018-01-31 16:48:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000012909049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012850488', 'Jeffrey Conley', NULL, '1-31-18 He''s super scared of it. Sounds too good to be true. His accountant isn''t sure how to verify it''s ACA compliant. He doesn''t believe a true group can include independent contractors or subcontractors since he''s been in the business years ago.  Once he heard the price he totally balked. He would have been a nightmare anyhow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-01-31 14:50:25', '2018-01-31 14:50:25'),
