  ('zcrm_1579374000012805039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233260', 'Brandy Echery', NULL, 'Brandy is healthy, has thyroid issue and herpes medicine. Otherwise rarely sees doctors. Her doctor wanted to run some tests as preventative measure. She didn''t want to bc of cost but Dr. told her to do as self-pay and not use ins. Then test cost went from $1200 down to $180! Once she understood that she decided that this program might be a much better solution. Enrolling now and going to verify with husband the IUA choice. Choosing $500/$599 since planning to try to get pregnant this year. She will hold off until March 1st so not considered pre-x. Uses Quail Creek Family Medicine with Dr. Leonard 80023 and is in network. Her Dr. retired though.  Stopped app when asked about pre-x so she can ask husband date of his knee surgery almost 3 years ago. She will try to complete tomorrow and let me know when done.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2018-01-26 15:03:29', '2018-01-26 15:23:56'),
